('Each rule acts at most once per thing per threshold — a call that breaches its SLA raises one alert at each tier, not one every five minutes. Thresholds are stored per rule, so changing “escalate after 10 minutes” to 15 needs no deployment. Every change and every manual run is written to the audit trail with your name on it.', 'zu', 'Umthetho ngamunye wenza kanye kuphela entweni ngayinye emkhawulweni ngamunye — ucingo oludlula i-SLA yalo luvusa isexwayiso esisodwa ezingeni ngalinye, hhayi esisodwa njalo emizuzwini emihlanu. Imikhawulo igcinwa ngomthetho ngamunye, ngakho ukushintsha ithi "khuphula ngemuva kwemizuzu eyi-10" kuye ku-15 akudingi kufakwa. Lonke ushintsho nakho konke ukuqhutshwa ngesandla kubhalwa emkhondweni wokucwaningwa negama lakho.'),
