('Every bodycam on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book one out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'zu', 'Yonke ikhamera yomzimba esekurejista, lapho igcinwa khona nokuthi ubani onayo manje. Izikhulu zikhipha eyodwa kuhlelo lokusebenza ekuqaleni kweshifu bese ziyibuyisa ngaphambi kokuthi ishifu iphele.'),
('Every change needs a reason and the {kind} typed back. Changes to SystemAdmin, Admin or SystemController also need a second SystemAdmin.', 'zu', 'Lonke ushintsho ludinga isizathu kanye no-{kind} obhalwe futhi. Izinguquko ku-SystemAdmin, Admin noma SystemController nazo zidinga i-SystemAdmin yesibili.'),
('Every change, from the audit trail.', 'zu', 'Lonke ushintsho, kusukela emkhondweni wokucwaningwa.'),
('Every check passed so far. Next visit due {date}.', 'zu', 'Zonke izinhlolo ziphumelele kuze kube manje. Ukuvakasha okulandelayo kulindelwe ngo-{date}.'),
('Every check passed. Next visit due {date}.', 'zu', 'Zonke izinhlolo ziphumelele. Ukuvakasha okulandelayo kulindelwe ngo-{date}.'),
('Every closed case: reviewed after its report, or closed without one by the desk, with who and why.', 'zu', 'Wonke amacala avaliwe: abuyekezwe ngemuva kombiko wawo, noma avalwe ngaphandle kwawo yideski, nokuthi ubani futhi kungani.'),
('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted with a blocking pop-up that must be acknowledged.', 'zu', 'Wonke amaqembu asemsebenzini ku-{desks} ayaxwayiswa ngesixwayiso esivimbayo okufanele samukelwe.'),
('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted.', 'zu', 'Wonke amaqembu asemsebenzini ku-{desks} ayaxwayiswa.'),
('Every crew out is on the Active Responders terminal', 'zu', 'Wonke amaqembu aphumile ase-Active Responders terminal'),
('Every crew still out, live. Open a row for the narrative and the timeline.', 'zu', 'Wonke amaqembu asaphumile, bukhoma. Vula umugqa ukuze ubone ukulandisa nomugqa wesikhathi.'),
('Every department', 'zu', 'Yonke iminyango'),
('Every external service HikTech talks to — what it powers, whether its credentials are present, and whether it currently answers.', 'zu', 'Yonke insizakalo yangaphandle i-HikTech ekhuluma nayo — lokho eyakunika amandla, nokuthi imininingwane yayo yokungena ikhona yini, nokuthi iyaphendula yini manje.'),
('Every feed shows a sample video, not the bodycam. Switch it off under Admin → Integrations → Hikvision once the platform is connected.', 'zu', 'Yonke imisakazo ibonisa ividiyo yesampula, hhayi ikhamera yomzimba. Kuvale ngaphansi kwe-Admin → Ukuxhumanisa → Hikvision uma iplatifomu isixhunyiwe.'),
('Every firearm on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book a firearm out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'zu', 'Sonke isibhamu esekurejista, lapho sigcinwa khona nokuthi ubani onaso manje. Izikhulu zikhipha isibhamu kuhlelo lokusebenza ekuqaleni kweshifu bese zisibuyisa ngaphambi kokuthi ishifu iphele.'),
('Every form', 'zu', 'Wonke amafomu'),
('Every hydrant is in service.', 'zu', 'Yonke ihayidrenti isebenza.'),
('Every knob has a safe built-in default and hard bounds; a value outside its bounds is clamped, and deleting an override falls back to the default. Every change is written to the audit trail with your name on it.', 'zu', 'Yonke inkinobho inokuzenzakalelayo okuphephile nemikhawulo eqinile; inani elingaphandle kwemikhawulo yalo liyanqunywa, futhi ukususa okushintshiwe kubuyela kokuzenzakalelayo. Lonke ushintsho lubhalwa emkhondweni wokucwaningwa negama lakho.'),
('Every leave or absence is captured under one of these codes. Office-only codes (AWOL, Suspended …) are never asked for by members.', 'zu', 'Lonke ikhefu noma ukungabikho kuthathwa ngaphansi kwenye yalezi zikhodi. Izikhodi zehhovisi kuphela (AWOL, Omisiwe …) azikaze zicelwe ngamalungu.'),
('Every logged call across your visible silos.', 'zu', 'Zonke izingcingo ezibhalisiwe eminyangweni yakho obonakalayo.'),
('Every member: numbers, rank, station, section, contacts and sign-in.', 'zu', 'Ilungu ngalinye: izinombolo, isikhundla, isiteshi, isigaba, abaxhumana nabo nokungena.'),
('Every milestone, update, evidence upload and audited action — from the first call{value}', 'zu', 'Zonke izigaba, izibuyekezo, ukulayishwa kobufakazi nezenzo ezicwaningiwe — kusukela ocingweni lokuqala{value}'),
('Every module on the platform — what your role and your organisation''s switches allow.', 'zu', 'Yonke imojula kuplatifomu — lokho indima yakho nezinkinobho zenhlangano yakho ezikuvumelayo.'),
('Every organisation on this deployment. Each tenant’s data, users, configuration and feature switches are isolated at the database — a row in one tenant does not exist for another, on any screen, in any export, in any search.', 'zu', 'Zonke izinhlangano kulokhu kufakwa. Idatha yomqashi ngamunye, abasebenzisi, ukuhlelwa nezinkinobho zezici kuhlukaniswe kudathabheyisi — umugqa womunye umqashi awukho komunye, kunoma yisiphi isikrini, kunoma yikuphi ukuthunyelwa ngaphandle, kunoma yikuphi ukusesha.'),
('Every place assessed on site, added up.', 'zu', 'Yonke indawo ehloliwe esizeni, ihlanganisiwe.'),
('Every police report. Search, filter, export, or open one to read it in full.', 'zu', 'Yonke imibiko yamaphoyisa. Sesha, hlunga, thumela ngaphandle, noma uvule owodwa ukuze uwufunde wonke.'),
('Every punch, newest first.', 'zu', 'Konke ukungena emsebenzini, okusha kuqala.'),
('Every recorded action on a case: who logged it, routed it, responded, filed the report and closed it. Audit rows are permanent.', 'zu', 'Zonke izenzo ezibhaliwe ecaleni: ubani olibhalile, oliqondisile, owasabela, owafaka umbiko nowalivala. Imigqa yokucwaningwa ihlala unomphela.'),
('Every report officers file, colour-coded by form. Choose where to go.', 'zu', 'Yonke imibiko izikhulu ezifaka yona, ihlukaniswe ngemibala ngefomu. Khetha lapho ufuna ukuya khona.'),
('Every section, from observations to sign-off.', 'zu', 'Zonke izigaba, kusukela ekuqapheleni kuya ekusayineni.'),
('Every site, what it is used for, its risk and when it is due.', 'zu', 'Yonke indawo, ukuthi isetshenziselwani, ingozi yayo nokuthi ifanele nini.'),
('Every stage', 'zu', 'Zonke izigaba'),
('Every vehicle is on the road.', 'zu', 'Zonke izimoto zisemgwaqweni.'),
('Every vehicle, who is driving it, its last inspection and licence disc. Officers choose a vehicle in the app at the start of a shift; one that fails its inspection comes off the road until it is returned to service here.', 'zu', 'Yonke imoto, ubani oyishayelayo, ukuhlolwa kwayo kokugcina nediski yelayisensi. Izikhulu zikhetha imoto kuhlelo lokusebenza ekuqaleni kweshifu; ehluleka ekuhlolweni iyakhishwa emgwaqweni kuze kube ibuyiselwa emsebenzini lapha.'),
('Everyone', 'zu', 'Wonke umuntu'),
('Everyone due has started.', 'zu', 'Bonke okufanele baqale sebeqalile.'),
('Everyone in each team gets their team''s shifts as drafts. Anyone on leave, booked for court or already on a shift is left out, with the reason below. Issue the drafts when you are happy.', 'zu', 'Wonke umuntu eqenjini ngalinye uthola amashifu eqembu lakhe njengezinhlaka. Noma ubani osekhefini, obhukelwe inkantolo noma osevele esemsebenzini uyashiywa, nesizathu ngezansi. Khipha izinhlaka uma usujabule.'),
