('The charge book has no amount for this offence yet. The record notes that you entered it.', 'zu', 'Incwadi yamacala ayikabi nalo inani kuleli cala. Irekhodi liphawula ukuthi nguwe owalifaka.'),
('The check did not work.', 'zu', 'Ukuhlola akusebenzanga.'),
('The clock register — append-only, corrections are new punches.', 'zu', 'Irejista yewashi — kungezwa kuphela, ukulungiswa kuyimigqa emisha.'),
('The command dashboard''s launcher honours these rules too.', 'zu', 'Isiqalisi sedeshibhodi yabaphathi naso siyayihlonipha le mithetho.'),
('The control room is viewing your bodycam', 'zu', 'Igumbi lokulawula libuka i-bodycam yakho'),
('The court date passed without payment: a warrant may be issued.', 'zu', 'Usuku lwenkantolo ludlule kungakhokhwanga: kungakhishwa iwaranti.'),
('The cycle every team works, a day at a time: shift codes ({value}) and a dash for a day off. Each team starts its cycle on a different day.', 'zu', 'Umjikelezo iqembu ngalinye elisebenza ngawo, usuku ngosuku: amakhodi eshifu ({value}) nedeshi yosuku lokuphumula. Iqembu ngalinye liqala umjikelezo walo ngosuku oluhlukile.'),
('The daily duty sheet for parade. Choose the section, the date and the operation, then print. Times members signed on or off in the app fill in.', 'zu', 'Iphepha lomsebenzi lansuku zonke lomphakathi wokuhlola. Khetha isigaba, usuku nomsebenzi, bese uphrinta. Izikhathi amalungu angena noma aphuma ngazo kuhlelo lokusebenza ziyagcwaliswa.'),
('The dashboard, leave, search and their own profile only.', 'zu', 'Ideshibhodi, ikhefu, ukusesha nephrofayela yabo kuphela.'),
('The data SIM in the bodycam', 'zu', 'I-SIM yedatha ku-bodycam'),
('The day the first team is on day one of the cycle.', 'zu', 'Usuku iqembu lokuqala elikusuku lokuqala lomjikelezo ngalo.'),
('The day’s sheet to print for parade: sign on, sign off and overtime.', 'zu', 'Iphepha losuku lokuphrinta lomphakathi wokuhlola: ukungena, ukuphuma nesikhathi esengeziwe.'),
('The department administrator sets shift types, rotations and the late minutes. You can put people in teams.', 'zu', 'Umlawuli womnyango usetha izinhlobo zamashifu, ukushintshana nemizuzu yokuphuza. Ungafaka abantu emaqenjini.'),
('The duty office screens. The systems controller decides who may open each one, and whether they may change it.', 'zu', 'Izikrini zehhovisi lomsebenzi. Umlawuli wamasistimu unquma ukuthi ubani ongavula ngasinye, nokuthi angasishintsha yini.'),
('The eThekwini Fire By-law checks, then what follows.', 'zu', 'Ukuhlola koMthetho Kamasipala Wezomlilo we-eThekwini, bese kulandela okulandelayo.'),
('The electronic vehicle inspection report has been finalised.', 'zu', 'Umbiko wokuhlolwa kwemoto nge-elekthronikhi uqediwe.'),
('The end date must not be before the start date.', 'zu', 'Usuku lokuphela akufanele lube ngaphambi kosuku lokuqala.'),
('The engine has not run yet.', 'zu', 'Injini ayikasebenzi okwamanje.'),
('The file is read on this computer. Nothing is saved until you confirm, and the file itself is never stored.', 'zu', 'Ifayela lifundwa kule khompyutha. Akukho okugcinwayo uze uqinisekise, futhi ifayela ngokwalo alikaze ligcinwe.'),
('The file is read on this computer. Nothing reaches HikTech until you confirm, and then only the rows you confirm. The file itself is never stored.', 'zu', 'Ifayela lifundwa kule khompyutha. Akukho okufika ku-HikTech uze uqinisekise, bese kufika kuphela imigqa oyiqinisekisayo. Ifayela ngokwalo alikaze ligcinwe.'),
('The fine shows on that incident’s record.', 'zu', 'Inhlawulo ivela erekhodini laleso sigameko.'),
('The firearm', 'zu', 'Isibhamu'),
('The firearm checklist is not enabled for your organisation.', 'zu', 'Uhlu lokuhlola lwesibhamu aluvulelwe inhlangano yakho.'),
('The firearm did not pass its inspection and has been marked for maintenance. Your inspection is on record. Select another firearm, or tick No firearm, to complete your start of shift.', 'zu', 'Isibhamu asiphumelelanga ekuhlolweni futhi simakwe ukuthi silungiswe. Ukuhlola kwakho kusemarekhodini. Khetha esinye isibhamu, noma umake u-Asikho isibhamu, ukuze uqede ukuqala kweshifu yakho.'),
('The firearm serial number is required.', 'zu', 'Inombolo ye-serial yesibhamu iyadingeka.'),
('The force number printed on the duty sheet.', 'zu', 'Inombolo yamandla ephrintwe ephepheni lomsebenzi.'),
('The heading the sheet prints under. The list is kept in Configuration.', 'zu', 'Isihloko iphepha eliphrintwa ngaphansi kwaso. Uhlu lugcinwa kuzilungiselelo.'),
('The incident record is closed.', 'zu', 'Irekhodi lesigameko livaliwe.'),
('The infringer refused to sign', 'zu', 'Owephule umthetho wenqabile ukusayina'),
('The inspection was filed. One or more essential checks failed, so the vehicle is off the road and your supervisor has been told. Choose another vehicle; this one comes back once fleet control returns it to service.', 'zu', 'Ukuhlola kufakiwe. Ukuhlola okukodwa noma ngaphezulu okubalulekile kwehlulekile, ngakho imoto ayisekho emgwaqweni futhi umphathi wakho utsheliwe. Khetha enye imoto; le iyabuya uma abaphathi bezimoto beyibuyisela emsebenzini.'),
('The inspection was filed. One or more essential checks failed, so {unit} is off the road and your supervisor has been told. Choose another vehicle; this one comes back once fleet control returns it to service.', 'zu', 'Ukuhlola kufakiwe. Ukuhlola okukodwa noma ngaphezulu okubalulekile kwehlulekile, ngakho i-{unit} ayisekho emgwaqweni futhi umphathi wakho utsheliwe. Khetha enye imoto; le iyabuya uma abaphathi bezimoto beyibuyisela emsebenzini.'),
('The last reading was {km} km. Check the odometer.', 'zu', 'Ukufunda kokugcina kwakungu-{km} km. Hlola i-odometer.'),
('The latest reports filed.', 'zu', 'Imibiko yakamuva efakiwe.'),
('The latest views of these bodycams, live or recorded, with the reason given. Every one is also in the audit log.', 'zu', 'Ukubukwa kwakamuva kwala ma-bodycam, okubukhoma noma okuqoshiwe, nesizathu esanikezwa. Ngakunye kukhona nakwilogi yokuhlola.'),
('The lead filed the report.', 'zu', 'Ohola wafaka umbiko.'),
('The ledger sets Paid and Partially Paid. Entries are never edited or deleted.', 'zu', 'Ileja isetha okuthi Kukhokhiwe nokuthi Kukhokhwe Ingxenye. Okufakiwe akukaze kuhlelwe noma kususwe.'),
('The list of absence types used for leave and on the duty sheet.', 'zu', 'Uhlu lwezinhlobo zokungabikho ezisetshenziselwa ikhefu nasephepheni lomsebenzi.'),
('The list of absence types: AL, SL, AWOL and the rest.', 'zu', 'Uhlu lwezinhlobo zokungabikho: AL, SL, AWOL nezinye.'),
('The map could not load. Check your connection.', 'zu', 'Ibalazwe alikwazanga ukulayisha. Hlola ukuxhumana kwakho.'),
('The money that moves against fines and charges — {length} entries, net R{fixed}.', 'zu', 'Imali ehamba ngokumelene nezinhlawulo namacala — okufakiwe okungu-{length}, isamba esiphelele ngu-R{fixed}.'),
('The municipality''s crest: it also appears on report PDFs, report screens in the app and the menu. Use a PNG for the PDFs.', 'zu', 'Uphawu lukamasipala: luphinde luvele kuma-PDF ombiko, ezikrinini zombiko kuhlelo lokusebenza nakumenyu. Sebenzisa i-PNG yama-PDF.'),
('The notice could not be saved on this phone.', 'zu', 'Isaziso asikwazanga ukugcinwa kule foni.'),
('The number this member is found by everywhere in the system.', 'zu', 'Inombolo leli lungu elitholakala ngayo yonke indawo ohlelweni.'),
('The only vehicle is taken. You can continue your shift without one.', 'zu', 'Ukuphela kwemoto ithathiwe. Ungaqhubeka neshifu yakho ngaphandle kwayo.'),
('The operational areas that appear beside every officer on the duty board — NR, DR, B, CH…', 'zu', 'Izindawo zokusebenza ezivela eceleni kwesikhulu ngasinye ebhodini lomsebenzi — NR, DR, B, CH…'),
('The organisation must keep at least {value}. Until it has them, the current SystemAdmin cannot be demoted or deactivated, and if they are unavailable nobody can manage accounts. A new SystemAdmin needs a second approval; with nobody else to give it, the SuperAdmin decides.', 'zu', 'Inhlangano kufanele igcine okungenani ama-{value}. Kuze kube nawo, i-SystemAdmin yamanje ayikwazi ukwehliswa noma ukuvalwa, futhi uma ingatholakali akekho ongaphatha ama-akhawunti. I-SystemAdmin entsha idinga imvume yesibili; uma kungekho omunye ongayinikeza, i-SuperAdmin iyanquma.'),
('The overtime code this section books overtime against.', 'zu', 'Ikhodi yesikhathi esengeziwe lesi sigaba esibhuka ngayo isikhathi esengeziwe.'),
('The patient', 'zu', 'Isiguli'),
('The photo on the incident is filed with this report.', 'zu', 'Isithombe esisesigamekweni sifakwa nalo mbiko.'),
('The photo was not saved. Try again.', 'zu', 'Isithombe asigcinwanga. Zama futhi.'),
('The pin is in the wrong place', 'zu', 'Iphini isendaweni engalungile'),
('The platform sent an insecure (http) stream address, which the browser may refuse. Ask Hikvision to stream over HTTPS.', 'zu', 'Uhlelo luthumele ikheli lokusakaza elingavikelekile (http), isiphequluli esingalenqaba. Cela i-Hikvision ukuthi isakaze nge-HTTPS.'),
('The queue is clear.', 'zu', 'Ulayini usula.'),
('The radio always comes back to HikTech, after a restart too.', 'zu', 'Irediyo ihlala ibuyela ku-HikTech, nangemva kokuqalisa kabusha.'),
('The rank this call sign needs, e.g. ST for the sergeant in charge.', 'zu', 'Isikhundla esidingwa yilolu phawu lwekholi, isib. ST kasayitsheni ophethe.'),
('The recipient also gets a low-priority alert, phone included.', 'zu', 'Lowo othunyelwayo naye uthola isexwayiso esingabalulekile kakhulu, nasefonini.'),
('The record you''re looking for doesn''t exist or you don''t have access to it.', 'zu', 'Irekhodi olifunayo alikho noma awunakho ukufinyelela kulo.'),
('The recording produced no audio.', 'zu', 'Ukuqopha akuzange kukhiqize umsindo.'),
('The register is not set up yet. Run migration 0101 in Supabase, then reload.', 'zu', 'Irejista ayikasethwa okwamanje. Qalisa i-migration 0101 ku-Supabase, bese ulayisha kabusha.'),
('The register refused this notice: {reason}. Fix it by issuing a corrected notice; this one stays in the sync tray until you discard it.', 'zu', 'Irejista yenqabe lesi saziso: {reason}. Kulungise ngokukhipha isaziso esilungisiwe; lesi sihlala ethreyini lokuthumela uze usilahle.'),
('The report cannot be filed yet:', 'zu', 'Umbiko awukakwazi ukufakwa okwamanje:'),
('The report is filed. Its forms show here once it has reached the server.', 'zu', 'Umbiko ufakiwe. Amafomu awo avela lapha uma usufike kuseva.'),
('The report on {incident_number} becomes a permanent record — it cannot be edited or deleted afterwards.', 'zu', 'Umbiko ku-{incident_number} uba yirekhodi elihlala njalo — awukwazi ukuhlelwa noma ukususwa ngemva kwalokho.'),
('The reports', 'zu', 'Imibiko'),
('The request to send with it', 'zu', 'Isicelo sokuthumela nakho'),
('The rules are installed and correct, but no scheduler is ticking them, so no escalation will fire on its own. Either enable', 'zu', 'Imithetho ifakiwe futhi ilungile, kodwa asikho isihleli esiyiqhubayo, ngakho akukho ukudluliselwa phezulu okuzokwenzeka ngokwako. Noma vula'),
('The same response metrics at every level — organisation, department, area and member. Drill in; the definitions never change, only the calls they cover.', 'zu', 'Izilinganiso zokuphendula ezifanayo kuwo wonke amazinga — inhlangano, umnyango, indawo nelungu. Gxila ngaphakathi; izincazelo azishintshi, kuphela izingcingo ezizimbozayo.'),
('The same screens and powers as now.', 'zu', 'Izikrini namandla afanayo nanamuhla.'),
('The same window cut three ways — by member, by department, by incident type.', 'zu', 'Isikhathi esifanayo sihlukaniswe ngezindlela ezintathu — ngelungu, ngomnyango, ngohlobo lwesigameko.'),
('The scene', 'zu', 'Indawo yesigameko'),
('The secret is kept safe and never shown again.', 'zu', 'Imfihlo igcinwa iphephile futhi ayiphinde iboniswe.'),
('The server refused it. SMS or call the control room now.', 'zu', 'Iseva iyenqabile. Thumela i-SMS noma ushayele igumbi lokulawula manje.'),
('The server took too long to answer. Check your connection and try again.', 'zu', 'Iseva ithathe isikhathi eside kakhulu ukuphendula. Hlola ukuxhumana kwakho bese uzama futhi.'),
('The shift types, rotations and teams the planner repeats.', 'zu', 'Izinhlobo zamashifu, ukushintshana namaqembu umhleli awaphindaphindayo.'),
('The site is compliant.', 'zu', 'Isiza siyahambisana nemithetho.'),
('The staff register is empty. Import HR’s staff list first.', 'zu', 'Irejista yabasebenzi ayinalutho. Ngenisa uhlu lwabasebenzi lwe-HR kuqala.'),
('The station the call sign works from.', 'zu', 'Isiteshi uphawu lwekholi olusebenza kuso.'),
('The talk button talks on your team’s group; the SOS button raises an SOS. Most radios work without setting up. If a button does nothing, teach it here.', 'zu', 'Inkinobho yokukhuluma ikhuluma eqenjini lakho; inkinobho ye-SOS iphakamisa i-SOS. Amarediyo amaningi asebenza ngaphandle kokusethwa. Uma inkinobho ingenzi lutho, yifundise lapha.'),
('The team a rotation rosters (A, B, C, D or Red, Blue, Green).', 'zu', 'Iqembu ukushintshana okulifaka ohlwini (A, B, C, D noma Okubomvu, Okuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka, Okuluhlaza).'),
('The two PINs are not the same. Enter your new PIN again.', 'zu', 'Ama-PIN amabili awafani. Faka i-PIN yakho entsha futhi.'),
('The units duty is given to, and the stations they work from.', 'zu', 'Amayunithi anikezwa umsebenzi, neziteshi asebenza kuzo.'),
('The vehicle, item by item: OK, Fault or NIL.', 'zu', 'Imoto, into ngayinye: KULUNGILE, Iphutha noma AKUKHO.'),
('The yearly entitlement shown on leave balances. Empty for none.', 'zu', 'Ilungelo lonyaka eliboniswa kumabhalansi ekhefu. Akunalutho uma lingekho.'),
('The {unitWord} goes for maintenance and your supervisor is told.', 'zu', 'I-{unitWord} iya ekulungisweni futhi umphathi wakho uyatshelwa.'),
('Theft', 'zu', 'Ukweba'),
('Theft of motor vehicle', 'zu', 'Ukwebiwa kwemoto'),
('Their age?', 'zu', 'Iminyaka yabo?'),
('Their condition', 'zu', 'Isimo sabo'),
('Their invitation goes here.', 'zu', 'Isimemo sabo siya lapha.'),
('Their vehicle and registration', 'zu', 'Imoto yabo nokubhaliswa'),
('Theme', 'zu', 'Isitayela'),
('Then add its call signs on Call Signs.', 'zu', 'Bese wengeza izimpawu zalo zekholi ku-Izimpawu Zekholi.'),
('These are safe for media and community distribution.', 'zu', 'Lokhu kuphephile kwabezindaba nokwabiwa emphakathini.'),
('These email addresses and cellphone numbers come from HR’s staff list.', 'zu', 'La makheli e-imeyili nezinombolo zamaselula avela ohlwini lwabasebenzi lwe-HR.'),
('They accept, then your supervisor approves. Until then your shift stays yours.', 'zu', 'Bayamukela, bese umphathi wakho evuma. Kuze kube yilapho ishifu yakho ihlala ingeyakho.'),
('They are handed back when you end your shift.', 'zu', 'Ziyabuyiselwa uma uqeda ishifu yakho.'),
('They come off duty and off rosters straight away.', 'zu', 'Baphuma emsebenzini nasohlwini ngokushesha.'),
('They go back on rosters, and on duty only after their next start of shift.', 'zu', 'Babuyela ohlwini, nasemsebenzini kuphela ngemva kokuqala kweshifu yabo elandelayo.'),
('This account has been deactivated. If you think this is a mistake, speak to your station commander or system administrator.', 'zu', 'Le akhawunti ivaliwe. Uma ucabanga ukuthi kuyiphutha, khuluma nomphathi wesiteshi sakho noma umlawuli wesistimu.'),
('This account holds a powerful role, so a second SystemAdmin must approve. Nothing changes until they do.', 'zu', 'Le akhawunti inendima enamandla, ngakho i-SystemAdmin yesibili kufanele ivume. Akukho okushintshayo baze bavume.'),
('This bodycam will not be issued', 'zu', 'Le bodycam ngeke ikhishwe'),
('This build has no push service configured, so alerts arrive only while the app is open. Report it to your system administrator before carrying this handset on shift.', 'zu', 'Lolu hlelo alunayo insizakalo yezaziso esethiwe, ngakho izexwayiso zifika kuphela uma uhlelo lokusebenza luvuliwe. Bika lokhu kumlawuli wesistimu ngaphambi kokuphatha le foni eshifini.'),
('This build has no web address configured, so accounts cannot be activated in the app. Use the link on the HikTech website, or ask an administrator to set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.', 'zu', 'Lolu hlelo alunalo ikheli lewebhu elisethiwe, ngakho ama-akhawunti awakwazi ukuvulwa kuhlelo lokusebenza. Sebenzisa isixhumanisi kuwebhusayithi ye-HikTech, noma ucele umlawuli ukuthi asethe i-EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.'),
('This build has no web address configured, so features that run on the server are unavailable. An administrator needs to set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.', 'zu', 'Lolu hlelo alunalo ikheli lewebhu elisethiwe, ngakho izici ezisebenza kuseva azitholakali. Umlawuli udinga ukusetha i-EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.'),
('This build has no web address configured.', 'zu', 'Lolu hlelo alunalo ikheli lewebhu elisethiwe.'),
('This call has no map position. Mark On Scene when you get there.', 'zu', 'Lolu cingo alunayo indawo ebalazweni. Maka u-Usendaweni lapho ufika khona.'),
('This cannot be undone. Press again to go ahead.', 'zu', 'Lokhu akunakuhlehliswa. Cindezela futhi ukuze uqhubeke.'),
('This checklist will file as NOT PASSED until every safety item above is ticked. The record cannot claim otherwise.', 'zu', 'Lolu hlu lokuhlola luzofakwa njengokuthi AKUPHUMELELANGA kuze kube yilapho zonke izinto zokuphepha ezingenhla zimakiwe. Irekhodi alikwazi ukusho okunye.'),
('This code can’t be used', 'zu', 'Le khodi ayikwazi ukusetshenziswa'),
('This code is shown', 'zu', 'Le khodi iboniswa'),
('This cycle', 'zu', 'Lo mjikelezo'),
('This device belongs to another department. Use one of your own department''s devices, or sign in with your password.', 'zu', 'Le divayisi ingeyomunye umnyango. Sebenzisa enye yamadivayisi omnyango wakho, noma ungene ngephasiwedi yakho.'),
('This device is no longer registered for PIN sign-in. Sign in with your password, and ask your supervisor to register it again.', 'zu', 'Le divayisi ayisabhalisiwe ekungeneni nge-PIN. Ngena ngephasiwedi yakho, bese ucela umphathi wakho ukuthi ayibhalise futhi.'),
('This device is not registered for PIN sign-in. Your supervisor registers shared radios and phones.', 'zu', 'Le divayisi ayibhalisiwe ekungeneni nge-PIN. Umphathi wakho ubhalisa amarediyo namafoni okwabelana.'),
('This device is not set up for PIN sign-in yet. A supervisor or administrator sets it up once: sign in with a password, open Profile, then Sign-in PIN, then Register this device.', 'zu', 'Le divayisi ayikasethelwa ukungena nge-PIN. Umphathi noma umlawuli uyisetha kanye: ngena ngephasiwedi, vula iPhrofayela, bese u-PIN Yokungena, bese u-Bhalisa le divayisi.'),
('This device is registered for PIN sign-in: {device}', 'zu', 'Le divayisi ibhaliswe ukungena nge-PIN: {device}'),
('This device no longer signs anyone in with a PIN.', 'zu', 'Le divayisi ayisamngenisi muntu nge-PIN.'),
('This feed stops in {secondsToAnswer} s to save the bodycam’s mobile data.', 'zu', 'Lokhu kusakaza kuyama ngemizuzwana engu-{secondsToAnswer} ukonga idatha yeselula ye-bodycam.'),
('This firearm will not be issued', 'zu', 'Lesi sibhamu ngeke sikhishwe'),
('This import changes nothing about them. They may have left: review them on the Personnel page afterwards.', 'zu', 'Lokhu kungenisa akushintshi lutho ngabo. Kungenzeka ukuthi bashiyile: babuyekeze ekhasini Labasebenzi ngemva kwalokho.'),
('This is a {severity} call. The {desks} dispatch desk can start now with what you have.', 'zu', 'Lolu wucingo lwe-{severity}. Ideski lokuthumela le-{desks} lingaqala manje ngalokho onakho.'),
('This is a {severity} call. The {desks} dispatch desks can start now with what you have.', 'zu', 'Lolu wucingo lwe-{severity}. Amadeski okuthumela e-{desks} angaqala manje ngalokho onakho.'),
('This is your SOS — dispatch is sending help to you.', 'zu', 'Le yi-SOS yakho — abathumeli bathumela usizo kuwe.'),
('This list covers {join}. People in those departments it leaves out are shown for review; nobody is removed.', 'zu', 'Lolu hlu luhlanganisa {join}. Abantu abasemnyangweni lowo olushiyayo baboniswa ukuze babuyekezwe; akekho osuswayo.'),
('This member has no account yet, so they cannot be given screens.', 'zu', 'Leli lungu alikabi ne-akhawunti, ngakho alikwazi ukunikezwa izikrini.'),
('This month', 'zu', 'Le nyanga'),
('This month: 1 shift', 'zu', 'Le nyanga: ishifu engu-1'),
('This month: {n} shifts', 'zu', 'Le nyanga: amashifu angu-{n}'),
('This needs the latest app. Install it, then come back here.', 'zu', 'Lokhu kudinga uhlelo lokusebenza lwakamuva. Lufake, bese ubuyela lapha.'),
('This page hit an error', 'zu', 'Leli khasi lihlangabezane nephutha'),
('This page shows calls sent to you yourself, as a field officer sees them.', 'zu', 'Leli khasi libonisa izingcingo ezithunyelwe kuwe uqobo, njengoba isikhulu sasensimini sizibona.'),
('This phone could not be registered for dispatch notifications. Alerts still arrive while the app is open — report this so the handset can be checked.', 'zu', 'Le foni ayikwazanga ukubhaliselwa izaziso zokuthumela. Izexwayiso zisafika uma uhlelo lokusebenza luvuliwe — bika lokhu ukuze le foni ihlolwe.'),
('This phone will not ring for a dispatch. Turn notifications on for HikTech in the device settings. Alerts still arrive instantly while the app is open.', 'zu', 'Le foni ngeke ikhale uma kuthunyelwa. Vula izaziso ze-HikTech kuzilungiselelo zedivayisi. Izexwayiso zisafika ngokushesha uma uhlelo lokusebenza luvuliwe.'),
('This radio is off.', 'zu', 'Le rediyo icishiwe.'),
('This request is about your account, so another SystemAdmin decides it.', 'zu', 'Lesi sicelo simayelana ne-akhawunti yakho, ngakho enye i-SystemAdmin iyasinquma.'),
('This role cannot be made with a password: choose email, SMS or a printed code', 'zu', 'Le ndima ayikwazi ukwenziwa ngephasiwedi: khetha i-imeyili, i-SMS noma ikhodi ephrintiwe'),
('This section has no call signs yet.', 'zu', 'Lesi sigaba asikabi nazo izimpawu zekholi.'),
('This week', 'zu', 'Leli sonto'),
('This {file} already holds {MAX_PHOTOS} photos — the maximum.', 'zu', 'Le-{file} isivele inezithombe ezingu-{MAX_PHOTOS} — inani eliphezulu.'),
('Throughput for a control-room role''s members — distinct from field-officer scoring.', 'zu', 'Umsebenzi owenziwe ngamalungu endima yegumbi lokulawula — kuhlukile ekuhlolweni kwezikhulu zasensimini.'),
('Thu', 'zu', 'Lwesi-4'),
('Thursday', 'zu', 'ULwesine'),
('Thursday, first letterT', 'zu', 'L'),
('Tick at least one call sign and one member', 'zu', 'Maka okungenani uphawu lwekholi olulodwa nelungu elilodwa'),
('Tick call signs and staff above, then Allocate selected.', 'zu', 'Maka izimpawu zekholi nabasebenzi ngenhla, bese u-Abela okukhethiwe.'),
('Tick the box: you checked the address and will give the password yourself', 'zu', 'Maka ibhokisi: uhlolile ikheli futhi uzonikeza iphasiwedi wena'),
