('Every bodycam on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book one out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'xh', 'Yonke ikhamera yomzimba ekwirejista, apho igcinwa khona nokuba ngubani onayo ngoku. Amagosa akhupha enye kwi-app ekuqaleni kweshifti aze ayibuyise phambi kokuba ishifti iphele.'),
('Every change needs a reason and the {kind} typed back. Changes to SystemAdmin, Admin or SystemController also need a second SystemAdmin.', 'xh', 'Lonke utshintsho lufuna isizathu kunye ne-{kind} ebhalwe kwakhona. Utshintsho kwi-SystemAdmin, Admin okanye SystemController lukwafuna i-SystemAdmin yesibini.'),
('Every change, from the audit trail.', 'xh', 'Lonke utshintsho, ukusuka kumkhondo wophicotho.'),
('Every check passed so far. Next visit due {date}.', 'xh', 'Zonke iinhlolo ziphumelele okwangoku. Utyelelo olulandelayo lulindeleke nge-{date}.'),
('Every check passed. Next visit due {date}.', 'xh', 'Zonke iinhlolo ziphumelele. Utyelelo olulandelayo lulindeleke nge-{date}.'),
('Every closed case: reviewed after its report, or closed without one by the desk, with who and why.', 'xh', 'Onke amatyala avaliweyo: aphononongwe emva kwengxelo yawo, okanye avalwe ngaphandle kwayo yidesika, nokuba ngubani kwaye kutheni.'),
('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted with a blocking pop-up that must be acknowledged.', 'xh', 'Onke amaqela asemsebenzini kwi-{desks} alunyukiswa ngesilumkiso esivalayo ekufuneka samkelwe.'),
('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted.', 'xh', 'Onke amaqela asemsebenzini kwi-{desks} ayalunyukiswa.'),
('Every crew out is on the Active Responders terminal', 'xh', 'Onke amaqela aphumileyo akwi-Active Responders terminal'),
('Every crew still out, live. Open a row for the narrative and the timeline.', 'xh', 'Onke amaqela asephumile, ngqo. Vula umqolo ukuze ubone ingxelo nomgca wexesha.'),
('Every department', 'xh', 'Onke amasebe'),
('Every external service HikTech talks to — what it powers, whether its credentials are present, and whether it currently answers.', 'xh', 'Yonke inkonzo yangaphandle i-HikTech ethetha nayo — oko ikunika amandla, nokuba iinkcukacha zayo zokungena zikhona, nokuba iyaphendula ngoku.'),
('Every feed shows a sample video, not the bodycam. Switch it off under Admin → Integrations → Hikvision once the platform is connected.', 'xh', 'Yonke inkqubo yosasazo ibonisa ividiyo yesampuli, ingeyiyo ikhamera yomzimba. Yicime phantsi kwe-Admin → Unxibelelwano → Hikvision xa iqonga sele linxibelelene.'),
('Every firearm on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book a firearm out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'xh', 'Wonke umpu okwirejista, apho ugcinwa khona nokuba ngubani onawo ngoku. Amagosa akhupha umpu kwi-app ekuqaleni kweshifti aze awubuyise phambi kokuba ishifti iphele.'),
('Every form', 'xh', 'Yonke ifomu'),
('Every hydrant is in service.', 'xh', 'Yonke i-hydrant iyasebenza.'),
('Every knob has a safe built-in default and hard bounds; a value outside its bounds is clamped, and deleting an override falls back to the default. Every change is written to the audit trail with your name on it.', 'xh', 'Yonke iqhosha inokuzenzekelayo okukhuselekileyo nemida eqinileyo; ixabiso elingaphandle kwemida yalo liyanqunyulwa, kwaye ukucima ukutshintshwa kubuyela kokuzenzekelayo. Lonke utshintsho lubhalwa kumkhondo wophicotho negama lakho.'),
('Every leave or absence is captured under one of these codes. Office-only codes (AWOL, Suspended …) are never asked for by members.', 'xh', 'Lonke ikhefu okanye ukungabikho kuthathwa phantsi kwenye yezi khowudi. Iikhowudi zeofisi kuphela (AWOL, Zinqunyanyisiwe …) azisoze zicelwe ngamalungu.'),
('Every logged call across your visible silos.', 'xh', 'Yonke iminxeba ebhalisiweyo kumasebe akho obonakalayo.'),
('Every member: numbers, rank, station, section, contacts and sign-in.', 'xh', 'Ilungu ngalinye: iinombolo, isikhundla, isikhululo, icandelo, oqhagamshelana nabo nokungena.'),
('Every milestone, update, evidence upload and audited action — from the first call{value}', 'xh', 'Yonke into ebalulekileyo, uhlaziyo, ukulayishwa kobungqina nezenzo ezaphicothwayo — ukusuka kumnxeba wokuqala{value}'),
('Every module on the platform — what your role and your organisation''s switches allow.', 'xh', 'Yonke imodyuli kwiqonga — oko indima yakho nezitshixo zombutho wakho zikuvumelayo.'),
('Every organisation on this deployment. Each tenant’s data, users, configuration and feature switches are isolated at the database — a row in one tenant does not exist for another, on any screen, in any export, in any search.', 'xh', 'Yonke imibutho kolu fakelo. Idatha yomqeshi ngamnye, abasebenzisi, ulungiselelo nezitshixo zezinto zahlukaniswe kwisiseko sedatha — umqolo womnye umqeshi awukho komnye, kuso nasiphi na isikrini, kuko nakuphi na ukuthumela, kuko nakuphi na ukukhangela.'),
('Every place assessed on site, added up.', 'xh', 'Yonke indawo ehloliweyo endaweni, idityanisiwe.'),
('Every police report. Search, filter, export, or open one to read it in full.', 'xh', 'Zonke iingxelo zamapolisa. Khangela, hluza, thumela ngaphandle, okanye uvule enye uyifunde yonke.'),
('Every punch, newest first.', 'xh', 'Konke ukungena emsebenzini, okutsha kuqala.'),
('Every recorded action on a case: who logged it, routed it, responded, filed the report and closed it. Audit rows are permanent.', 'xh', 'Zonke izenzo ezibhaliweyo kwityala: ngubani olibhaleyo, olalathisileyo, ophendulileyo, ongenise ingxelo nolivalileyo. Imiqolo yophicotho isisigxina.'),
('Every report officers file, colour-coded by form. Choose where to go.', 'xh', 'Yonke ingxelo engeniswa ngamagosa, yahlulwe ngemibala ngokwefomu. Khetha apho ufuna ukuya khona.'),
('Every section, from observations to sign-off.', 'xh', 'Onke amacandelo, ukusuka kwiimbono ukuya ekutyikityeni.'),
('Every site, what it is used for, its risk and when it is due.', 'xh', 'Yonke indawo, ukuba isetyenziselwa ntoni, ingozi yayo nokuba ifanele nini.'),
('Every stage', 'xh', 'Onke amanqanaba'),
('Every vehicle is on the road.', 'xh', 'Zonke izithuthi zisendleleni.'),
('Every vehicle, who is driving it, its last inspection and licence disc. Officers choose a vehicle in the app at the start of a shift; one that fails its inspection comes off the road until it is returned to service here.', 'xh', 'Sonke isithuthi, ngubani osiqhubayo, uhlolo lwaso lokugqibela nediski yelayisensi. Amagosa akhetha isithuthi kwi-app ekuqaleni kweshifti; esingaphumeleli kuhlolo sikhutshwa endleleni de sibuyiselwe emsebenzini apha.'),
('Everyone', 'xh', 'Wonke umntu'),
('Everyone due has started.', 'xh', 'Bonke ababefanele baqale sebeqalile.'),
('Everyone in each team gets their team''s shifts as drafts. Anyone on leave, booked for court or already on a shift is left out, with the reason below. Issue the drafts when you are happy.', 'xh', 'Wonke umntu kwiqela ngalinye ufumana iishifti zeqela lakhe njengoyilo. Nabani na osekhefini, obhukishelwe inkundla okanye osele ekwishifti uyashiywa, nesizathu ngezantsi. Khupha uyilo xa wanelisekile.'),
('Everyone in the window', 'xh', 'Wonke umntu kweli xesha'),
('Everyone inside must leave.', 'xh', 'Wonke umntu ongaphakathi kufuneka aphume.'),
('Everyone is allocated.', 'xh', 'Wonke umntu wabelwe.'),
('Everything an administrator needs to answer “is the platform working”, in one place. Each check says what it means, not just what it measured.', 'xh', 'Konke umlawuli akufunayo ukuze aphendule "ngaba iqonga liyasebenza", kwindawo enye. Uvavanyo ngalunye luxela okuthethwa lulo, kungekhona nje oko lukulinganisileyo.'),
