('The account is active as soon as you create it. You will know {value} password, and they do not confirm their badge number or accept the POPIA notice. Use an invitation where you can.', 'xh', 'I-akhawunti iyasebenza ngoko nangoko xa uyenza. Uya kuyazi iphasiwedi ka-{value}, kwaye abaqinisekisi inombolo yebheji yabo okanye bamkele isaziso se-POPIA. Sebenzisa isimemo apho kunokwenzeka.'),
