('The camera registry (for the live map layer) is empty. It fills from the i-traffic API once SANRAL issues a key (', 'xh', 'Irejista yeekhamera (yomaleko wemephu ephilayo) ayinanto. Izaliswa ukusuka kwi-API ye-i-traffic xa i-SANRAL ikhupha isitshixo ('),
('The camera’s code on the Hikvision platform (cameraIndexCode). Live video needs it.', 'xh', 'Ikhowudi yekhamera kwiqonga le-Hikvision (cameraIndexCode). Ividiyo ephilayo iyayifuna.'),
('The case file is closed.', 'xh', 'Ifayile yetyala ivaliwe.'),
('The charge book has no amount for this offence yet. The record notes that you entered it.', 'xh', 'Incwadi yezityholo ayinaso isixa kweli tyala okwangoku. Irekhodi liphawula ukuba nguwe owasifakayo.'),
('The check did not work.', 'xh', 'Uhlolo alusebenzanga.'),
('The clock register — append-only, corrections are new punches.', 'xh', 'Irejista yewotshi — kongezwa kuphela, ulungiso lungeniso olutsha.'),
('The command dashboard''s launcher honours these rules too.', 'xh', 'Isiqalisi sedeshibhodi yabaphathi naso siyayihlonipha le mithetho.'),
('The control room is viewing your bodycam', 'xh', 'Igumbi lolawulo lijonga i-bodycam yakho'),
('The court date passed without payment: a warrant may be issued.', 'xh', 'Umhla wenkundla udlule kungahlawulwanga: kunokukhutshwa umyalelo wokubamba.'),
('The cycle every team works, a day at a time: shift codes ({value}) and a dash for a day off. Each team starts its cycle on a different day.', 'xh', 'Umjikelo iqela ngalinye elisebenza ngawo, usuku ngosuku: iikhowudi zeshifti ({value}) nedeshi yosuku lokuphumla. Iqela ngalinye liqala umjikelo walo ngosuku olwahlukileyo.'),
('The daily duty sheet for parade. Choose the section, the date and the operation, then print. Times members signed on or off in the app fill in.', 'xh', 'Iphepha lomsebenzi lemihla ngemihla lomngcelele. Khetha icandelo, umhla nomsebenzi, uze ushicilele. Amaxesha amalungu angene okanye aphume ngawo kwi-app ayazaliswa.'),
('The dashboard, leave, search and their own profile only.', 'xh', 'Ideshibhodi, ikhefu, ukukhangela neprofayile yabo kuphela.'),
('The data SIM in the bodycam', 'xh', 'I-SIM yedatha kwi-bodycam'),
('The day the first team is on day one of the cycle.', 'xh', 'Umhla iqela lokuqala elikusuku lokuqala lomjikelo ngawo.'),
('The day’s sheet to print for parade: sign on, sign off and overtime.', 'xh', 'Iphepha losuku lokushicilela lomngcelele: ukungena, ukuphuma nexesha elongezelelweyo.'),
('The department administrator sets shift types, rotations and the late minutes. You can put people in teams.', 'xh', 'Umlawuli wesebe useta iintlobo zeeshifti, ujikelezo nemizuzu yokufika emva kwexesha. Unokufaka abantu kumaqela.'),
('The duty office screens. The systems controller decides who may open each one, and whether they may change it.', 'xh', 'Izikrini zeofisi yomsebenzi. Umlawuli weenkqubo ugqiba ukuba ngubani onokuvula nganye, nokuba angayitshintsha na.'),
('The eThekwini Fire By-law checks, then what follows.', 'xh', 'Uhlolo loMthetho kaMasipala woMlilo we-eThekwini, emva koko okulandelayo.'),
('The electronic vehicle inspection report has been finalised.', 'xh', 'Ingxelo yohlolo lwesithuthi ngombane igqityiwe.'),
('The end date must not be before the start date.', 'xh', 'Umhla wokuphela akufanele ube phambi komhla wokuqala.'),
('The engine has not run yet.', 'xh', 'Injini ayikaqhubi okwangoku.'),
('The file is read on this computer. Nothing is saved until you confirm, and the file itself is never stored.', 'xh', 'Ifayile ifundwa kule khompyutha. Akukho nto igcinwayo de uqinisekise, kwaye ifayile ngokwayo ayizange igcinwe.'),
('The file is read on this computer. Nothing reaches HikTech until you confirm, and then only the rows you confirm. The file itself is never stored.', 'xh', 'Ifayile ifundwa kule khompyutha. Akukho nto ifika kwi-HikTech de uqinisekise, kwaye ke kufika kuphela imiqolo oyiqinisekisayo. Ifayile ngokwayo ayizange igcinwe.'),
('The fine shows on that incident’s record.', 'xh', 'Isohlwayo sivela kwirekhodi yeso siganeko.'),
('The firearm', 'xh', 'Umpu'),
('The firearm checklist is not enabled for your organisation.', 'xh', 'Uluhlu lokujonga lompu aluvulelwanga umbutho wakho.'),
('The firearm did not pass its inspection and has been marked for maintenance. Your inspection is on record. Select another firearm, or tick No firearm, to complete your start of shift.', 'xh', 'Umpu awuphumelelanga kuhlolo kwaye uphawulwe ukuba ulungiswe. Uhlolo lwakho lukwirekhodi. Khetha omnye umpu, okanye uphawule u-Akukho mpu, ukuze ugqibe ukuqala kweshifti yakho.'),
('The firearm serial number is required.', 'xh', 'Inombolo ye-serial yompu iyafuneka.'),
('The force number printed on the duty sheet.', 'xh', 'Inombolo yomkhosi eshicilelwe kwiphepha lomsebenzi.'),
('The heading the sheet prints under. The list is kept in Configuration.', 'xh', 'Isihloko iphepha elishicilelwa phantsi kwaso. Uluhlu lugcinwa kuQwalaselo.'),
('The incident record is closed.', 'xh', 'Irekhodi yesiganeko ivaliwe.'),
('The infringer refused to sign', 'xh', 'Owaphule umthetho walile ukutyikitya'),
('The inspection was filed. One or more essential checks failed, so the vehicle is off the road and your supervisor has been told. Choose another vehicle; this one comes back once fleet control returns it to service.', 'xh', 'Uhlolo lufakiwe. Uhlolo olunye okanye ngaphezulu olubalulekileyo lusilele, ngoko isithuthi asisekho endleleni kwaye umphathi wakho uxelelwe. Khetha esinye isithuthi; esi siyabuya xa abalawuli bezithuthi besibuyisela emsebenzini.'),
('The inspection was filed. One or more essential checks failed, so {unit} is off the road and your supervisor has been told. Choose another vehicle; this one comes back once fleet control returns it to service.', 'xh', 'Uhlolo lufakiwe. Uhlolo olunye okanye ngaphezulu olubalulekileyo lusilele, ngoko i-{unit} ayisekho endleleni kwaye umphathi wakho uxelelwe. Khetha esinye isithuthi; esi siyabuya xa abalawuli bezithuthi besibuyisela emsebenzini.'),
('The last reading was {km} km. Check the odometer.', 'xh', 'Ufundo lokugqibela lwalungu-{km} km. Jonga i-odometer.'),
('The latest reports filed.', 'xh', 'Iingxelo zamva nje ezifakiweyo.'),
('The latest views of these bodycams, live or recorded, with the reason given. Every one is also in the audit log.', 'xh', 'Ukujongwa kwamva nje kwezi bodycam, okuphilayo okanye okurekhodiweyo, nesizathu esinikiweyo. Nganye ikwakwilogi yophicotho.'),
('The lead filed the report.', 'xh', 'Okhokelayo wafaka ingxelo.'),
('The ledger sets Paid and Partially Paid. Entries are never edited or deleted.', 'xh', 'Ileja iseta Kuhlawuliwe kunye Kuhlawulwe Inxenye. Ungeniso alukaze luhlelwe okanye lucinywe.'),
('The list of absence types used for leave and on the duty sheet.', 'xh', 'Uluhlu lweentlobo zokungabikho ezisetyenziswa kwikhefu nakwiphepha lomsebenzi.'),
('The list of absence types: AL, SL, AWOL and the rest.', 'xh', 'Uluhlu lweentlobo zokungabikho: AL, SL, AWOL nezinye.'),
('The map could not load. Check your connection.', 'xh', 'Imephu ayikwazanga ukulayisha. Jonga uqhagamshelwano lwakho.'),
('The money that moves against fines and charges — {length} entries, net R{fixed}.', 'xh', 'Imali ehamba ngokuchasene nezohlwayo nezityholo — ungeniso olu-{length}, imali iyonke yi-R{fixed}.'),
('The municipality''s crest: it also appears on report PDFs, report screens in the app and the menu. Use a PNG for the PDFs.', 'xh', 'Uphawu lukamasipala: lukwavela kwii-PDF zeengxelo, kwizikrini zeengxelo kwi-app nakwimenyu. Sebenzisa i-PNG yee-PDF.'),
('The notice could not be saved on this phone.', 'xh', 'Isaziso asikwazanga ukugcinwa kule fowuni.'),
('The number this member is found by everywhere in the system.', 'xh', 'Inombolo eli lungu elifumaneka ngayo kuyo yonke inkqubo.'),
('The only vehicle is taken. You can continue your shift without one.', 'xh', 'Ekuphela kwesithuthi sithathiwe. Ungaqhubeka neshifti yakho ngaphandle kwaso.'),
('The operational areas that appear beside every officer on the duty board — NR, DR, B, CH…', 'xh', 'Iindawo zokusebenza ezivela ecaleni kwegosa ngalinye kwibhodi yomsebenzi — NR, DR, B, CH…'),
('The organisation must keep at least {value}. Until it has them, the current SystemAdmin cannot be demoted or deactivated, and if they are unavailable nobody can manage accounts. A new SystemAdmin needs a second approval; with nobody else to give it, the SuperAdmin decides.', 'xh', 'Umbutho kufuneka ugcine ubuncinane ii-{value}. De ube nazo, i-SystemAdmin yangoku ayinakwehliswa okanye icinywe, kwaye ukuba ayifumaneki akukho mntu unokulawula ii-akhawunti. I-SystemAdmin entsha ifuna imvume yesibini; ukuba akukho mntu wumbi unokuyinika, i-SuperAdmin iyagqiba.'),
('The overtime code this section books overtime against.', 'xh', 'Ikhowudi yexesha elongezelelweyo eli candelo elibhukisha ngayo ixesha elongezelelweyo.'),
('The patient', 'xh', 'Isigulana'),
('The photo on the incident is filed with this report.', 'xh', 'Umfanekiso okwisiganeko ufakwa nale ngxelo.'),
('The photo was not saved. Try again.', 'xh', 'Umfanekiso awugcinwanga. Zama kwakhona.'),
('The pin is in the wrong place', 'xh', 'Ipini ikwindawo engeyiyo'),
('The platform sent an insecure (http) stream address, which the browser may refuse. Ask Hikvision to stream over HTTPS.', 'xh', 'Iqonga lithumele idilesi yosasazo engakhuselekanga (http), ibhrawuza enokuyala. Cela i-Hikvision ukuba isasaze nge-HTTPS.'),
('The queue is clear.', 'xh', 'Umgca ucocekile.'),
('The radio always comes back to HikTech, after a restart too.', 'xh', 'Irediyo ihlala ibuyela kwi-HikTech, nasemva kokuqalisa kwakhona.'),
('The rank this call sign needs, e.g. ST for the sergeant in charge.', 'xh', 'Isikhundla esifunwa luphawu lomnxeba, umz. ST kasayitsheni ophetheyo.'),
('The recipient also gets a low-priority alert, phone included.', 'xh', 'Umamkeli ukwafumana isilumkiso esingabalulekanga kakhulu, kuquka nefowuni.'),
('The record you''re looking for doesn''t exist or you don''t have access to it.', 'xh', 'Irekhodi oyifunayo ayikho okanye awunako ukufikelela kuyo.'),
('The recording produced no audio.', 'xh', 'Ukurekhoda akuzange kuvelise sandi.'),
('The register is not set up yet. Run migration 0101 in Supabase, then reload.', 'xh', 'Irejista ayikasetwa okwangoku. Qhuba i-migration 0101 kwi-Supabase, uze ulayishe kwakhona.'),
('The register refused this notice: {reason}. Fix it by issuing a corrected notice; this one stays in the sync tray until you discard it.', 'xh', 'Irejista ilile esi saziso: {reason}. Kulungise ngokukhupha isaziso esilungisiweyo; esi sihlala kwitreyi yokuthumela de usilahle.'),
('The report cannot be filed yet:', 'xh', 'Ingxelo ayikakwazi ukufakwa okwangoku:'),
('The report is filed. Its forms show here once it has reached the server.', 'xh', 'Ingxelo ifakiwe. Iifomu zayo zivela apha xa sele ifike kwiseva.'),
('The report on {incident_number} becomes a permanent record — it cannot be edited or deleted afterwards.', 'xh', 'Ingxelo kwi-{incident_number} iba yirekhodi esisigxina — ayinakuhlelwa okanye icinywe emva koko.'),
('The reports', 'xh', 'Iingxelo'),
('The request to send with it', 'xh', 'Isicelo sokuthumela nayo'),
('The rules are installed and correct, but no scheduler is ticking them, so no escalation will fire on its own. Either enable', 'xh', 'Imithetho ifakiwe kwaye ichanekile, kodwa akukho sicwangcisi siyiqhubayo, ngoko akukho kunyuselwa kuya kwenzeka ngokwako. Nokuba uvule'),
('The same response metrics at every level — organisation, department, area and member. Drill in; the definitions never change, only the calls they cover.', 'xh', 'Imilinganiselo yokuphendula efanayo kuwo onke amanqanaba — umbutho, isebe, indawo nelungu. Ngena nzulu; iinkcazelo azitshintshi, kuphela iminxeba ezigubungelayo.'),
('The same screens and powers as now.', 'xh', 'Izikrini namagunya afanayo nangoku.'),
