('The station the call sign works from.', 'xh', 'Isikhululo uphawu lomnxeba olusebenza kuso.'),
('The talk button talks on your team’s group; the SOS button raises an SOS. Most radios work without setting up. If a button does nothing, teach it here.', 'xh', 'Iqhosha lokuthetha lithetha kwiqela lakho; iqhosha le-SOS liphakamisa i-SOS. Uninzi lweerediyo lusebenza ngaphandle kokusetwa. Ukuba iqhosha alenzi nto, lifundise apha.'),
('The team a rotation rosters (A, B, C, D or Red, Blue, Green).', 'xh', 'Iqela ujikelezo olulifaka kuluhlu (A, B, C, D okanye Bomvu, Luhlaza okwesibhakabhaka, Luhlaza).'),
