('They go back on rosters, and on duty only after their next start of shift.', 'xh', 'Babuyela kuluhlu, nasemsebenzini kuphela emva kokuqala kweshifti yabo elandelayo.'),
('This account has been deactivated. If you think this is a mistake, speak to your station commander or system administrator.', 'xh', 'Le akhawunti icinyiwe. Ukuba ucinga ukuba yimpazamo, thetha nomphathi wesikhululo sakho okanye umlawuli wenkqubo.'),
('This account holds a powerful role, so a second SystemAdmin must approve. Nothing changes until they do.', 'xh', 'Le akhawunti inendima enamandla, ngoko i-SystemAdmin yesibini kufuneka ivume. Akukho nto itshintshayo de bavume.'),
