('This build has no web address configured, so accounts cannot be activated in the app. Use the link on the HikTech website, or ask an administrator to set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.', 'xh', 'Olu hlelo alunayo idilesi yewebhu esetiweyo, ngoko ii-akhawunti azinakuvulwa kwi-app. Sebenzisa ikhonkco kwiwebhusayithi ye-HikTech, okanye ucele umlawuli ukuba aseta i-EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.'),
('This build has no web address configured, so features that run on the server are unavailable. An administrator needs to set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.', 'xh', 'Olu hlelo alunayo idilesi yewebhu esetiweyo, ngoko iimpawu ezisebenza kwiseva azifumaneki. Umlawuli kufuneka aseta i-EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.'),
('This build has no web address configured.', 'xh', 'Olu hlelo alunayo idilesi yewebhu esetiweyo.'),
