('The station the call sign works from.', 'af', 'Die stasie waarvandaan die roepsein werk.'),
('The talk button talks on your team’s group; the SOS button raises an SOS. Most radios work without setting up. If a button does nothing, teach it here.', 'af', 'Die praatknoppie praat op jou span se groep; die SOS-knoppie lui ''n SOS. Die meeste radio''s werk sonder opstelling. As ''n knoppie niks doen nie, leer dit hier.'),
