('Adds people to the staff register and updates the ones already there, matched by badge number. Nobody gets access: each person is invited afterwards and activates their own account.', 'nso', 'E oketša batho rejistareng ya bašomi gomme e mpshafatša bao ba šetšego ba le gona, ka go bapetša nomoro ya beche. Ga go yo a hwetšago phihlelelo: motho yo mongwe le yo mongwe o a laletšwa ka morago gomme a bule akhaonte ya gagwe.'),
('Adds vehicles to the register and updates the ones already there, matched by department and unit number. A vehicle’s status never changes by import: one off the road stays off the road until fleet control returns it.', 'nso', 'E oketša dikoloi rejistareng gomme e mpshafatša tšeo di šetšego di le gona, ka go bapetša kgoro le nomoro ya yuniti. Maemo a koloi ga a fetoge ka go tsenya: ye e sego tseleng e dula e se tseleng go fihla taolo ya dikoloi e e bušetša.'),
