('Each rule acts at most once per thing per threshold — a call that breaches its SLA raises one alert at each tier, not one every five minutes. Thresholds are stored per rule, so changing “escalate after 10 minutes” to 15 needs no deployment. Every change and every manual run is written to the audit trail with your name on it.', 'nso', 'Molao o mongwe le o mongwe o dira gatee fela selong se sengwe le se sengwe moedising o mongwe le o mongwe — mogala wo o fetago SLA ya wona o tsoša temošo e tee maemong a mangwe le a mangwe, e sego e tee metsotso ye mengwe le ye mengwe ye mehlano. Meedi e bolokwa ka molao o mongwe le o mongwe, ka fao go fetoša "oketša morago ga metsotso ye 10" go ya go 15 ga go nyake go tsenywa. Phetogo ye nngwe le ye nngwe le go dirwa go gongwe le go gongwe ka seatla go ngwalwa mohlaleng wa tlhakišišo le leina la gago.'),
