('En route', 'nso', 'O tseleng'),
('Enabled', 'nso', 'Go butšwe'),
('Enabling a feature never grants a role anything the route matrix and row-level security would not — the two systems compose. Disabling one hides it everywhere and makes its server routes refuse, for this tenant only.', 'nso', 'Go bula sebopego ga go fe mošomo selo seo matrix ya ditsela le polokego ya maemo a mothaladi di bego di ka se se dumelele — ditshepedišo tše pedi di šoma mmogo. Go tima se tee go se uta gohle gomme go dira gore ditsela tša sona tša sebele di gane, mohiring wo fela.'),
