('Evacuation area', 'nso', 'Lefelo la go tšhaba'),
('Every bodycam on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book one out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'nso', 'Khamera ye nngwe le ye nngwe ya mmele rejistareng, moo e bolokwago gona le gore ke mang yo a nago le yona bjale. Bahlankedi ba ntšha ye tee ka app mathomong a šifi gomme ba e bušetša pele šifi e fela.'),
('Every change needs a reason and the {kind} typed back. Changes to SystemAdmin, Admin or SystemController also need a second SystemAdmin.', 'nso', 'Phetogo ye nngwe le ye nngwe e nyaka lebaka le {kind} e ngwalwa gape. Diphetogo go SystemAdmin, Admin goba SystemController di nyaka gape SystemAdmin ya bobedi.'),
('Every change, from the audit trail.', 'nso', 'Phetogo ye nngwe le ye nngwe, go tšwa mohlaleng wa tlhakišišo.'),
('Every check passed so far. Next visit due {date}.', 'nso', 'Tlhahlobo ye nngwe le ye nngwe e atlegile go fihla bjale. Ketelo ye e latelago e swanetše {date}.'),
('Every check passed. Next visit due {date}.', 'nso', 'Tlhahlobo ye nngwe le ye nngwe e atlegile. Ketelo ye e latelago e swanetše {date}.'),
('Every closed case: reviewed after its report, or closed without one by the desk, with who and why.', 'nso', 'Molato o mongwe le o mongwe wo o tswaletšwego: o lekotšwe ka morago ga pego ya wona, goba o tswaletšwe ntle le yona ke tafola, le gore ke mang le gore ke ka lebaka la eng.'),
('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted with a blocking pop-up that must be acknowledged.', 'nso', 'Sehlopha se sengwe le se sengwe se se lego mošomong go {desks} se lemošwa ka popup ye e thibelago yeo e swanetšego go amogelwa.'),
('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted.', 'nso', 'Sehlopha se sengwe le se sengwe se se lego mošomong go {desks} se a lemošwa.'),
('Every crew out is on the Active Responders terminal', 'nso', 'Sehlopha se sengwe le se sengwe se se tšwilego se go Active Responders terminal'),
('Every crew still out, live. Open a row for the narrative and the timeline.', 'nso', 'Sehlopha se sengwe le se sengwe se se sa le ntle, ka nako ya bjale. Bula mothaladi go bona kanegelo le mothaladi wa nako.'),
('Every department', 'nso', 'Dikgoro ka moka'),
('Every external service HikTech talks to — what it powers, whether its credentials are present, and whether it currently answers.', 'nso', 'Tirelo ye nngwe le ye nngwe ya ka ntle yeo HikTech e bolelago le yona — seo e se fago maatla, ge eba dintlha tša yona tša go tsena di gona, le ge eba e a araba bjale.'),
('Every feed shows a sample video, not the bodycam. Switch it off under Admin → Integrations → Hikvision once the platform is connected.', 'nso', 'Phatlalatšo ye nngwe le ye nngwe e bontšha bidio ya mohlala, e sego khamera ya mmele. E time ka tlase ga Admin → Dikgokagano → Hikvision ge sethala se kgokagantšwe.'),
('Every firearm on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book a firearm out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'nso', 'Sethunya se sengwe le se sengwe rejistareng, moo se bolokwago gona le gore ke mang yo a nago le sona bjale. Bahlankedi ba ntšha sethunya ka app mathomong a šifi gomme ba se bušetša pele šifi e fela.'),
('Every form', 'nso', 'Foromo ye nngwe le ye nngwe'),
('Every hydrant is in service.', 'nso', 'Hydrant ye nngwe le ye nngwe e a šoma.'),
('Every knob has a safe built-in default and hard bounds; a value outside its bounds is clamped, and deleting an override falls back to the default. Every change is written to the audit trail with your name on it.', 'nso', 'Konopo ye nngwe le ye nngwe e na le kakaretšo ye e bolokegilego le meedi ye e tiilego; boleng bjo bo lego ka ntle ga meedi bo a kgaolwa, gomme go phumola phetošo go boela go kakaretšo. Phetogo ye nngwe le ye nngwe e ngwalwa mohlaleng wa tlhakišišo le leina la gago.'),
('Every leave or absence is captured under one of these codes. Office-only codes (AWOL, Suspended …) are never asked for by members.', 'nso', 'Khunollo ye nngwe le ye nngwe goba go se be gona go tsenywa ka tlase ga e nngwe ya dikhoutu tše. Dikhoutu tša ofisi fela (AWOL, Emišitšwe …) ga di ke di kgopelwa ke ditho.'),
('Every logged call across your visible silos.', 'nso', 'Mogala o mongwe le o mongwe wo o ngwadilwego dikgorong tša gago tše di bonagalago.'),
('Every member: numbers, rank, station, section, contacts and sign-in.', 'nso', 'Setho se sengwe le se sengwe: dinomoro, maemo, seteišene, karolo, dikgokagano le go tsena.'),
('Every milestone, update, evidence upload and audited action — from the first call{value}', 'nso', 'Kgato ye nngwe le ye nngwe ye bohlokwa, kaonafatšo, go romelwa ga bohlatse le tiro ye e lekotšwego — go tloga mogaleng wa mathomo{value}'),
('Every module on the platform — what your role and your organisation''s switches allow.', 'nso', 'Mojule o mongwe le o mongwe sethaleng — seo mošomo wa gago le dikonopo tša mokgatlo wa gago di se dumelelago.'),
('Every organisation on this deployment. Each tenant’s data, users, configuration and feature switches are isolated at the database — a row in one tenant does not exist for another, on any screen, in any export, in any search.', 'nso', 'Mokgatlo o mongwe le o mongwe tšhomišong ye. Data ya mohiri yo mongwe le yo mongwe, bašomiši, peakanyo le dikonopo tša dibopego di arogantšwe go database — mothaladi wa mohiri o tee ga o gona go yo mongwe, sekirining sefe goba sefe, go romeleng ntle gofe goba gofe, nyakišišong efe goba efe.'),
('Every place assessed on site, added up.', 'nso', 'Lefelo le lengwe le le lengwe le le hlahlobilwego lefelong, le kopantšwe.'),
('Every police report. Search, filter, export, or open one to read it in full.', 'nso', 'Pego ye nngwe le ye nngwe ya maphodisa. Nyaka, hlaola, romela ntle, goba o bule ye tee go e bala ka moka.'),
('Every punch, newest first.', 'nso', 'Go tsena mošomong mo gongwe le mo gongwe, mo go mpsha pele.'),
('Every recorded action on a case: who logged it, routed it, responded, filed the report and closed it. Audit rows are permanent.', 'nso', 'Tiro ye nngwe le ye nngwe ye e ngwadilwego molatong: yo a o ngwadilego, yo a o laetšego tsela, yo a arabilego, yo a rometšego pego le yo a o tswaletšego. Methaladi ya tlhakišišo ke ya go ya go ile.'),
('Every report officers file, colour-coded by form. Choose where to go.', 'nso', 'Pego ye nngwe le ye nngwe yeo bahlankedi ba e romelago, e arogantšwe ka mebala go ya ka foromo. Kgetha moo o yago gona.'),
('Every section, from observations to sign-off.', 'nso', 'Karolo ye nngwe le ye nngwe, go tloga go ditemogo go fihla go go saena.'),
('Every site, what it is used for, its risk and when it is due.', 'nso', 'Lefelo le lengwe le le lengwe, seo le le šomišwago, kotsi ya lona le gore le swanetše neng.'),
('Every stage', 'nso', 'Kgato ye nngwe le ye nngwe'),
('Every vehicle is on the road.', 'nso', 'Koloi ye nngwe le ye nngwe e tseleng.'),
('Every vehicle, who is driving it, its last inspection and licence disc. Officers choose a vehicle in the app at the start of a shift; one that fails its inspection comes off the road until it is returned to service here.', 'nso', 'Koloi ye nngwe le ye nngwe, yo a e otlelago, tlhahlobo ya yona ya mafelelo le tisiki ya laesense. Bahlankedi ba kgetha koloi ka app mathomong a šifi; ye e paletšwego ke tlhahlobo e ntšhwa tseleng go fihla e bušetšwa mošomong mo.'),
('Everyone', 'nso', 'Bohle'),
('Everyone due has started.', 'nso', 'Bohle bao ba swanetšego go thoma ba thomile.'),
('Everyone in each team gets their team''s shifts as drafts. Anyone on leave, booked for court or already on a shift is left out, with the reason below. Issue the drafts when you are happy.', 'nso', 'Yo mongwe le yo mongwe sehlopheng se sengwe le se sengwe o hwetša mešifi ya sehlopha sa gagwe bjalo ka ditlhalo. Mang le mang yo a lego maikhutšong, yo a pukeletšwego kgorotsheko goba yo a šetšego a le šifing o tlogelwa, le lebaka ka tlase. Ntšha ditlhalo ge o kgotsofetše.'),
('Everyone in the window', 'nso', 'Bohle nakong ye'),
('Everyone inside must leave.', 'nso', 'Bohle ba ka gare ba swanetše go tšwa.'),
('Everyone is allocated.', 'nso', 'Bohle ba abetšwe.'),
('Everything an administrator needs to answer “is the platform working”, in one place. Each check says what it means, not just what it measured.', 'nso', 'Tšohle tšeo molaodi a di nyakago go araba "na sethala se a šoma", lefelong le tee. Teko ye nngwe le ye nngwe e bolela seo e se bolelago, e sego fela seo e se lekantšego.'),
('Everything delivered', 'nso', 'Tšohle di romilwe'),
('Everything has been delivered.', 'nso', 'Tšohle di šetše di romilwe.'),
('Everything is filled in', 'nso', 'Tšohle di tlatšitšwe'),
('Everything is filled in.', 'nso', 'Tšohle di tladitšwe.'),
('Everything on the register for one ID number or one vehicle: fines, payments and when they were made, and what is owed today.', 'nso', 'Tšohle tše di lego rejistareng tša nomoro e tee ya boitsebišo goba koloi e tee: dikotlo, ditefelo le gore di dirilwe neng, le seo se kolotwago lehono.'),
('Everything that came in while you were busy, with what still needs your acknowledgement.', 'nso', 'Tšohle tšeo di tlilego mola o swaregile, le tšeo di sa nyakago kamogelo ya gago.'),
('Everything they recorded stays: incidents, reports and their history.', 'nso', 'Tšohle tšeo ba di ngwadilego di a dula: ditiragalo, dipego le histori ya tšona.'),
