('I know your shift, your calls, your leave and your kit. Ask me anything about your work, in your own words. I explain and show you where to go; you do the work.', 'nso', 'Ke tseba šifi ya gago, megala ya gago, maikhutšo a gago le didirišwa tša gago. Mpotšiša selo se sengwe le se sengwe ka mošomo wa gago, ka mantšu a gago. Ke a hlaloša le go go bontšha mo o swanetšego go ya; wena o dira mošomo.'),
