('Only me', 'nso', 'Nna fela'),
('Only officers who went on duty in the app after today''s start of shift are listed. Distance is straight-line from their last GPS heartbeat; ETA assumes {speedKmh} km/h with a {roadFactor}× road factor (Admin → Operations Settings).', 'nso', 'Go ngwadišwa fela bahlankedi bao ba tsenego mošomong ka app ka morago ga mathomo a šifi ya lehono. Sekgoba ke mothaladi o otlologilego go tloga go seswayo sa bona sa mafelelo sa GPS; ETA e tšea {speedKmh} km/h le ntlha ya tsela ya {roadFactor}× (Admin → Dipeakanyo tša Mošomo).'),
('Only one patient', 'nso', 'Molwetši o tee fela'),
