('The Hikvision platform is not connected yet', 'nso', 'Sethala sa Hikvision ga se eso kopanywe'),
('The K9 deployment: the incident, members and dogs, victims, suspects and medical treatment.', 'nso', 'Go romelwa ga K9: tiragalo, maloko le dimpša, bahlaselwa, babelaelwa le kalafo.'),
('The account can be reactivated later, with a reason.', 'nso', 'Akhaonto e ka bulwa gape ka morago, ka lebaka.'),
('The account could not be loaded.', 'nso', 'Akhaonto ga se ya kgona go laišwa.'),
('The account is active as soon as you create it. You will know {value} password, and they do not confirm their badge number or accept the POPIA notice. Use an invitation where you can.', 'nso', 'Akhaonto e a šoma gateetee ge o e hlama. O tla tseba phasewete ya {value}, gomme ga ba netefatše nomoro ya bona ya beche goba ba amogele tsebišo ya POPIA. Šomiša taletšo mo o ka kgonago.'),
('The account this member signs in with. Accounts are made by invitation.', 'nso', 'Akhaonto yeo leloko le le tsenago ka yona. Diakhaonto di hlangwa ka taletšo.'),
('The ambulance will go off the road', 'nso', 'Ambulense e tla tšwa tseleng'),
('The amount was entered by the officer: the charge book had none for this offence.', 'nso', 'Tšhelete e tsentšwe ke mohlankedi: puku ya melato e be e se na yona molatong wo.'),
('The app hit an unexpected error', 'nso', 'App e kopane le phošo ye e sa letelwago'),
('The app opens by itself when this radio starts, and connects.', 'nso', 'App e a ipula ge radio ye e thoma, gomme e a kopana.'),
('The armoury checklist — issue, return or inspect, safety items first.', 'nso', 'Lista ya tekolo ya bobolokelo bja dibetša — go ntšha, go bušetša goba go lekola, dilo tša polokego pele.'),
('The assessment is filed by Disaster Management officers on site.', 'nso', 'Tekolo e romelwa ke bahlankedi ba Taolo ya Dikotsi bao ba lego lefelong.'),
('The bodycam failed its check ', 'nso', 'Bodycam e paletšwe ke tekolo ya yona'),
('The call', 'nso', 'Mogala'),
('The call centre calls this number when you are needed.', 'nso', 'Setsi sa megala se letšetša nomoro ye ge o nyakega.'),
('The call centre will no longer call you out.', 'nso', 'Setsi sa megala se ka se sa go bitša.'),
('The call is logged; attach the file again from the incident page.', 'nso', 'Mogala o ngwadilwe; kgomaretša faele gape go tšwa letlakaleng la tiragalo.'),
('The caller', 'nso', 'Moletšadimogala'),
('The caller’s answer', 'nso', 'Karabo ya moletšadimogala'),
('The calls you worked', 'nso', 'Megala yeo o e šomilego'),
('The camera did not open. Try again.', 'nso', 'Khamera ga se ya bulega. Leka gape.'),
('The camera is closed.', 'nso', 'Khamera e tswaletšwe.'),
('The camera is not set up yet. Ask the system administrator.', 'nso', 'Khamera ga e eso beakanywe. Botšiša molaodi wa tshepedišo.'),
('The camera registry (for the live map layer) is empty. It fills from the i-traffic API once SANRAL issues a key (', 'nso', 'Rejisetara ya dikhamera (ya legato la mmapa wa nako ya nnete) ga e na selo. E tlatšwa go tšwa go API ya i-traffic ge SANRAL e ntšha senotlelo ('),
('The camera’s code on the Hikvision platform (cameraIndexCode). Live video needs it.', 'nso', 'Khoutu ya khamera sethaleng sa Hikvision (cameraIndexCode). Bidio ya nako ya nnete e a e nyaka.'),
('The case file is closed.', 'nso', 'Faele ya molato e tswaletšwe.'),
('The charge book has no amount for this offence yet. The record notes that you entered it.', 'nso', 'Puku ya melato ga e eso be le tšhelete ya molato wo. Rekoto e bontšha gore ke wena o e tsentšego.'),
('The check did not work.', 'nso', 'Tekolo ga se ya šoma.'),
('The clock register — append-only, corrections are new punches.', 'nso', 'Rejisetara ya sešupanako — go oketša fela, dikalafo ke ditsenyo tše mpsha.'),
('The command dashboard''s launcher honours these rules too.', 'nso', 'Sethomiši sa tešebotu ya balaodi le sona se hlompha melao ye.'),
('The control room is viewing your bodycam', 'nso', 'Phapoši ya taolo e lebelela bodycam ya gago'),
('The court date passed without payment: a warrant may be issued.', 'nso', 'Letšatši la kgorotsheko le fetile go sa lefelwe: warente e ka ntšhwa.'),
('The cycle every team works, a day at a time: shift codes ({value}) and a dash for a day off. Each team starts its cycle on a different day.', 'nso', 'Modikologo wo sehlopha se sengwe le se sengwe se šomago ka wona, letšatši ka letšatši: dikhoutu tša šifi ({value}) le mothalwana wa letšatši la khunologo. Sehlopha se sengwe le se sengwe se thoma modikologo wa sona ka letšatši le le fapanego.'),
('The daily duty sheet for parade. Choose the section, the date and the operation, then print. Times members signed on or off in the app fill in.', 'nso', 'Letlakala la mošomo la letšatši le letšatši la paleiti. Kgetha karolo, letšatši le mošomo, ke moka o gatiše. Dinako tšeo maloko a saenneng go tsena goba go tšwa ka tšona ka app di a tlatšwa.'),
('The dashboard, leave, search and their own profile only.', 'nso', 'Tešebotu, maikhutšo, go nyaka le profaele ya bona fela.'),
('The data SIM in the bodycam', 'nso', 'SIM ya data go bodycam'),
('The day the first team is on day one of the cycle.', 'nso', 'Letšatši leo sehlopha sa mathomo se lego go letšatši la mathomo la modikologo.'),
('The day’s sheet to print for parade: sign on, sign off and overtime.', 'nso', 'Letlakala la letšatši la go gatišwa la paleiti: go saena go tsena, go tšwa le nako ya tlaleletšo.'),
('The department administrator sets shift types, rotations and the late minutes. You can put people in teams.', 'nso', 'Molaodi wa kgoro o beakanya mehuta ya dišifi, go dikologa le metsotso ya go šala morago. O ka tsenya batho dihlopheng.'),
('The duty office screens. The systems controller decides who may open each one, and whether they may change it.', 'nso', 'Dikirini tša ofisi ya mošomo. Molaodi wa ditshepedišo o phetha gore ke mang yo a ka bulago se sengwe le se sengwe, le ge eba a ka se fetola.'),
('The eThekwini Fire By-law checks, then what follows.', 'nso', 'Ditekolo tša Molao wa Mmasepala wa Mollo wa eThekwini, ke moka tše di latelago.'),
('The electronic vehicle inspection report has been finalised.', 'nso', 'Pego ya elektroniki ya tekolo ya koloi e phethilwe.'),
('The end date must not be before the start date.', 'nso', 'Letšatši la mafelelo ga le a swanela go ba pele ga letšatši la mathomo.'),
('The engine has not run yet.', 'nso', 'Entšene ga e eso šome.'),
('The file is read on this computer. Nothing is saved until you confirm, and the file itself is never stored.', 'nso', 'Faele e balwa khomphutheng ye. Ga go se se bolokwago go fihla o netefatša, gomme faele ka boyona ga e ke e bolokwa.'),
('The file is read on this computer. Nothing reaches HikTech until you confirm, and then only the rows you confirm. The file itself is never stored.', 'nso', 'Faele e balwa khomphutheng ye. Ga go se se fihlago go HikTech go fihla o netefatša, gomme ke moka go fihla fela methaladi ye o e netefatšago. Faele ka boyona ga e ke e bolokwa.'),
('The fine shows on that incident’s record.', 'nso', 'Kotlo e tšwelela rekotong ya tiragalo yeo.'),
('The firearm', 'nso', 'Sethunya'),
('The firearm checklist is not enabled for your organisation.', 'nso', 'Lista ya tekolo ya sethunya ga e bulelwe mokgatlo wa gago.'),
('The firearm did not pass its inspection and has been marked for maintenance. Your inspection is on record. Select another firearm, or tick No firearm, to complete your start of shift.', 'nso', 'Sethunya ga se sa atlega tekolong gomme se swailwe gore se lokišwe. Tekolo ya gago e rekotong. Kgetha sethunya se sengwe, goba o swaye Ga go na sethunya, go fetša mathomo a šifi ya gago.'),
('The firearm serial number is required.', 'nso', 'Nomoro ya serial ya sethunya e a nyakega.'),
('The force number printed on the duty sheet.', 'nso', 'Nomoro ya lekala ye e gatišitšwego letlakaleng la mošomo.'),
('The heading the sheet prints under. The list is kept in Configuration.', 'nso', 'Hlogo yeo letlakala le gatišwago ka fase ga yona. Lenaneo le bolokwa go Peakanyo.'),
('The incident record is closed.', 'nso', 'Rekoto ya tiragalo e tswaletšwe.'),
('The infringer refused to sign', 'nso', 'Motlolamolao o ganne go saena'),
('The inspection was filed. One or more essential checks failed, so the vehicle is off the road and your supervisor has been told. Choose another vehicle; this one comes back once fleet control returns it to service.', 'nso', 'Tekolo e rometšwe. Tekolo e tee goba go feta ya bohlokwa e paletšwe, ka gona koloi ga e sa le tseleng gomme molaodi wa gago o boditšwe. Kgetha koloi ye nngwe; ye e boa ge taolo ya dikoloi e e bušetša mošomong.'),
('The inspection was filed. One or more essential checks failed, so {unit} is off the road and your supervisor has been told. Choose another vehicle; this one comes back once fleet control returns it to service.', 'nso', 'Tekolo e rometšwe. Tekolo e tee goba go feta ya bohlokwa e paletšwe, ka gona {unit} ga e sa le tseleng gomme molaodi wa gago o boditšwe. Kgetha koloi ye nngwe; ye e boa ge taolo ya dikoloi e e bušetša mošomong.'),
('The last reading was {km} km. Check the odometer.', 'nso', 'Go bala ga mafelelo e be e le {km} km. Lekola odometara.'),
('The latest reports filed.', 'nso', 'Dipego tša morago bjale tše di rometšwego.'),
('The latest views of these bodycams, live or recorded, with the reason given. Every one is also in the audit log.', 'nso', 'Dilebelelo tša morago bjale tša di-bodycam tše, tša nako ya nnete goba tše di gatišitšwego, le lebaka le le filwego. Ye nngwe le ye nngwe e gona le ka logong ya tlhahlobo.'),
('The lead filed the report.', 'nso', 'Moetapele o rometše pego.'),
('The ledger sets Paid and Partially Paid. Entries are never edited or deleted.', 'nso', 'Letlakala la ditšhelete le beakanya E lefilwe le E Lefilwe Karolo. Ditsenyo ga di ke di fetolwa goba tša phumolwa.'),
('The list of absence types used for leave and on the duty sheet.', 'nso', 'Lenaneo la mehuta ya go se be gona ye e šomišwago go maikhutšo le letlakaleng la mošomo.'),
('The list of absence types: AL, SL, AWOL and the rest.', 'nso', 'Lenaneo la mehuta ya go se be gona: AL, SL, AWOL le tše dingwe.'),
('The map could not load. Check your connection.', 'nso', 'Mmapa ga se wa kgona go laiša. Lekola kgokagano ya gago.'),
('The money that moves against fines and charges — {length} entries, net R{fixed}.', 'nso', 'Tšhelete ye e sepelago kgahlanong le dikotlo le melato — ditsenyo tše {length}, palomoka ya R{fixed}.'),
('The municipality''s crest: it also appears on report PDFs, report screens in the app and the menu. Use a PNG for the PDFs.', 'nso', 'Letšhwao la mmasepala: le tšwelela gape go di-PDF tša dipego, dikirining tša dipego ka app le go menyu. Šomiša PNG go di-PDF.'),
('The notice could not be saved on this phone.', 'nso', 'Tsebišo ga se ya kgona go bolokwa founung ye.'),
('The number this member is found by everywhere in the system.', 'nso', 'Nomoro yeo leloko le le hwetšwago ka yona gohle tshepedišong.'),
('The only vehicle is taken. You can continue your shift without one.', 'nso', 'Koloi e nnoši e tšerwe. O ka tšwela pele ka šifi ya gago ntle le yona.'),
('The operational areas that appear beside every officer on the duty board — NR, DR, B, CH…', 'nso', 'Mafelo a mošomo ao a tšwelelago kgauswi le mohlankedi yo mongwe le yo mongwe botong ya mošomo — NR, DR, B, CH…'),
('The organisation must keep at least {value}. Until it has them, the current SystemAdmin cannot be demoted or deactivated, and if they are unavailable nobody can manage accounts. A new SystemAdmin needs a second approval; with nobody else to give it, the SuperAdmin decides.', 'nso', 'Mokgatlo o swanetše go boloka bonnyane {value}. Go fihla o na le bona, SystemAdmin wa bjale a ka se theošwe goba a timwe, gomme ge a sa hwetšagale ga go na yo a ka laolago diakhaonto. SystemAdmin yo mofsa o nyaka tumelelo ya bobedi; ge go se na yo mongwe yo a ka e fago, SuperAdmin o a phetha.'),
('The overtime code this section books overtime against.', 'nso', 'Khoutu ya nako ya tlaleletšo yeo karolo ye e bukelago nako ya tlaleletšo ka yona.'),
('The patient', 'nso', 'Molwetši'),
('The photo on the incident is filed with this report.', 'nso', 'Seswantšho se se lego tiragalong se romelwa le pego ye.'),
('The photo was not saved. Try again.', 'nso', 'Seswantšho ga se sa bolokwa. Leka gape.'),
('The pin is in the wrong place', 'nso', 'Phini e lefelong le le fošagetšego'),
('The platform sent an insecure (http) stream address, which the browser may refuse. Ask Hikvision to stream over HTTPS.', 'nso', 'Sethala se rometše aterese ya go phatlalatša ye e sa bolokegago (http), yeo sefetleki se ka e ganago. Kgopela Hikvision gore e phatlalatše ka HTTPS.'),
('The queue is clear.', 'nso', 'Mothaladi o hlwekile.'),
('The radio always comes back to HikTech, after a restart too.', 'nso', 'Radio e dula e boela go HikTech, le ka morago ga go thoma gape.'),
('The rank this call sign needs, e.g. ST for the sergeant in charge.', 'nso', 'Maemo ao leswao le la go bitša le a nyakago, mohl. ST bakeng sa sajene yo a laolago.'),
('The recipient also gets a low-priority alert, phone included.', 'nso', 'Moamogedi le yena o hwetša temošo ya bohlokwa bja fase, go akaretšwa founu.'),
('The record you''re looking for doesn''t exist or you don''t have access to it.', 'nso', 'Rekoto ye o e nyakago ga e gona goba ga o na phihlelelo go yona.'),
('The recording produced no audio.', 'nso', 'Go gatiša ga se gwa tšweletša modumo.'),
('The register is not set up yet. Run migration 0101 in Supabase, then reload.', 'nso', 'Rejisetara ga e eso beakanywe. Šomiša migration 0101 go Supabase, ke moka o laiše gape.'),
('The register refused this notice: {reason}. Fix it by issuing a corrected notice; this one stays in the sync tray until you discard it.', 'nso', 'Rejisetara e ganne tsebišo ye: {reason}. E lokiše ka go ntšha tsebišo ye e lokišitšwego; ye e dula theri ya go romela go fihla o e lahla.'),
('The report cannot be filed yet:', 'nso', 'Pego ga e eso kgone go romelwa:'),
('The report is filed. Its forms show here once it has reached the server.', 'nso', 'Pego e rometšwe. Diforomo tša yona di tšwelela mo ge e fihlile sevareng.'),
('The report on {incident_number} becomes a permanent record — it cannot be edited or deleted afterwards.', 'nso', 'Pego ya {incident_number} e ba rekoto ya go ya go ile — e ka se fetolwe goba ya phumolwa ka morago.'),
('The reports', 'nso', 'Dipego'),
('The request to send with it', 'nso', 'Kgopelo ya go romela le yona'),
('The rules are installed and correct, but no scheduler is ticking them, so no escalation will fire on its own. Either enable', 'nso', 'Melao e tsentšwe ebile e nepagetše, eupša ga go na sebeakanyi se se e šomišago, ka gona ga go na go iša godimo go go tla diregago ka bogona. Goba o bule'),
('The same response metrics at every level — organisation, department, area and member. Drill in; the definitions never change, only the calls they cover.', 'nso', 'Ditekanyo tše di swanago tša karabo maemong ka moka — mokgatlo, kgoro, lefelo le leloko. Tsena ka gare; ditlhalošo ga di fetoge, ke megala fela ye di e akaretšago.'),
('The same screens and powers as now.', 'nso', 'Dikirini le maatla tše di swanago le tša bjale.'),
('The same window cut three ways — by member, by department, by incident type.', 'nso', 'Nako ye e swanago e arotšwe ka ditsela tše tharo — ka leloko, ka kgoro, ka mohuta wa tiragalo.'),
('The scene', 'nso', 'Lefelo'),
('The secret is kept safe and never shown again.', 'nso', 'Sephiri se bolokwa se bolokegile gomme ga se sa bontšhwa gape.'),
('The server refused it. SMS or call the control room now.', 'nso', 'Seva e e ganne. Romela SMS goba o letšetše phapoši ya taolo bjale.'),
('The server took too long to answer. Check your connection and try again.', 'nso', 'Seva e tšere nako ye telele kudu go araba. Lekola kgokagano ya gago gomme o leke gape.'),
('The shift types, rotations and teams the planner repeats.', 'nso', 'Mehuta ya dišifi, go dikologa le dihlopha tšeo morulaganyi a di boeletšago.'),
('The site is compliant.', 'nso', 'Saete e obamela melao.'),
('The staff register is empty. Import HR’s staff list first.', 'nso', 'Rejisetara ya bašomi ga e na selo. Tsenya lenaneo la bašomi la HR pele.'),
('The station the call sign works from.', 'nso', 'Seteišene seo leswao la go bitša le šomago go sona.'),
('The talk button talks on your team’s group; the SOS button raises an SOS. Most radios work without setting up. If a button does nothing, teach it here.', 'nso', 'Konopo ya go bolela e bolela sehlopheng sa gago; konopo ya SOS e tšweletša SOS. Diradio tše ntši di šoma ntle le go beakanywa. Ge konopo e sa dire selo, e rute mo.'),
('The team a rotation rosters (A, B, C, D or Red, Blue, Green).', 'nso', 'Sehlopha seo go dikologa go se tsenyago lenaneong (A, B, C, D goba Khubedu, Talalerata, Tala).'),
('The two PINs are not the same. Enter your new PIN again.', 'nso', 'Di-PIN tše pedi ga di swane. Tsenya PIN ya gago ye mpsha gape.'),
('The units duty is given to, and the stations they work from.', 'nso', 'Diyuniti tšeo di filwego mošomo, le diteišene tšeo di šomago go tšona.'),
('The vehicle, item by item: OK, Fault or NIL.', 'nso', 'Koloi, selo ka selo: GO LOKILE, Phošo goba GA GO NA.'),
('The yearly entitlement shown on leave balances. Empty for none.', 'nso', 'Tokelo ya ngwaga ye e bontšhwago go dipalanse tša maikhutšo. E se na selo ge e le gore ga e gona.'),
('The {unitWord} goes for maintenance and your supervisor is told.', 'nso', '{unitWord} e ya go lokišwa gomme molaodi wa gago o a botšwa.'),
('Theft', 'nso', 'Bohodu'),
('Theft of motor vehicle', 'nso', 'Bohodu bja koloi'),
('Their age?', 'nso', 'Mengwaga ya bona?'),
('Their condition', 'nso', 'Seemo sa bona'),
('Their invitation goes here.', 'nso', 'Taletšo ya bona e ya mo.'),
('Their vehicle and registration', 'nso', 'Koloi ya bona le boingwadišo'),
('Theme', 'nso', 'Setaele'),
('Then add its call signs on Call Signs.', 'nso', 'Ke moka o oketše maswao a yona a go bitša go Maswao a go Bitša.'),
('These are safe for media and community distribution.', 'nso', 'Tše di bolokegile go ditaba le go phatlalatšwa setšhabeng.'),
('These email addresses and cellphone numbers come from HR’s staff list.', 'nso', 'Diaterese tše tša imeile le dinomoro tša disele di tšwa lenaneong la bašomi la HR.'),
('They accept, then your supervisor approves. Until then your shift stays yours.', 'nso', 'Ba a amogela, ke moka molaodi wa gago o a dumelela. Go fihla ka nako yeo šifi ya gago e dula e le ya gago.'),
('They are handed back when you end your shift.', 'nso', 'Di a bušetšwa ge o fetša šifi ya gago.'),
('They come off duty and off rosters straight away.', 'nso', 'Ba tšwa mošomong le mananeong gateetee.'),
('They go back on rosters, and on duty only after their next start of shift.', 'nso', 'Ba boela mananeong, le mošomong fela ka morago ga mathomo a šifi ya bona ye e latelago.'),
('This account has been deactivated. If you think this is a mistake, speak to your station commander or system administrator.', 'nso', 'Akhaonto ye e timilwe. Ge o nagana gore ke phošo, bolela le molaodi wa seteišene sa gago goba molaodi wa tshepedišo.'),
('This account holds a powerful role, so a second SystemAdmin must approve. Nothing changes until they do.', 'nso', 'Akhaonto ye e na le tema ye maatla, ka gona SystemAdmin wa bobedi o swanetše go dumelela. Ga go se se fetogago go fihla ba dumelela.'),
('This bodycam will not be issued', 'nso', 'Bodycam ye e ka se ntšhwe'),
('This build has no push service configured, so alerts arrive only while the app is open. Report it to your system administrator before carrying this handset on shift.', 'nso', 'Kgatišo ye ga e na tirelo ya ditsebišo ye e beakantšwego, ka gona ditemošo di fihla fela ge app e butšwe. Bega se go molaodi wa tshepedišo pele o rwala founu ye šifing.'),
('This build has no web address configured, so accounts cannot be activated in the app. Use the link on the HikTech website, or ask an administrator to set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.', 'nso', 'Kgatišo ye ga e na aterese ya wepe ye e beakantšwego, ka gona diakhaonto di ka se bulwe ka app. Šomiša kgokagano go weposaete ya HikTech, goba o kgopele molaodi gore a beakanye EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.'),
('This build has no web address configured, so features that run on the server are unavailable. An administrator needs to set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.', 'nso', 'Kgatišo ye ga e na aterese ya wepe ye e beakantšwego, ka gona dikarolo tše di šomago sevareng ga di hwetšagale. Molaodi o swanetše go beakanya EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.'),
('This build has no web address configured.', 'nso', 'Kgatišo ye ga e na aterese ya wepe ye e beakantšwego.'),
('This call has no map position. Mark On Scene when you get there.', 'nso', 'Mogala wo ga o na lefelo mmapeng. Swaya O lefelong ge o fihla gona.'),
('This cannot be undone. Press again to go ahead.', 'nso', 'Se se ka se bušetšwe morago. Tobetša gape go tšwela pele.'),
('This checklist will file as NOT PASSED until every safety item above is ticked. The record cannot claim otherwise.', 'nso', 'Lista ye ya tekolo e tla romelwa bjalo ka GA SE YA ATLEGA go fihla dilo ka moka tša polokego ka godimo di swailwe. Rekoto e ka se bolele se sengwe.'),
('This code can’t be used', 'nso', 'Khoutu ye e ka se šomišwe'),
('This code is shown', 'nso', 'Khoutu ye e a bontšhwa'),
('This cycle', 'nso', 'Modikologo wo'),
('This device belongs to another department. Use one of your own department''s devices, or sign in with your password.', 'nso', 'Sedirišwa se ke sa kgoro ye nngwe. Šomiša se sengwe sa didirišwa tša kgoro ya gago, goba o tsene ka phasewete ya gago.'),
('This device is no longer registered for PIN sign-in. Sign in with your password, and ask your supervisor to register it again.', 'nso', 'Sedirišwa se ga se sa ngwadišwa go tsena ka PIN. Tsena ka phasewete ya gago, gomme o kgopele molaodi wa gago gore a se ngwadiše gape.'),
('This device is not registered for PIN sign-in. Your supervisor registers shared radios and phones.', 'nso', 'Sedirišwa se ga se ngwadišwa go tsena ka PIN. Molaodi wa gago o ngwadiša diradio le difounu tša go abelana.'),
('This device is not set up for PIN sign-in yet. A supervisor or administrator sets it up once: sign in with a password, open Profile, then Sign-in PIN, then Register this device.', 'nso', 'Sedirišwa se ga se eso beakanyetšwe go tsena ka PIN. Molaodi goba motsamaiši o se beakanya gatee: tsena ka phasewete, bula Profaele, ke moka PIN ya go Tsena, ke moka Ngwadiša sedirišwa se.'),
('This device is registered for PIN sign-in: {device}', 'nso', 'Sedirišwa se se ngwadišitšwe go tsena ka PIN: {device}'),
('This device no longer signs anyone in with a PIN.', 'nso', 'Sedirišwa se ga se sa tsenya motho ka PIN.'),
('This feed stops in {secondsToAnswer} s to save the bodycam’s mobile data.', 'nso', 'Phatlalatšo ye e emišwa ka metsotswana ye {secondsToAnswer} go boloka data ya mogala ya bodycam.'),
('This firearm will not be issued', 'nso', 'Sethunya se se ka se ntšhwe'),
('This import changes nothing about them. They may have left: review them on the Personnel page afterwards.', 'nso', 'Go tsenya mo ga go fetole selo ka bona. Ba ka ba ba tlogetše: ba lekole letlakaleng la Bašomi ka morago.'),
('This is a {severity} call. The {desks} dispatch desk can start now with what you have.', 'nso', 'Wo ke mogala wa {severity}. Teseke ya go romela ya {desks} e ka thoma bjale ka seo o nago le sona.'),
('This is a {severity} call. The {desks} dispatch desks can start now with what you have.', 'nso', 'Wo ke mogala wa {severity}. Diteseke tša go romela tša {desks} di ka thoma bjale ka seo o nago le sona.'),
('This is your SOS — dispatch is sending help to you.', 'nso', 'Ye ke SOS ya gago — baromedi ba romela thušo go wena.'),
('This list covers {join}. People in those departments it leaves out are shown for review; nobody is removed.', 'nso', 'Lenaneo le le akaretša {join}. Batho ba dikgorong tšeo le ba tlogelago ba bontšhwa gore ba lekolwe; ga go na yo a tlošwago.'),
('This member has no account yet, so they cannot be given screens.', 'nso', 'Leloko le ga le eso be le akhaonto, ka gona le ka se fiwe dikirini.'),
