('This needs the latest app. Install it, then come back here.', 'nso', 'Se se nyaka app ya morago bjale. E tsenye, ke moka o boele mo.'),
('This page hit an error', 'nso', 'Letlakala le le kopane le phošo'),
('This page shows calls sent to you yourself, as a field officer sees them.', 'nso', 'Letlakala le le bontšha megala ye e romeletšwego wena ka bowena, bjalo ka ge mohlankedi wa tšhemong a e bona.'),
('This phone could not be registered for dispatch notifications. Alerts still arrive while the app is open — report this so the handset can be checked.', 'nso', 'Founu ye ga se ya kgona go ngwadišetšwa ditsebišo tša go romela. Ditemošo di sa fihla ge app e butšwe — bega se gore founu e lekolwe.'),
('This phone will not ring for a dispatch. Turn notifications on for HikTech in the device settings. Alerts still arrive instantly while the app is open.', 'nso', 'Founu ye e ka se lle ge go romelwa. Bula ditsebišo tša HikTech dipeakanyong tša sedirišwa. Ditemošo di sa fihla gateetee ge app e butšwe.'),
('This radio is off.', 'nso', 'Radio ye e timilwe.'),
