('Adds people to the staff register and updates the ones already there, matched by badge number. Nobody gets access: each person is invited afterwards and activates their own account.', 'tn', 'E oketsa batho mo rejisetareng ya badiri mme e ntšhafatsa ba ba setseng ba le teng, ka go tshwantshanya nomore ya beche. Ga go ope yo o bonang phitlhelelo: motho mongwe le mongwe o a laletswa morago mme a bule akhaonto ya gagwe.'),
('Adds vehicles to the register and updates the ones already there, matched by department and unit number. A vehicle’s status never changes by import: one off the road stays off the road until fleet control returns it.', 'tn', 'E oketsa dikoloi mo rejisetareng mme e ntšhafatsa tse di setseng di le teng, ka go tshwantshanya lefapha le nomore ya yuniti. Maemo a koloi ga a fetoge ka go tsenya: e e seng mo tseleng e nna e se mo tseleng go fitlhelela taolo ya dikoloi e e busa.'),
