('Evacuation area', 'tn', 'Kgaolo ya go tshaba'),
('Every bodycam on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book one out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'tn', 'Khamera nngwe le nngwe ya mmele mo rejisetareng, kwa e bolokwang teng le gore ke mang yo o nang le yone jaanong. Bapodisi ba ntsha e le nngwe ka app kwa tshimologong ya šifiti mme ba e busa pele šifiti e fela.'),
('Every change needs a reason and the {kind} typed back. Changes to SystemAdmin, Admin or SystemController also need a second SystemAdmin.', 'tn', 'Phetogo nngwe le nngwe e tlhoka lebaka le {kind} e kwalwa gape. Diphetogo mo SystemAdmin, Admin kgotsa SystemController di tlhoka gape SystemAdmin wa bobedi.'),
('Every change, from the audit trail.', 'tn', 'Phetogo nngwe le nngwe, go tswa mo motlhaleng wa tlhatlhobo.'),
('Every check passed so far. Next visit due {date}.', 'tn', 'Tlhatlhobo nngwe le nngwe e atlegile go fitlha jaanong. Loeto lo lo latelang lo tshwanetse {date}.'),
('Every check passed. Next visit due {date}.', 'tn', 'Tlhatlhobo nngwe le nngwe e atlegile. Loeto lo lo latelang lo tshwanetse {date}.'),
('Every closed case: reviewed after its report, or closed without one by the desk, with who and why.', 'tn', 'Molato mongwe le mongwe o o tswetsweng: o sekasekilwe morago ga pego ya one, kgotsa o tswetswe kwantle ga yone ke tafole, le gore ke mang le gore ke ka ntlha yang.'),
('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted with a blocking pop-up that must be acknowledged.', 'tn', 'Setlhopha sengwe le sengwe se se mo tirong mo {desks} se tlhagisiwa ka popup e e thibelang e e tshwanetseng go amogelwa.'),
('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted.', 'tn', 'Setlhopha sengwe le sengwe se se mo tirong mo {desks} se a tlhagisiwa.'),
('Every crew out is on the Active Responders terminal', 'tn', 'Setlhopha sengwe le sengwe se se tswileng se mo Active Responders terminal'),
('Every crew still out, live. Open a row for the narrative and the timeline.', 'tn', 'Setlhopha sengwe le sengwe se se sa ntseng se le kwa ntle, ka nako ya jaanong. Bula mola go bona kanelo le mola wa nako.'),
('Every department', 'tn', 'Mafapha otlhe'),
('Every external service HikTech talks to — what it powers, whether its credentials are present, and whether it currently answers.', 'tn', 'Tirelo nngwe le nngwe ya kwa ntle e HikTech e buang le yone — se e se nayang maatla, fa dintlha tsa yone tsa go tsena di le teng, le fa e araba jaanong.'),
('Every feed shows a sample video, not the bodycam. Switch it off under Admin → Integrations → Hikvision once the platform is connected.', 'tn', 'Phasalatso nngwe le nngwe e bontsha bidio ya sekai, e seng khamera ya mmele. E time ka fa tlase ga Admin → Dikgolagano → Hikvision fa serala se golagantswe.'),
('Every firearm on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book a firearm out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'tn', 'Sethunya sengwe le sengwe mo rejisetareng, kwa se bolokwang teng le gore ke mang yo o nang le sone jaanong. Bapodisi ba ntsha sethunya ka app kwa tshimologong ya šifiti mme ba se busa pele šifiti e fela.'),
('Every form', 'tn', 'Foromo nngwe le nngwe'),
('Every hydrant is in service.', 'tn', 'Hydrant nngwe le nngwe e a dira.'),
('Every knob has a safe built-in default and hard bounds; a value outside its bounds is clamped, and deleting an override falls back to the default. Every change is written to the audit trail with your name on it.', 'tn', 'Konopo nngwe le nngwe e na le tlwaelo e e babalesegileng le dikgaolo tse di thata; boleng jo bo kwa ntle ga dikgaolo jwa jone bo a kgaolwa, mme go phimola phetolo go boela kwa tlwaelong. Phetogo nngwe le nngwe e kwalwa mo motlhaleng wa tlhatlhobo le leina la gago.'),
('Every leave or absence is captured under one of these codes. Office-only codes (AWOL, Suspended …) are never asked for by members.', 'tn', 'Boikhutso kgotsa go sa nne gona nngwe le nngwe go tsenngwa ka fa tlase ga nngwe ya dikhoutu tse. Dikhoutu tsa ofisi fela (AWOL, Emisitswe …) ga di ke di kopiwa ke maloko.'),
('Every logged call across your visible silos.', 'tn', 'Mogala mongwe le mongwe o o kwadisitsweng mo mafapheng a gago a a bonalang.'),
('Every member: numbers, rank, station, section, contacts and sign-in.', 'tn', 'Leloko lengwe le lengwe: dinomoro, maemo, seteišene, karolo, bagolagani le go tsena.'),
('Every milestone, update, evidence upload and audited action — from the first call{value}', 'tn', 'Kgato nngwe le nngwe e e botlhokwa, ntšhafatso, go tsenngwa ga bosupi le tiro e e tlhatlhobilweng — go tswa mo mogaleng wa ntlha{value}'),
('Every module on the platform — what your role and your organisation''s switches allow.', 'tn', 'Mojule mongwe le mongwe mo seraleng — se tiro ya gago le dikonopo tsa mokgatlho wa gago di se letlang.'),
('Every organisation on this deployment. Each tenant’s data, users, configuration and feature switches are isolated at the database — a row in one tenant does not exist for another, on any screen, in any export, in any search.', 'tn', 'Mokgatlho mongwe le mongwe mo tirisong eno. Data ya mohiri mongwe le mongwe, badirisi, thulaganyo le dikonopo tsa dilo di kgaogantswe mo database — mola wa mohiri mongwe ga o yo mo go yo mongwe, mo sekirining sepe, mo go romeleng kwa ntle gope, mo patlong epe.'),
('Every place assessed on site, added up.', 'tn', 'Lefelo lengwe le lengwe le le sekasekilweng kwa lefelong, le kopantswe.'),
('Every police report. Search, filter, export, or open one to read it in full.', 'tn', 'Pego nngwe le nngwe ya sepodisi. Batla, sefa, romela kwa ntle, kgotsa o bule e le nngwe go e bala yotlhe.'),
('Every punch, newest first.', 'tn', 'Go tsena mo tirong gongwe le gongwe, go go šwa pele.'),
('Every recorded action on a case: who logged it, routed it, responded, filed the report and closed it. Audit rows are permanent.', 'tn', 'Tiro nngwe le nngwe e e kwadilweng mo molatong: yo o o kwadileng, yo o o kaetseng tsela, yo o tsibogileng, yo o rometseng pego le yo o o tswetseng. Mela ya tlhatlhobo e nnela ruri.'),
('Every report officers file, colour-coded by form. Choose where to go.', 'tn', 'Pego nngwe le nngwe e bapodisi ba e romelang, e kgaogantswe ka mebala go ya ka foromo. Tlhopha kwa o yang teng.'),
('Every section, from observations to sign-off.', 'tn', 'Karolo nngwe le nngwe, go tswa mo ditemogong go fitlha go saena.'),
('Every site, what it is used for, its risk and when it is due.', 'tn', 'Lefelo lengwe le lengwe, se le dirisediwang sona, kotsi ya lona le gore le tshwanetse leng.'),
('Every stage', 'tn', 'Kgato nngwe le nngwe'),
('Every vehicle is on the road.', 'tn', 'Koloi nngwe le nngwe e mo tseleng.'),
('Every vehicle, who is driving it, its last inspection and licence disc. Officers choose a vehicle in the app at the start of a shift; one that fails its inspection comes off the road until it is returned to service here.', 'tn', 'Koloi nngwe le nngwe, yo o e kgweetsang, tlhatlhobo ya yone ya bofelo le tisiki ya laesense. Bapodisi ba tlhopha koloi ka app kwa tshimologong ya šifiti; e e paletsweng ke tlhatlhobo e ntshiwa mo tseleng go fitlha e busediwa mo tirong fano.'),
('Everyone', 'tn', 'Botlhe'),
('Everyone due has started.', 'tn', 'Botlhe ba ba neng ba tshwanetse go simolola ba simolotse.'),
('Everyone in each team gets their team''s shifts as drafts. Anyone on leave, booked for court or already on a shift is left out, with the reason below. Issue the drafts when you are happy.', 'tn', 'Mongwe le mongwe mo setlhopheng sengwe le sengwe o bona dišifiti tsa setlhopha sa gagwe jaaka ditlhamo. Mang le mang yo o mo khunologong, yo o bukeletsweng kgotlatshekelo kgotsa yo o setseng a le mo šifiting o a tlogelwa, le lebaka kwa tlase. Ntsha ditlhamo fa o kgotsofetse.'),
('Everyone in the window', 'tn', 'Botlhe mo nakong eno'),
('Everyone inside must leave.', 'tn', 'Botlhe ba ba ka fa teng ba tshwanetse go tswa.'),
('Everyone is allocated.', 'tn', 'Botlhe ba abetswe.'),
('Everything an administrator needs to answer “is the platform working”, in one place. Each check says what it means, not just what it measured.', 'tn', 'Sengwe le sengwe se motsamaisi a se tlhokang go araba "a serala se a dira", mo lefelong le le lengwe. Teko nngwe le nngwe e bua se e se rayang, e seng fela se e se lekantseng.'),
('Everything delivered', 'tn', 'Tsotlhe di rometswe'),
('Everything has been delivered.', 'tn', 'Tsotlhe di setse di rometswe.'),
('Everything is filled in', 'tn', 'Tsotlhe di tladitswe'),
('Everything is filled in.', 'tn', 'Tsotlhe di tladitswe.'),
('Everything on the register for one ID number or one vehicle: fines, payments and when they were made, and what is owed today.', 'tn', 'Sengwe le sengwe se se mo rejisetareng sa nomore e le nngwe ya boitshupo kgotsa koloi e le nngwe: dikotlhao, dituelo le gore di dirilwe leng, le se se kolotwang gompieno.'),
('Everything that came in while you were busy, with what still needs your acknowledgement.', 'tn', 'Sengwe le sengwe se se tsileng fa o ne o tshwaregile, le tse di sa ntseng di tlhoka kamogelo ya gago.'),
('Everything they recorded stays: incidents, reports and their history.', 'tn', 'Sengwe le sengwe se ba se kwadileng se a nna: ditiragalo, dipego le hisitori ya tsone.'),
