('Official After-Action Reports. Filing one resolves the incident.', 'tn', 'Dipego tsa Semmuso tsa Morago ga Tiro. Go romela nngwe go rarabolola tiragalo.'),
('Official insignia belong to the municipality and its services, so the platform ships none — upload each department''s real crest here and it appears everywhere immediately. Until then a monogram badge renders in that department''s colours, so nothing ever looks unfinished. PNG or SVG with a transparent background works best; square crops read cleanest at small sizes.', 'tn', 'Matshwao a semmuso ke a mmasepala le ditirelo tsa one, ka jalo sethala ga se a tlise — tsenya letshwao la nnete la lefapha lengwe le lengwe fano mme le tlhagelela gongwe le gongwe ka bonako. Go fitlha ka nako eo beche ya ditlhaka tsa ntlha e bontshiwa ka mebala ya lefapha leo, ka jalo ga go na sepe se se lebegang se sa fediwa. PNG kgotsa SVG e e nang le bokafatlhoko jo bo bonalang e dira botoka; ditshwantsho tsa sekwere di balega sentle fa di le dinnye.'),
