('The account could not be loaded.', 'tn', 'Akhaonto ga e a kgona go laisiwa.'),
('The account is active as soon as you create it. You will know {value} password, and they do not confirm their badge number or accept the POPIA notice. Use an invitation where you can.', 'tn', 'Akhaonto e a dira ka bonako fa o e tlhama. O tla itse phasewete ya {value}, mme ga ba netefatse nomore ya bone ya beche kgotsa ba amogele kitsiso ya POPIA. Dirisa taletso fa o kgona.'),
('The account this member signs in with. Accounts are made by invitation.', 'tn', 'Akhaonto e leloko leno le tsenang ka yone. Diakhaonto di tlhamiwa ka taletso.'),
