('The app hit an unexpected error', 'tn', 'App e kopane le phoso e e sa lebelelwang'),
('The app opens by itself when this radio starts, and connects.', 'tn', 'App e a ipula fa radio eno e simolola, mme e a golagana.'),
('The armoury checklist — issue, return or inspect, safety items first.', 'tn', 'Lenaane la tlhatlhobo la polokelo ya dibetsa — go ntsha, go busetsa kgotsa go tlhatlhoba, dilo tsa polokesego pele.'),
('The assessment is filed by Disaster Management officers on site.', 'tn', 'Tlhatlhobo e romelwa ke bahlankedi ba Taolo ya Masetlapelo ba ba kwa lefelong.'),
