('The call', 'tn', 'Mogala'),
('The call centre calls this number when you are needed.', 'tn', 'Setsi sa megala se leletsa nomore eno fa o tlhokega.'),
('The call centre will no longer call you out.', 'tn', 'Setsi sa megala se ka se tlhole se go bitsa.'),
('The call is logged; attach the file again from the incident page.', 'tn', 'Mogala o kwadilwe; kgomaretsa faele gape go tswa mo tsebeng ya tiragalo.'),
('The caller', 'tn', 'Moletsi'),
