('The camera did not open. Try again.', 'tn', 'Khamera ga e a bulega. Leka gape.'),
('The camera is closed.', 'tn', 'Khamera e tswetswe.'),
('The camera is not set up yet. Ask the system administrator.', 'tn', 'Khamera ga e ise e rulaganngwe. Botsa motsamaisi wa tsamaiso.'),
('The camera registry (for the live map layer) is empty. It fills from the i-traffic API once SANRAL issues a key (', 'tn', 'Rejisetara ya dikhamera (ya legato la mmapa wa nako ya nnete) ga e na sepe. E tlala go tswa mo API ya i-traffic fa SANRAL e ntsha senotlelo ('),
('The camera’s code on the Hikvision platform (cameraIndexCode). Live video needs it.', 'tn', 'Khoutu ya khamera mo sethaleng sa Hikvision (cameraIndexCode). Bidio ya nako ya nnete e a e tlhoka.'),
('The case file is closed.', 'tn', 'Faele ya molato e tswetswe.'),
('The charge book has no amount for this offence yet. The record notes that you entered it.', 'tn', 'Buka ya melato ga e ise e nne le madi a molato ono. Rekoto e bontsha gore ke wena o a tsentseng.'),
('The check did not work.', 'tn', 'Tlhatlhobo ga e a dira.'),
('The clock register — append-only, corrections are new punches.', 'tn', 'Rejisetara ya sesupanako — go oketsa fela, dipaakanyo ke ditsenyo tse dintšhwa.'),
('The command dashboard''s launcher honours these rules too.', 'tn', 'Setlhomiso sa tešebotu ya balaodi le sone se obamela melao eno.'),
('The control room is viewing your bodycam', 'tn', 'Phaposi ya taolo e lebile bodycam ya gago'),
('The court date passed without payment: a warrant may be issued.', 'tn', 'Letlha la kgotlatshekelo le fetile go sa duelwa: warente e ka ntshiwa.'),
('The cycle every team works, a day at a time: shift codes ({value}) and a dash for a day off. Each team starts its cycle on a different day.', 'tn', 'Modikologo o setlhopha sengwe le sengwe se dirang ka one, letsatsi ka letsatsi: dikhoutu tsa šifiti ({value}) le mothalwana wa letsatsi la boikhutso. Setlhopha sengwe le sengwe se simolola modikologo wa sone ka letsatsi le le farologaneng.'),
('The daily duty sheet for parade. Choose the section, the date and the operation, then print. Times members signed on or off in the app fill in.', 'tn', 'Letlhare la tiro la letsatsi le letsatsi la paleiti. Tlhopha karolo, letlha le tiro, mme o gatise. Dinako tse maloko a saeneng go tsena kgotsa go tswa ka tsone mo app di a tlatswa.'),
('The dashboard, leave, search and their own profile only.', 'tn', 'Tešebotu, khunologo, go batla le porofaele ya bone fela.'),
('The data SIM in the bodycam', 'tn', 'SIM ya data mo bodycam'),
('The day the first team is on day one of the cycle.', 'tn', 'Letsatsi le setlhopha sa ntlha se leng mo letsatsing la ntlha la modikologo.'),
('The day’s sheet to print for parade: sign on, sign off and overtime.', 'tn', 'Letlhare la letsatsi la go gatisiwa la paleiti: go saena go tsena, go tswa le nako e e oketsegileng.'),
('The department administrator sets shift types, rotations and the late minutes. You can put people in teams.', 'tn', 'Motsamaisi wa lefapha o tlhoma mefuta ya dišifiti, go dikologa le metsotso ya go tla morago. O ka tsenya batho mo ditlhopheng.'),
('The duty office screens. The systems controller decides who may open each one, and whether they may change it.', 'tn', 'Dikiriini tsa ofisi ya tiro. Motsamaisi wa ditsamaiso o tsaya tshwetso ya gore ke mang yo o ka bulang nngwe le nngwe, le fa a ka e fetola.'),
('The eThekwini Fire By-law checks, then what follows.', 'tn', 'Ditlhatlhobo tsa Molao wa Mmasepala wa Molelo wa eThekwini, mme tse di latelang.'),
('The electronic vehicle inspection report has been finalised.', 'tn', 'Pego ya eleketeroniki ya tlhatlhobo ya koloi e weditswe.'),
('The end date must not be before the start date.', 'tn', 'Letlha la bofelo ga le a tshwanela go nna pele ga letlha la tshimologo.'),
('The engine has not run yet.', 'tn', 'Enjene ga e ise e dire.'),
('The file is read on this computer. Nothing is saved until you confirm, and the file itself is never stored.', 'tn', 'Faele e balwa mo khomphiutareng eno. Ga go sepe se se bolokwang go fitlha o netefatsa, mme faele ka boyone ga e ke e bolokwa.'),
('The file is read on this computer. Nothing reaches HikTech until you confirm, and then only the rows you confirm. The file itself is never stored.', 'tn', 'Faele e balwa mo khomphiutareng eno. Ga go sepe se se gorogang kwa HikTech go fitlha o netefatsa, mme go goroga fela mela e o e netefatsang. Faele ka boyone ga e ke e bolokwa.'),
('The fine shows on that incident’s record.', 'tn', 'Kotlhao e tlhagelela mo rekotong ya tiragalo eo.'),
('The firearm', 'tn', 'Tlhobolo'),
('The firearm checklist is not enabled for your organisation.', 'tn', 'Lenaane la tlhatlhobo la tlhobolo ga le a bulelwa mokgatlho wa gago.'),
('The firearm did not pass its inspection and has been marked for maintenance. Your inspection is on record. Select another firearm, or tick No firearm, to complete your start of shift.', 'tn', 'Tlhobolo ga e a atlega mo tlhatlhobong mme e tshwailwe gore e baakanngwe. Tlhatlhobo ya gago e mo rekotong. Tlhopha tlhobolo e nngwe, kgotsa o tshwaye Ga go na tlhobolo, go fetsa tshimologo ya šifiti ya gago.'),
('The firearm serial number is required.', 'tn', 'Nomore ya serial ya tlhobolo e a tlhokega.'),
('The force number printed on the duty sheet.', 'tn', 'Nomore ya lephata e e gatisitsweng mo letlhareng la tiro.'),
('The heading the sheet prints under. The list is kept in Configuration.', 'tn', 'Setlhogo se letlhare le gatisiwang ka fa tlase ga sone. Lenaane le bolokwa mo Thulaganyong.'),
('The incident record is closed.', 'tn', 'Rekoto ya tiragalo e tswetswe.'),
('The infringer refused to sign', 'tn', 'Motlolamolao o ganne go saena'),
('The inspection was filed. One or more essential checks failed, so the vehicle is off the road and your supervisor has been told. Choose another vehicle; this one comes back once fleet control returns it to service.', 'tn', 'Tlhatlhobo e rometswe. Tlhatlhobo e le nngwe kgotsa go feta ya botlhokwa e paletswe, ka jalo koloi ga e sa le mo tseleng mme motsamaisi wa gago o boleletswe. Tlhopha koloi e nngwe; eno e boa fa taolo ya dikoloi e e busetsa mo tirong.'),
('The inspection was filed. One or more essential checks failed, so {unit} is off the road and your supervisor has been told. Choose another vehicle; this one comes back once fleet control returns it to service.', 'tn', 'Tlhatlhobo e rometswe. Tlhatlhobo e le nngwe kgotsa go feta ya botlhokwa e paletswe, ka jalo {unit} ga e sa le mo tseleng mme motsamaisi wa gago o boleletswe. Tlhopha koloi e nngwe; eno e boa fa taolo ya dikoloi e e busetsa mo tirong.'),
('The last reading was {km} km. Check the odometer.', 'tn', 'Go bala ga bofelo e ne e le {km} km. Tlhatlhoba odometara.'),
('The latest reports filed.', 'tn', 'Dipego tsa bosheng tse di rometsweng.'),
('The latest views of these bodycams, live or recorded, with the reason given. Every one is also in the audit log.', 'tn', 'Dilebelelo tsa bosheng tsa di-bodycam tse, tsa nako ya nnete kgotsa tse di gatisitsweng, le lebaka le le neilweng. Nngwe le nngwe e teng le mo logong ya tlhatlhobo.'),
('The lead filed the report.', 'tn', 'Moeteledipele o rometse pego.'),
('The ledger sets Paid and Partially Paid. Entries are never edited or deleted.', 'tn', 'Buka ya madi e tlhoma E duetswe le E Duetswe Karolo. Ditsenyo ga di ke di fetolwa kgotsa di phimolwa.'),
('The list of absence types used for leave and on the duty sheet.', 'tn', 'Lenaane la mefuta ya go seyo e e dirisiwang mo khunologong le mo letlhareng la tiro.'),
('The list of absence types: AL, SL, AWOL and the rest.', 'tn', 'Lenaane la mefuta ya go seyo: AL, SL, AWOL le tse dingwe.'),
('The map could not load. Check your connection.', 'tn', 'Mmapa ga o a kgona go laisa. Tlhatlhoba kgolagano ya gago.'),
('The money that moves against fines and charges — {length} entries, net R{fixed}.', 'tn', 'Madi a a tsamayang kgatlhanong le dikotlhao le melato — ditsenyo di le {length}, palogotlhe ya R{fixed}.'),
('The municipality''s crest: it also appears on report PDFs, report screens in the app and the menu. Use a PNG for the PDFs.', 'tn', 'Letshwao la mmasepala: le tlhagelela gape mo di-PDF tsa dipego, mo dikiriining tsa dipego mo app le mo menyung. Dirisa PNG mo di-PDF.'),
('The notice could not be saved on this phone.', 'tn', 'Kitsiso ga e a kgona go bolokwa mo founung eno.'),
('The number this member is found by everywhere in the system.', 'tn', 'Nomore e leloko leno le bonwang ka yone gongwe le gongwe mo tsamaisong.'),
('The only vehicle is taken. You can continue your shift without one.', 'tn', 'Koloi e le nosi e tserwe. O ka tswelela ka šifiti ya gago kwa ntle ga yone.'),
('The operational areas that appear beside every officer on the duty board — NR, DR, B, CH…', 'tn', 'Mafelo a tiro a a tlhagelelang gaufi le mohlankedi mongwe le mongwe mo botong ya tiro — NR, DR, B, CH…'),
('The organisation must keep at least {value}. Until it has them, the current SystemAdmin cannot be demoted or deactivated, and if they are unavailable nobody can manage accounts. A new SystemAdmin needs a second approval; with nobody else to give it, the SuperAdmin decides.', 'tn', 'Mokgatlho o tshwanetse go boloka bonnye {value}. Go fitlha o na le bone, SystemAdmin wa jaanong a ka se fokotswe kgotsa a timiwe, mme fa a sa bonale ga go na ope yo o ka laolang diakhaonto. SystemAdmin yo mošwa o tlhoka tetla ya bobedi; fa go se na ope yo mongwe yo o ka e nayang, SuperAdmin o a tsaya tshwetso.'),
('The overtime code this section books overtime against.', 'tn', 'Khoutu ya nako e e oketsegileng e karolo eno e bukelang nako e e oketsegileng ka yone.'),
('The patient', 'tn', 'Molwetse'),
('The photo on the incident is filed with this report.', 'tn', 'Setshwantsho se se mo tiragalong se romelwa le pego eno.'),
('The photo was not saved. Try again.', 'tn', 'Setshwantsho ga se a bolokwa. Leka gape.'),
('The pin is in the wrong place', 'tn', 'Phini e mo lefelong le le phoso'),
('The platform sent an insecure (http) stream address, which the browser may refuse. Ask Hikvision to stream over HTTPS.', 'tn', 'Sethala se rometse aterese ya go phasalatsa e e sa babalesegang (http), e sefetlhi se ka e ganang. Kopa Hikvision gore e phasalatse ka HTTPS.'),
('The queue is clear.', 'tn', 'Mola o phepa.'),
('The radio always comes back to HikTech, after a restart too.', 'tn', 'Radio e nna e boela kwa HikTech, le morago ga go simolola gape.'),
('The rank this call sign needs, e.g. ST for the sergeant in charge.', 'tn', 'Maemo a leswao leno la pitso le a tlhokang, sk. ST go sajene yo o laolang.'),
('The recipient also gets a low-priority alert, phone included.', 'tn', 'Moamogedi le ene o bona tlhagiso ya botlhokwa jo bo kwa tlase, go akaretswa founu.'),
('The record you''re looking for doesn''t exist or you don''t have access to it.', 'tn', 'Rekoto e o e batlang ga e yo kgotsa ga o na phitlhelelo mo go yone.'),
('The recording produced no audio.', 'tn', 'Go gatisa ga go a ntsha modumo.'),
('The register is not set up yet. Run migration 0101 in Supabase, then reload.', 'tn', 'Rejisetara ga e ise e rulaganngwe. Dirisa migration 0101 mo Supabase, mme o laise gape.'),
('The register refused this notice: {reason}. Fix it by issuing a corrected notice; this one stays in the sync tray until you discard it.', 'tn', 'Rejisetara e ganne kitsiso eno: {reason}. E baakanye ka go ntsha kitsiso e e baakantsweng; eno e nna mo tereing ya go romela go fitlha o e latlha.'),
('The report cannot be filed yet:', 'tn', 'Pego ga e ise e kgone go romelwa:'),
('The report is filed. Its forms show here once it has reached the server.', 'tn', 'Pego e rometswe. Diforomo tsa yone di tlhagelela fano fa e setse e gorogile mo seveng.'),
('The report on {incident_number} becomes a permanent record — it cannot be edited or deleted afterwards.', 'tn', 'Pego ya {incident_number} e nna rekoto ya leruri — e ka se fetolwe kgotsa e phimolwe morago.'),
('The reports', 'tn', 'Dipego'),
('The request to send with it', 'tn', 'Kopo ya go romela le yone'),
('The rules are installed and correct, but no scheduler is ticking them, so no escalation will fire on its own. Either enable', 'tn', 'Melao e tsentswe e bile e nepagetse, mme ga go na serulaganyi se se e dirisang, ka jalo ga go na go isa kwa godimo go go tla diragalang ka bogone. Kgotsa o bule'),
('The same response metrics at every level — organisation, department, area and member. Drill in; the definitions never change, only the calls they cover.', 'tn', 'Ditekanyo tse di tshwanang tsa karabo mo maemong otlhe — mokgatlho, lefapha, lefelo le leloko. Tsena ka fa teng; ditlhaloso ga di fetoge, ke megala fela e di e akaretsang.'),
('The same screens and powers as now.', 'tn', 'Dikiriini le dithata tse di tshwanang le tsa jaanong.'),
('The same window cut three ways — by member, by department, by incident type.', 'tn', 'Nako e e tshwanang e kgaogantswe ka ditsela tse tharo — ka leloko, ka lefapha, ka mofuta wa tiragalo.'),
('The scene', 'tn', 'Lefelo'),
('The secret is kept safe and never shown again.', 'tn', 'Sephiri se bolokwa se babalesegile mme ga se tlhole se bontshiwa gape.'),
('The server refused it. SMS or call the control room now.', 'tn', 'Seva e e ganne. Romela SMS kgotsa o leletse phaposi ya taolo jaanong.'),
('The server took too long to answer. Check your connection and try again.', 'tn', 'Seva e tsere nako e telele thata go araba. Tlhatlhoba kgolagano ya gago mme o leke gape.'),
('The shift types, rotations and teams the planner repeats.', 'tn', 'Mefuta ya dišifiti, go dikologa le ditlhopha tse morulaganyi a di boeletsang.'),
('The site is compliant.', 'tn', 'Saete e obamela melao.'),
('The staff register is empty. Import HR’s staff list first.', 'tn', 'Rejisetara ya badiri ga e na sepe. Tsenya lenaane la badiri la HR pele.'),
('The station the call sign works from.', 'tn', 'Seteišene se leswao la pitso le dirang go sone.'),
('The talk button talks on your team’s group; the SOS button raises an SOS. Most radios work without setting up. If a button does nothing, teach it here.', 'tn', 'Konopo ya go bua e bua mo setlhopheng sa gago; konopo ya SOS e tlhagisa SOS. Diradio di le dintsi di dira kwa ntle ga go rulaganngwa. Fa konopo e sa dire sepe, e rute fano.'),
('The team a rotation rosters (A, B, C, D or Red, Blue, Green).', 'tn', 'Setlhopha se go dikologa go se tsenyang mo lenaaneong (A, B, C, D kgotsa Khibidu, Botala jwa legodimo, Tala).'),
('The two PINs are not the same. Enter your new PIN again.', 'tn', 'Di-PIN tse pedi ga di tshwane. Tsenya PIN ya gago e ntšhwa gape.'),
('The units duty is given to, and the stations they work from.', 'tn', 'Diyuniti tse di neilweng tiro, le diteišene tse di dirang go tsone.'),
('The vehicle, item by item: OK, Fault or NIL.', 'tn', 'Koloi, selo ka selo: GO SIAME, Phoso kgotsa GA GO NA.'),
('The yearly entitlement shown on leave balances. Empty for none.', 'tn', 'Tshwanelo ya ngwaga e e bontshiwang mo dipalanseng tsa khunologo. E se na sepe fa e le gore ga e yo.'),
('The {unitWord} goes for maintenance and your supervisor is told.', 'tn', '{unitWord} e ya go baakanngwa mme motsamaisi wa gago o a bolelelwa.'),
('Theft', 'tn', 'Bogodu'),
('Theft of motor vehicle', 'tn', 'Bogodu jwa koloi'),
('Their age?', 'tn', 'Dingwaga tsa bone?'),
('Their condition', 'tn', 'Seemo sa bone'),
('Their invitation goes here.', 'tn', 'Taletso ya bone e ya fano.'),
('Their vehicle and registration', 'tn', 'Koloi ya bone le kwadiso'),
('Theme', 'tn', 'Setaele'),
('Then add its call signs on Call Signs.', 'tn', 'Mme o oketse maswao a yone a pitso mo Maswaong a Pitso.'),
('These are safe for media and community distribution.', 'tn', 'Tse di babalesegile mo bobegaditaba le go phasalatswa mo setšhabeng.'),
('These email addresses and cellphone numbers come from HR’s staff list.', 'tn', 'Diaterese tse tsa imeile le dinomore tsa diselefouno di tswa mo lenaaneong la badiri la HR.'),
('They accept, then your supervisor approves. Until then your shift stays yours.', 'tn', 'Ba a amogela, mme motsamaisi wa gago o a letlelela. Go fitlha ka nako eo šifiti ya gago e nna e le ya gago.'),
('They are handed back when you end your shift.', 'tn', 'Di a busediwa fa o fetsa šifiti ya gago.'),
('They come off duty and off rosters straight away.', 'tn', 'Ba tswa mo tirong le mo mananeong ka bonako.'),
('They go back on rosters, and on duty only after their next start of shift.', 'tn', 'Ba boela mo mananeong, le mo tirong fela morago ga tshimologo ya šifiti ya bone e e latelang.'),
('This account has been deactivated. If you think this is a mistake, speak to your station commander or system administrator.', 'tn', 'Akhaonto eno e timilwe. Fa o akanya gore ke phoso, bua le molaodi wa seteišene sa gago kgotsa motsamaisi wa tsamaiso.'),
('This account holds a powerful role, so a second SystemAdmin must approve. Nothing changes until they do.', 'tn', 'Akhaonto eno e na le seabe se se maatla, ka jalo SystemAdmin wa bobedi o tshwanetse go letlelela. Ga go sepe se se fetogang go fitlha ba letlelela.'),
('This bodycam will not be issued', 'tn', 'Bodycam eno e ka se ntshiwe'),
('This build has no push service configured, so alerts arrive only while the app is open. Report it to your system administrator before carrying this handset on shift.', 'tn', 'Kgatiso eno ga e na tirelo ya dikitsiso e e rulagantsweng, ka jalo ditlhagiso di goroga fela fa app e butswe. Bega se kwa motsamaising wa tsamaiso pele o tshwara founu eno mo šifiting.'),
('This build has no web address configured, so accounts cannot be activated in the app. Use the link on the HikTech website, or ask an administrator to set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.', 'tn', 'Kgatiso eno ga e na aterese ya webo e e rulagantsweng, ka jalo diakhaonto di ka se bulwe mo app. Dirisa kgolagano mo webosaeteng ya HikTech, kgotsa o kope motsamaisi gore a tlhome EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.'),
('This build has no web address configured, so features that run on the server are unavailable. An administrator needs to set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.', 'tn', 'Kgatiso eno ga e na aterese ya webo e e rulagantsweng, ka jalo dikarolo tse di dirang mo seveng ga di bonale. Motsamaisi o tshwanetse go tlhoma EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.'),
('This build has no web address configured.', 'tn', 'Kgatiso eno ga e na aterese ya webo e e rulagantsweng.'),
('This call has no map position. Mark On Scene when you get there.', 'tn', 'Mogala ono ga o na lefelo mo mmapeng. Tshwaya O kwa lefelong fa o goroga teng.'),
('This cannot be undone. Press again to go ahead.', 'tn', 'Se se ka se busediwe morago. Tobetsa gape go tswelela.'),
('This checklist will file as NOT PASSED until every safety item above is ticked. The record cannot claim otherwise.', 'tn', 'Lenaane leno la tlhatlhobo le tla romelwa jaaka GA LE A ATLEGA go fitlha dilo tsotlhe tsa polokesego fa godimo di tshwailwe. Rekoto e ka se bue se sengwe.'),
('This code can’t be used', 'tn', 'Khoutu eno e ka se dirisiwe'),
('This code is shown', 'tn', 'Khoutu eno e a bontshiwa'),
('This cycle', 'tn', 'Modikologo ono'),
('This device belongs to another department. Use one of your own department''s devices, or sign in with your password.', 'tn', 'Sedirisiwa se ke sa lefapha le lengwe. Dirisa sengwe sa didirisiwa tsa lefapha la gago, kgotsa o tsene ka phasewete ya gago.'),
('This device is no longer registered for PIN sign-in. Sign in with your password, and ask your supervisor to register it again.', 'tn', 'Sedirisiwa se ga se tlhole se kwadisitswe go tsena ka PIN. Tsena ka phasewete ya gago, mme o kope motsamaisi wa gago gore a se kwadise gape.'),
('This device is not registered for PIN sign-in. Your supervisor registers shared radios and phones.', 'tn', 'Sedirisiwa se ga se a kwadisiwa go tsena ka PIN. Motsamaisi wa gago o kwadisa diradio le difounu tsa go abelana.'),
('This device is not set up for PIN sign-in yet. A supervisor or administrator sets it up once: sign in with a password, open Profile, then Sign-in PIN, then Register this device.', 'tn', 'Sedirisiwa se ga se ise se rulaganyediwe go tsena ka PIN. Motsamaisi kgotsa molaodi o se rulaganya ga le nngwe: tsena ka phasewete, bula Porofaele, mme PIN ya go Tsena, mme Kwadisa sedirisiwa se.'),
('This device is registered for PIN sign-in: {device}', 'tn', 'Sedirisiwa se se kwadisitswe go tsena ka PIN: {device}'),
('This device no longer signs anyone in with a PIN.', 'tn', 'Sedirisiwa se ga se tlhole se tsenya ope ka PIN.'),
('This feed stops in {secondsToAnswer} s to save the bodycam’s mobile data.', 'tn', 'Phasalatso eno e emisiwa mo metsotswaneng e le {secondsToAnswer} go boloka data ya selefouno ya bodycam.'),
('This firearm will not be issued', 'tn', 'Tlhobolo eno e ka se ntshiwe'),
('This import changes nothing about them. They may have left: review them on the Personnel page afterwards.', 'tn', 'Go tsenya mo ga go fetole sepe ka bone. Ba ka nna ba tlogetse: ba sekaseke mo tsebeng ya Badiri morago.'),
('This is a {severity} call. The {desks} dispatch desk can start now with what you have.', 'tn', 'Ono ke mogala wa {severity}. Teseke ya go romela ya {desks} e ka simolola jaanong ka se o nang le sone.'),
('This is a {severity} call. The {desks} dispatch desks can start now with what you have.', 'tn', 'Ono ke mogala wa {severity}. Diteseke tsa go romela tsa {desks} di ka simolola jaanong ka se o nang le sone.'),
('This is your SOS — dispatch is sending help to you.', 'tn', 'Eno ke SOS ya gago — baromedi ba romela thuso kwa go wena.'),
('This list covers {join}. People in those departments it leaves out are shown for review; nobody is removed.', 'tn', 'Lenaane leno le akaretsa {join}. Batho ba mo mafapheng ao le ba tlogelang ba bontshiwa gore ba sekasekwe; ga go na ope yo o tlosiwang.'),
('This member has no account yet, so they cannot be given screens.', 'tn', 'Leloko leno ga le ise le nne le akhaonto, ka jalo le ka se neelwe dikiriini.'),
