('This phone will not ring for a dispatch. Turn notifications on for HikTech in the device settings. Alerts still arrive instantly while the app is open.', 'tn', 'Founu eno e ka se lle fa go romelwa. Bula dikitsiso tsa HikTech mo dithulaganyong tsa sedirisiwa. Ditlhagiso di sa ntse di goroga ka bonako fa app e butswe.'),
