('Enabling a feature never grants a role anything the route matrix and row-level security would not — the two systems compose. Disabling one hides it everywhere and makes its server routes refuse, for this tenant only.', 'st', 'Ho bula sebopeho ha ho fe mosebetsi letho leo matrix ya ditsela le polokeho ya boemo ba mola di neng di ke ke tsa le dumella — ditsamaiso tse pedi di sebetsa mmoho. Ho tima se seng ho se pata hohle mme ho etsa hore ditsela tsa sona tsa sebeletsi di hane, mohiring ona feela.'),
