('Evacuation area', 'st', 'Sebaka sa ho tswa'),
('Every bodycam on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book one out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'st', 'Khamera e nngwe le e nngwe ya mmele rejistareng, moo e bolokwang teng le hore ke mang ya nang le yona hona jwale. Diofisiri di ntsha e le nngwe ka app qalong ya shifi mme di e kgutlisa pele shifi e fela.'),
('Every change needs a reason and the {kind} typed back. Changes to SystemAdmin, Admin or SystemController also need a second SystemAdmin.', 'st', 'Phetoho e nngwe le e nngwe e hloka lebaka le {kind} e ngolwa hape. Diphetoho ho SystemAdmin, Admin kapa SystemController di boetse di hloka SystemAdmin wa bobedi.'),
('Every change, from the audit trail.', 'st', 'Phetoho e nngwe le e nngwe, ho tswa motlhaleng wa tlhahlobo.'),
('Every check passed so far. Next visit due {date}.', 'st', 'Tlhahlobo e nngwe le e nngwe e atlehile ho fihlela jwale. Ketelo e latelang e lokela {date}.'),
('Every check passed. Next visit due {date}.', 'st', 'Tlhahlobo e nngwe le e nngwe e atlehile. Ketelo e latelang e lokela {date}.'),
('Every closed case: reviewed after its report, or closed without one by the desk, with who and why.', 'st', 'Nyewe e nngwe le e nngwe e kwetsweng: e hlahlobilwe kamora tlaleho ya yona, kapa e kwetswe ntle le yona ke tafole, le hore ke mang le hore ke hobaneng.'),
('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted with a blocking pop-up that must be acknowledged.', 'st', 'Sehlopha se seng le se seng se mosebetsing ho {desks} se lemoswa ka popup e thibelang e lokelang ho amohelwa.'),
('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted.', 'st', 'Sehlopha se seng le se seng se mosebetsing ho {desks} se a lemoswa.'),
('Every crew out is on the Active Responders terminal', 'st', 'Sehlopha se seng le se seng se tswileng se ho Active Responders terminal'),
('Every crew still out, live. Open a row for the narrative and the timeline.', 'st', 'Sehlopha se seng le se seng se ntseng se le ka ntle, ka nako ya jwale. Bula mola ho bona pale le mola wa nako.'),
('Every department', 'st', 'Mafapha ohle'),
('Every external service HikTech talks to — what it powers, whether its credentials are present, and whether it currently answers.', 'st', 'Tshebeletso e nngwe le e nngwe ya ka ntle eo HikTech e buang le yona — seo e se fang matla, haeba dintlha tsa yona tsa ho kena di le teng, le haeba e a araba hona jwale.'),
('Every feed shows a sample video, not the bodycam. Switch it off under Admin → Integrations → Hikvision once the platform is connected.', 'st', 'Phatlalatso e nngwe le e nngwe e bontsha video ya mohlala, eseng khamera ya mmele. E time ka tlasa Admin → Dikgokahano → Hikvision hang ha sethala se hokahantswe.'),
('Every firearm on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book a firearm out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'st', 'Sethunya se seng le se seng rejistareng, moo se bolokwang teng le hore ke mang ya nang le sona hona jwale. Diofisiri di ntsha sethunya ka app qalong ya shifi mme di se kgutlisa pele shifi e fela.'),
('Every form', 'st', 'Foromo e nngwe le e nngwe'),
('Every hydrant is in service.', 'st', 'Hydrant e nngwe le e nngwe e a sebetsa.'),
('Every knob has a safe built-in default and hard bounds; a value outside its bounds is clamped, and deleting an override falls back to the default. Every change is written to the audit trail with your name on it.', 'st', 'Konopo e nngwe le e nngwe e na le tlwaelo e bolokehileng le meedi e thata; boleng bo ka ntle ho meedi ya bona bo a kgaolwa, mme ho hlakola phetolo ho kgutlela tlwaelong. Phetoho e nngwe le e nngwe e ngolwa motlhaleng wa tlhahlobo le lebitso la hao.'),
('Every leave or absence is captured under one of these codes. Office-only codes (AWOL, Suspended …) are never asked for by members.', 'st', 'Phomolo kapa ho se be teng ho hong le ho hong ho kenngwa tlasa e nngwe ya dikhoutu tsena. Dikhoutu tsa ofisi feela (AWOL, Emisitsweng …) ha di ke di kopuwa ke ditho.'),
('Every logged call across your visible silos.', 'st', 'Mohala o mong le o mong o ngodisitsweng mafapheng a hao a bonahalang.'),
('Every member: numbers, rank, station, section, contacts and sign-in.', 'st', 'Setho se seng le se seng: dinomoro, maemo, seteišene, karolo, bohokahanyi le ho kena.'),
('Every milestone, update, evidence upload and audited action — from the first call{value}', 'st', 'Mohato o mong le o mong wa bohlokwa, ntjhafatso, ho kenngwa ha bopaki le ketso e hlahlobilweng — ho tloha mohaleng wa pele{value}'),
('Every module on the platform — what your role and your organisation''s switches allow.', 'st', 'Mojule o mong le o mong sethaleng — seo mosebetsi wa hao le dikonopo tsa mokgatlo wa hao di se dumellang.'),
('Every organisation on this deployment. Each tenant’s data, users, configuration and feature switches are isolated at the database — a row in one tenant does not exist for another, on any screen, in any export, in any search.', 'st', 'Mokgatlo o mong le o mong tshebedisong ena. Data ya mohiri e mong le e mong, basebedisi, tlhophiso le dikonopo tsa dibopeho di arohantswe ho database — mola wa mohiri e mong ha o yo ho e mong, skrineng sefe kapa sefe, ho romeleng ka ntle hofe kapa hofe, patlong efe kapa efe.'),
('Every place assessed on site, added up.', 'st', 'Sebaka se seng le se seng se hlahlobilweng sebakeng, se kopantswe.'),
('Every police report. Search, filter, export, or open one to read it in full.', 'st', 'Tlaleho e nngwe le e nngwe ya sepolesa. Batla, sefa, romela ka ntle, kapa o bule e le nngwe ho e bala yohle.'),
('Every punch, newest first.', 'st', 'Ho kena mosebetsing ho hong le ho hong, ho hotjha pele.'),
('Every recorded action on a case: who logged it, routed it, responded, filed the report and closed it. Audit rows are permanent.', 'st', 'Ketso e nngwe le e nngwe e ngotsweng nyeweng: ya e ngotseng, ya e tataisitseng, ya arabileng, ya rometseng tlaleho le ya e kwetseng. Mela ya tlhahlobo ke ya ka mehla.'),
('Every report officers file, colour-coded by form. Choose where to go.', 'st', 'Tlaleho e nngwe le e nngwe eo diofisiri di e romelang, e arohantswe ka mebala ho ya ka foromo. Kgetha moo o yang teng.'),
('Every section, from observations to sign-off.', 'st', 'Karolo e nngwe le e nngwe, ho tloha ho ditemoho ho fihla ho saena.'),
('Every site, what it is used for, its risk and when it is due.', 'st', 'Sebaka se seng le se seng, seo se sebedisetswang sona, kotsi ya sona le hore se lokela neng.'),
('Every stage', 'st', 'Mohato o mong le o mong'),
('Every vehicle is on the road.', 'st', 'Koloi e nngwe le e nngwe e tseleng.'),
('Every vehicle, who is driving it, its last inspection and licence disc. Officers choose a vehicle in the app at the start of a shift; one that fails its inspection comes off the road until it is returned to service here.', 'st', 'Koloi e nngwe le e nngwe, ya e kgannang, tlhahlobo ya yona ya ho qetela le disiki ya laesense. Diofisiri di kgetha koloi ka app qalong ya shifi; e hlolehileng tlhahlobong e ntshwa tseleng ho fihlela e kgutlisetswa mosebetsing mona.'),
('Everyone', 'st', 'Bohle'),
('Everyone due has started.', 'st', 'Bohle ba neng ba lokela ho qala ba qadile.'),
('Everyone in each team gets their team''s shifts as drafts. Anyone on leave, booked for court or already on a shift is left out, with the reason below. Issue the drafts when you are happy.', 'st', 'E mong le e mong sehlopheng se seng le se seng o fumana dishifi tsa sehlopha sa hae e le meralo. Mang kapa mang ya phomolong, ya bukelletsweng lekgotla kapa ya seng a le shifing o a tlohelwa, le lebaka ka tlase. Ntsha meralo ha o kgotsofetse.'),
('Everyone in the window', 'st', 'Bohle nakong ena'),
('Everyone inside must leave.', 'st', 'Bohle ba ka hare ba tlameha ho tswa.'),
('Everyone is allocated.', 'st', 'Bohle ba abetswe.'),
('Everything an administrator needs to answer “is the platform working”, in one place. Each check says what it means, not just what it measured.', 'st', 'Tsohle tseo motsamaisi a di hlokang ho araba "na sethala se a sebetsa", sebakeng se le seng. Teko e nngwe le e nngwe e bolela seo e se bolelang, eseng feela seo e se lekantseng.'),
('Everything delivered', 'st', 'Tsohle di rometswe'),
('Everything has been delivered.', 'st', 'Tsohle di se di rometswe.'),
('Everything is filled in', 'st', 'Tsohle di tlatswe'),
('Everything is filled in.', 'st', 'Tsohle di tladitswe.'),
('Everything on the register for one ID number or one vehicle: fines, payments and when they were made, and what is owed today.', 'st', 'Tsohle tse rejistareng tsa nomoro e le nngwe ya boitsebiso kapa koloi e le nngwe: dikotlo, ditefello le hore di entswe neng, le se kolotwang kajeno.'),
('Everything that came in while you were busy, with what still needs your acknowledgement.', 'st', 'Tsohle tse fihlileng ha o ne o tshwarehile, le tse ntseng di hloka kamohelo ya hao.'),
('Everything they recorded stays: incidents, reports and their history.', 'st', 'Tsohle tseo ba di ngotseng di a dula: diketsahalo, ditlaleho le nalane ya tsona.'),
('Evidence', 'st', 'Bopaki'),
('Evidence & Exports', 'st', 'Bopaki le ho romela ka ntle'),
('Evidence ({length})', 'st', 'Bopaki ({length})'),
('Evidence / portfolio ref', 'st', 'Tshupiso ya bopaki / ya potfolio'),
('Evidence file', 'st', 'Faele ya bopaki'),
('Evidence is captured by the crew working this incident.', 'st', 'Bopaki bo bokellwa ke sehlopha se sebetsang ketsahalong ena.'),
('Evidence log / SAP13 reference', 'st', 'Rekoto ya bopaki / tshupiso ya SAP13'),
