('I have read this shift', 'st', 'Ke badile shifi ena'),
('I know how your department works and I can read the live board your role can see. Ask me anything, or tell me what to do. I prepare it, and nothing changes until you confirm.', 'st', 'Ke tseba hore lefapha la hao le sebetsa jwang mme nka bala boto e phelang eo karolo ya hao e e bonang. Mpotse eng kapa eng, kapa o mpolelle seo nka se etsang. Ke a se lokisa, mme ha ho letho le fetohang ho fihlela o netefatsa.'),
('I know your shift, your calls, your leave and your kit. Ask me anything about your work, in your own words. I explain and show you where to go; you do the work.', 'st', 'Ke tseba shifi ya hao, mehala ya hao, phomolo ya hao le disebediswa tsa hao. Mpotse eng kapa eng ka mosebetsi wa hao, ka mantswe a hao. Ke a hlalosa mme ke o bontshe moo o lokelang ho ya teng; wena o etsa mosebetsi.'),
('I personally completed these checks and confirm that the answers and any defects recorded are accurate.', 'st', 'Ke phethile ditlhahlobo tsena ka bonna mme ke netefatsa hore dikarabo le diphoso tse ngotsweng di nepahetse.'),
