('The account can be reactivated later, with a reason.', 'st', 'Akhaonte e ka bulwa hape hamorao, ka lebaka.'),
('The account could not be loaded.', 'st', 'Akhaonte ha e a kgona ho laishwa.'),
('The account is active as soon as you create it. You will know {value} password, and they do not confirm their badge number or accept the POPIA notice. Use an invitation where you can.', 'st', 'Akhaonte e a sebetsa hanghang ha o e theha. O tla tseba phasewete ya {value}, mme ha ba netefatse nomoro ya bona ya beche kapa ba amohele tsebiso ya POPIA. Sebedisa memo moo o ka kgonang.'),
('The account this member signs in with. Accounts are made by invitation.', 'st', 'Akhaonte eo setho sena se kenang ka yona. Diakhaonte di thehwa ka memo.'),
('The ambulance will go off the road', 'st', 'Ambulense e tla tswa tseleng'),
('The amount was entered by the officer: the charge book had none for this offence.', 'st', 'Tjhelete e kentswe ke mohlankedi: buka ya diqoso e ne e se na yona molatong ona.'),
('The app hit an unexpected error', 'st', 'App e kopane le phoso e sa lebellwang'),
('The app opens by itself when this radio starts, and connects.', 'st', 'App e a ibula ha radio ena e qala, mme e a hokahana.'),
('The armoury checklist — issue, return or inspect, safety items first.', 'st', 'Lenane la tlhahlobo la polokelo ya dibetsa — ho ntsha, ho kgutlisa kapa ho hlahloba, dintho tsa polokeho pele.'),
('The assessment is filed by Disaster Management officers on site.', 'st', 'Tlhahlobo e romelwa ke bahlankedi ba Taolo ya Dikotsi ba sebakeng.'),
