('The call', 'st', 'Mohala'),
('The call centre calls this number when you are needed.', 'st', 'Setsi sa mehala se letsetsa nomoro ena ha o hlokahala.'),
('The call centre will no longer call you out.', 'st', 'Setsi sa mehala se ke ke sa hlola se o bitsa.'),
('The call is logged; attach the file again from the incident page.', 'st', 'Mohala o ngotswe; kgomaretsa faele hape ho tswa leqepheng la ketsahalo.'),
('The caller', 'st', 'Mofounedi'),
('The caller’s answer', 'st', 'Karabo ya mofounedi'),
('The calls you worked', 'st', 'Mehala eo o e sebeditseng'),
('The camera did not open. Try again.', 'st', 'Khamera ha e a buleha. Leka hape.'),
('The camera is closed.', 'st', 'Khamera e kwetswe.'),
('The camera is not set up yet. Ask the system administrator.', 'st', 'Khamera ha e eso hlophiswe. Botsa motsamaisi wa tsamaiso.'),
('The camera registry (for the live map layer) is empty. It fills from the i-traffic API once SANRAL issues a key (', 'st', 'Rejisetara ya dikhamera (ya lera la mmapa wa nako ya nnete) ha e na letho. E tlatswa ho tswa ho API ya i-traffic ha SANRAL e ntsha senotlolo ('),
('The camera’s code on the Hikvision platform (cameraIndexCode). Live video needs it.', 'st', 'Khoutu ya khamera sethaleng sa Hikvision (cameraIndexCode). Video ya nako ya nnete e a e hloka.'),
('The case file is closed.', 'st', 'Faele ya nyewe e kwetswe.'),
('The charge book has no amount for this offence yet. The record notes that you entered it.', 'st', 'Buka ya diqoso ha e eso be le tjhelete ya molato ona. Rekoto e bontsha hore ke wena ya e kentseng.'),
('The check did not work.', 'st', 'Tlhahlobo ha e a sebetsa.'),
('The clock register — append-only, corrections are new punches.', 'st', 'Rejisetara ya oache — ho eketsa feela, dikgalemo ke dikenyo tse ntjha.'),
('The command dashboard''s launcher honours these rules too.', 'st', 'Sethomisi sa dashboard ya balaodi le sona se hlompha melao ena.'),
('The control room is viewing your bodycam', 'st', 'Kamore ya taolo e shebile bodycam ya hao'),
('The court date passed without payment: a warrant may be issued.', 'st', 'Letsatsi la lekgotla le fetile ho sa lefuwe: warente e ka ntshwa.'),
('The cycle every team works, a day at a time: shift codes ({value}) and a dash for a day off. Each team starts its cycle on a different day.', 'st', 'Potoloho eo sehlopha se seng le se seng se sebetsang ka yona, letsatsi ka letsatsi: dikhoutu tsa shifi ({value}) le mothalwana wa letsatsi la phomolo. Sehlopha se seng le se seng se qala potoloho ya sona ka letsatsi le fapaneng.'),
('The daily duty sheet for parade. Choose the section, the date and the operation, then print. Times members signed on or off in the app fill in.', 'st', 'Leqephe la mosebetsi la letsatsi le letsatsi la pareiti. Kgetha karolo, letsatsi le mosebetsi, ebe o hatisa. Dinako tseo ditho di saenneng ho kena kapa ho tswa ka tsona ka app di a tlatswa.'),
('The dashboard, leave, search and their own profile only.', 'st', 'Dashboard, phomolo, ho batla le profaele ya bona feela.'),
('The data SIM in the bodycam', 'st', 'SIM ya data ho bodycam'),
('The day the first team is on day one of the cycle.', 'st', 'Letsatsi leo sehlopha sa pele se leng ho letsatsi la pele la potoloho.'),
('The day’s sheet to print for parade: sign on, sign off and overtime.', 'st', 'Leqephe la letsatsi la ho hatiswa la pareiti: ho saena ho kena, ho tswa le nako e eketsehileng.'),
('The department administrator sets shift types, rotations and the late minutes. You can put people in teams.', 'st', 'Motsamaisi wa lefapha o beha mefuta ya dishifi, ho potoloha le metsotso ya ho tla morao. O ka kenya batho dihlopheng.'),
('The duty office screens. The systems controller decides who may open each one, and whether they may change it.', 'st', 'Dikirini tsa ofisi ya mosebetsi. Motsamaisi wa ditsamaiso o etsa qeto ya hore ke mang ya ka bulang e nngwe le e nngwe, le hore na a ka e fetola.'),
('The eThekwini Fire By-law checks, then what follows.', 'st', 'Ditlhahlobo tsa Molao wa Masepala wa Mollo wa eThekwini, ebe tse latelang.'),
('The electronic vehicle inspection report has been finalised.', 'st', 'Tlaleho ya elektroniki ya tlhahlobo ya koloi e phethilwe.'),
('The end date must not be before the start date.', 'st', 'Letsatsi la ho qetela ha le a tshwanela ho ba pele ho letsatsi la qalo.'),
('The engine has not run yet.', 'st', 'Enjene ha e eso sebetse.'),
('The file is read on this computer. Nothing is saved until you confirm, and the file itself is never stored.', 'st', 'Faele e balwa khomphuteng ena. Ha ho letho le bolokwang ho fihlela o netefatsa, mme faele ka boyona ha e ke e bolokwa.'),
('The file is read on this computer. Nothing reaches HikTech until you confirm, and then only the rows you confirm. The file itself is never stored.', 'st', 'Faele e balwa khomphuteng ena. Ha ho letho le fihlang ho HikTech ho fihlela o netefatsa, mme ho fihla feela mela eo o e netefatsang. Faele ka boyona ha e ke e bolokwa.'),
('The fine shows on that incident’s record.', 'st', 'Kotlo e hlaha rekotong ya ketsahalo eo.'),
('The firearm', 'st', 'Sethunya'),
('The firearm checklist is not enabled for your organisation.', 'st', 'Lenane la tlhahlobo la sethunya ha le a bulelwa mokgatlo wa hao.'),
('The firearm did not pass its inspection and has been marked for maintenance. Your inspection is on record. Select another firearm, or tick No firearm, to complete your start of shift.', 'st', 'Sethunya ha se a atleha tlhahlobong mme se tshwailwe hore se lokiswe. Tlhahlobo ya hao e rekotong. Kgetha sethunya se seng, kapa o tshwaye Ha ho sethunya, ho qeta qalo ya shifi ya hao.'),
('The firearm serial number is required.', 'st', 'Nomoro ya serial ya sethunya e a hlokahala.'),
('The force number printed on the duty sheet.', 'st', 'Nomoro ya lekala e hatisitsweng leqepheng la mosebetsi.'),
('The heading the sheet prints under. The list is kept in Configuration.', 'st', 'Sehlooho seo leqephe le hatiswang ka tlasa sona. Lenane le bolokwa ho Tlhophiso.'),
('The incident record is closed.', 'st', 'Rekoto ya ketsahalo e kwetswe.'),
('The infringer refused to sign', 'st', 'Motlodi wa molao o hanne ho saena'),
('The inspection was filed. One or more essential checks failed, so the vehicle is off the road and your supervisor has been told. Choose another vehicle; this one comes back once fleet control returns it to service.', 'st', 'Tlhahlobo e rometswe. Tlhahlobo e le nngwe kapa ho feta ya bohlokwa e hlolehile, ka hona koloi ha e sa le tseleng mme mookamedi wa hao o bolelletswe. Kgetha koloi e nngwe; ena e kgutla ha taolo ya dikoloi e e kgutlisetsa mosebetsing.'),
('The inspection was filed. One or more essential checks failed, so {unit} is off the road and your supervisor has been told. Choose another vehicle; this one comes back once fleet control returns it to service.', 'st', 'Tlhahlobo e rometswe. Tlhahlobo e le nngwe kapa ho feta ya bohlokwa e hlolehile, ka hona {unit} ha e sa le tseleng mme mookamedi wa hao o bolelletswe. Kgetha koloi e nngwe; ena e kgutla ha taolo ya dikoloi e e kgutlisetsa mosebetsing.'),
('The last reading was {km} km. Check the odometer.', 'st', 'Ho bala ha ho qetela e ne e le {km} km. Hlahloba odometara.'),
('The latest reports filed.', 'st', 'Ditlaleho tsa morao tjena tse rometsweng.'),
('The latest views of these bodycams, live or recorded, with the reason given. Every one is also in the audit log.', 'st', 'Ditebello tsa morao tjena tsa di-bodycam tsena, tsa nako ya nnete kapa tse rekotilweng, le lebaka le fanweng. E nngwe le e nngwe e teng le logong ya tlhahlobo.'),
('The lead filed the report.', 'st', 'Moetapele o rometse tlaleho.'),
('The ledger sets Paid and Partially Paid. Entries are never edited or deleted.', 'st', 'Buka ya ditjhelete e beha E lefuwe le E Lefuwe Karolo. Dikenyo ha di ke di fetolwa kapa tsa hlakolwa.'),
('The list of absence types used for leave and on the duty sheet.', 'st', 'Lenane la mefuta ya ho ba siyo e sebediswang phomolong le leqepheng la mosebetsi.'),
('The list of absence types: AL, SL, AWOL and the rest.', 'st', 'Lenane la mefuta ya ho ba siyo: AL, SL, AWOL le tse ding.'),
('The map could not load. Check your connection.', 'st', 'Mmapa ha o a kgona ho laisha. Hlahloba kgokahano ya hao.'),
('The money that moves against fines and charges — {length} entries, net R{fixed}.', 'st', 'Tjhelete e tsamayang kgahlano le dikotlo le melato — dikenyo tse {length}, kakaretso ya R{fixed}.'),
('The municipality''s crest: it also appears on report PDFs, report screens in the app and the menu. Use a PNG for the PDFs.', 'st', 'Letshwao la masepala: le hlaha hape ho di-PDF tsa ditlaleho, dikirining tsa ditlaleho ka app le ho menyu. Sebedisa PNG bakeng sa di-PDF.'),
('The notice could not be saved on this phone.', 'st', 'Tsebiso ha e a kgona ho bolokwa founong ena.'),
('The number this member is found by everywhere in the system.', 'st', 'Nomoro eo setho sena se fumanwang ka yona hohle tsamaisong.'),
('The only vehicle is taken. You can continue your shift without one.', 'st', 'Koloi e le nngwe feela e nkilwe. O ka tswela pele ka shifi ya hao ntle le yona.'),
('The operational areas that appear beside every officer on the duty board — NR, DR, B, CH…', 'st', 'Dibaka tsa tshebetso tse hlahang pela mohlankedi e mong le e mong botong ya mosebetsi — NR, DR, B, CH…'),
('The organisation must keep at least {value}. Until it has them, the current SystemAdmin cannot be demoted or deactivated, and if they are unavailable nobody can manage accounts. A new SystemAdmin needs a second approval; with nobody else to give it, the SuperAdmin decides.', 'st', 'Mokgatlo o tshwanetse ho boloka bonyane {value}. Ho fihlela o ba le bona, SystemAdmin wa hajwale a ke ke a theolwa kapa a timwa, mme ha a sa fumanehe ha ho ya ka laolang diakhaonte. SystemAdmin e motjha o hloka tumello ya bobedi; ha ho se motho e mong ya ka e fang, SuperAdmin o a etsa qeto.'),
('The overtime code this section books overtime against.', 'st', 'Khoutu ya nako e eketsehileng eo karolo ena e bukang nako e eketsehileng ka yona.'),
('The patient', 'st', 'Mokudi'),
('The photo on the incident is filed with this report.', 'st', 'Setshwantsho se ketsahalong se romelwa le tlaleho ena.'),
('The photo was not saved. Try again.', 'st', 'Setshwantsho ha se a bolokwa. Leka hape.'),
('The pin is in the wrong place', 'st', 'Phini e sebakeng se fosahetseng'),
('The platform sent an insecure (http) stream address, which the browser may refuse. Ask Hikvision to stream over HTTPS.', 'st', 'Sethala se rometse aterese ya ho phatlalatsa e sa bolokehang (http), eo sebatli se ka e hanang. Kopa Hikvision hore e phatlalatse ka HTTPS.'),
('The queue is clear.', 'st', 'Mola o hlwekile.'),
('The radio always comes back to HikTech, after a restart too.', 'st', 'Radio e dula e kgutlela ho HikTech, le ka mora ho qala hape.'),
('The rank this call sign needs, e.g. ST for the sergeant in charge.', 'st', 'Boemo boo letshwao lena la pitso le bo hlokang, mohl. ST bakeng sa sajene ya laolang.'),
('The recipient also gets a low-priority alert, phone included.', 'st', 'Moamohedi le yena o fumana temoso ya bohlokwa bo tlase, ho kenyeletswa founu.'),
('The record you''re looking for doesn''t exist or you don''t have access to it.', 'st', 'Rekoto eo o e batlang ha e yo kapa ha o na phihlello ho yona.'),
('The recording produced no audio.', 'st', 'Ho rekota ha ho a hlahisa modumo.'),
('The register is not set up yet. Run migration 0101 in Supabase, then reload.', 'st', 'Rejisetara ha e eso hlophiswe. Sebedisa migration 0101 ho Supabase, ebe o laisha hape.'),
('The register refused this notice: {reason}. Fix it by issuing a corrected notice; this one stays in the sync tray until you discard it.', 'st', 'Rejisetara e hanne tsebiso ena: {reason}. E lokise ka ho ntsha tsebiso e lokisitsweng; ena e dula tereing ya ho romela ho fihlela o e lahla.'),
('The report cannot be filed yet:', 'st', 'Tlaleho ha e eso kgone ho romelwa:'),
('The report is filed. Its forms show here once it has reached the server.', 'st', 'Tlaleho e rometswe. Diforomo tsa yona di hlaha mona ha e se e fihlile sevareng.'),
('The report on {incident_number} becomes a permanent record — it cannot be edited or deleted afterwards.', 'st', 'Tlaleho ya {incident_number} e ba rekoto ya ka ho sa feleng — e ke ke ya fetolwa kapa ya hlakolwa kamora moo.'),
('The reports', 'st', 'Ditlaleho'),
('The request to send with it', 'st', 'Kopo ya ho romela le yona'),
('The rules are installed and correct, but no scheduler is ticking them, so no escalation will fire on its own. Either enable', 'st', 'Melao e kentswe mme e nepahetse, empa ha ho na sehlophisi se e sebedisang, ka hona ha ho na ho isa hodimo ho tla etsahala ka bohona. Ebang o bula'),
('The same response metrics at every level — organisation, department, area and member. Drill in; the definitions never change, only the calls they cover.', 'st', 'Ditekanyo tse tshwanang tsa karabo maemong ohle — mokgatlo, lefapha, sebaka le setho. Kena ka hare; ditlhaloso ha di fetohe, ke mehala feela eo di e kenyeletsang.'),
('The same screens and powers as now.', 'st', 'Dikirini le matla tse tshwanang le tsa hajwale.'),
('The same window cut three ways — by member, by department, by incident type.', 'st', 'Nako e tshwanang e arotswe ka ditsela tse tharo — ka setho, ka lefapha, ka mofuta wa ketsahalo.'),
('The scene', 'st', 'Sebaka'),
('The secret is kept safe and never shown again.', 'st', 'Sephiri se bolokwa se bolokehile mme ha se sa bontshwa hape.'),
('The server refused it. SMS or call the control room now.', 'st', 'Seva e e hanne. Romela SMS kapa o letsetse kamore ya taolo hona jwale.'),
('The server took too long to answer. Check your connection and try again.', 'st', 'Seva e nkile nako e telele haholo ho araba. Hlahloba kgokahano ya hao mme o leke hape.'),
('The shift types, rotations and teams the planner repeats.', 'st', 'Mefuta ya dishifi, ho potoloha le dihlopha tseo mohlophisi a di phetang.'),
('The site is compliant.', 'st', 'Sebaka se latela melao.'),
('The staff register is empty. Import HR’s staff list first.', 'st', 'Rejisetara ya basebetsi ha e na letho. Kenya lenane la basebetsi la HR pele.'),
('The station the call sign works from.', 'st', 'Seteishene seo letshwao la pitso le sebetsang ho sona.'),
('The talk button talks on your team’s group; the SOS button raises an SOS. Most radios work without setting up. If a button does nothing, teach it here.', 'st', 'Konopo ya ho bua e bua sehlopheng sa hao; konopo ya SOS e phahamisa SOS. Diradio tse ngata di sebetsa ntle le ho hlophiswa. Ha konopo e sa etse letho, e rute mona.'),
('The team a rotation rosters (A, B, C, D or Red, Blue, Green).', 'st', 'Sehlopha seo ho potoloha ho se kenyang lenaneng (A, B, C, D kapa Kgubedu, Botala ba lehodimo, Tala).'),
('The two PINs are not the same. Enter your new PIN again.', 'st', 'Di-PIN tse pedi ha di tshwane. Kenya PIN ya hao e ntjha hape.'),
('The units duty is given to, and the stations they work from.', 'st', 'Diyuniti tse fuweng mosebetsi, le diteishene tseo di sebetsang ho tsona.'),
('The vehicle, item by item: OK, Fault or NIL.', 'st', 'Koloi, ntho ka ntho: HO LOKILE, Phoso kapa HA HO.'),
('The yearly entitlement shown on leave balances. Empty for none.', 'st', 'Tokelo ya selemo e bontshwang ho dipalanse tsa phomolo. E se na letho ha e le hore ha e yo.'),
('The {unitWord} goes for maintenance and your supervisor is told.', 'st', '{unitWord} e ya ho lokiswa mme mookamedi wa hao o a bolellwa.'),
('Theft', 'st', 'Bosholu'),
('Theft of motor vehicle', 'st', 'Bosholu ba koloi'),
('Their age?', 'st', 'Dilemo tsa bona?'),
('Their condition', 'st', 'Boemo ba bona'),
('Their invitation goes here.', 'st', 'Memo ya bona e ya mona.'),
('Their vehicle and registration', 'st', 'Koloi ya bona le ngodiso'),
('Theme', 'st', 'Setaele'),
('Then add its call signs on Call Signs.', 'st', 'Ebe o eketsa matshwao a yona a pitso ho Matshwao a Pitso.'),
('These are safe for media and community distribution.', 'st', 'Tsena di bolokehile ho mecha ya ditaba le ho phatlalatswa setjhabeng.'),
('These email addresses and cellphone numbers come from HR’s staff list.', 'st', 'Diaterese tsena tsa imeile le dinomoro tsa disele di tswa lenaneng la basebetsi la HR.'),
('They accept, then your supervisor approves. Until then your shift stays yours.', 'st', 'Ba a amohela, ebe mookamedi wa hao o a dumella. Ho fihlela ka nako eo shifi ya hao e dula e le ya hao.'),
('They are handed back when you end your shift.', 'st', 'Di a kgutliswa ha o qeta shifi ya hao.'),
('They come off duty and off rosters straight away.', 'st', 'Ba tswa mosebetsing le manane hanghang.'),
('They go back on rosters, and on duty only after their next start of shift.', 'st', 'Ba kgutlela manane, le mosebetsing feela ka mora qalo ya shifi ya bona e latelang.'),
('This account has been deactivated. If you think this is a mistake, speak to your station commander or system administrator.', 'st', 'Akhaonte ena e timilwe. Ha o nahana hore ke phoso, bua le molaodi wa seteishene sa hao kapa motsamaisi wa tsamaiso.'),
('This account holds a powerful role, so a second SystemAdmin must approve. Nothing changes until they do.', 'st', 'Akhaonte ena e na le karolo e matla, ka hona SystemAdmin wa bobedi o tshwanetse ho dumella. Ha ho letho le fetohang ho fihlela ba dumella.'),
('This bodycam will not be issued', 'st', 'Bodycam ena e ke ke ya ntshwa'),
('This build has no push service configured, so alerts arrive only while the app is open. Report it to your system administrator before carrying this handset on shift.', 'st', 'Kgatiso ena ha e na tshebeletso ya ditsebiso e hlophisitsweng, ka hona ditemoso di fihla feela ha app e butswe. Tlaleha sena ho motsamaisi wa tsamaiso pele o jara founu ena shifing.'),
('This build has no web address configured, so accounts cannot be activated in the app. Use the link on the HikTech website, or ask an administrator to set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.', 'st', 'Kgatiso ena ha e na aterese ya websaete e hlophisitsweng, ka hona diakhaonte di ke ke tsa bulwa ka app. Sebedisa lehokela ho websaete ya HikTech, kapa o kope motsamaisi hore a behe EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.'),
('This build has no web address configured, so features that run on the server are unavailable. An administrator needs to set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.', 'st', 'Kgatiso ena ha e na aterese ya websaete e hlophisitsweng, ka hona dikarolo tse sebetsang sevareng ha di fumanehe. Motsamaisi o tshwanetse ho beha EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.'),
('This build has no web address configured.', 'st', 'Kgatiso ena ha e na aterese ya websaete e hlophisitsweng.'),
('This call has no map position. Mark On Scene when you get there.', 'st', 'Mohala ona ha o na sebaka mmapeng. Tshwaya O sebakeng ha o fihla moo.'),
('This cannot be undone. Press again to go ahead.', 'st', 'Sena se ke ke sa kgutliswa morao. Tobetsa hape ho tswela pele.'),
('This checklist will file as NOT PASSED until every safety item above is ticked. The record cannot claim otherwise.', 'st', 'Lenane lena la tlhahlobo le tla romelwa jwalo ka HA LE A ATLEHA ho fihlela dintho tsohle tsa polokeho ka hodimo di tshwauwa. Rekoto e ke ke ya bolela se seng.'),
('This code can’t be used', 'st', 'Khoutu ena e ke ke ya sebediswa'),
('This code is shown', 'st', 'Khoutu ena e a bontshwa'),
('This cycle', 'st', 'Potoloho ena'),
