('This device is no longer registered for PIN sign-in. Sign in with your password, and ask your supervisor to register it again.', 'st', 'Sesebediswa sena ha se sa ngodiswa ho kena ka PIN. Kena ka phasewete ya hao, mme o kope mookamedi wa hao hore a se ngodise hape.'),
