('Evacuation area', 'ts', 'Ndhawu yo huma'),
('Every bodycam on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book one out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'ts', 'Khamera yin''wana na yin''wana ya miri eka rhijisitara, laha yi hlayisiwaka kona na loyi a nga na yona sweswi. Tiofisiri ti humesa yin''we hi app eku sunguleni ka shifiti ti yi vuyisa shifiti yi nga si hela.'),
('Every change needs a reason and the {kind} typed back. Changes to SystemAdmin, Admin or SystemController also need a second SystemAdmin.', 'ts', 'Ku cinca kun''wana na kun''wana ku lava xivangelo na {kind} xi tsariwa nakambe. Ku cinca eka SystemAdmin, Admin kumbe SystemController ku lava na SystemAdmin wa vumbirhi.'),
('Every change, from the audit trail.', 'ts', 'Ku cinca kun''wana na kun''wana, ku suka eka mukondzo wa ku kambela.'),
('Every check passed so far. Next visit due {date}.', 'ts', 'Nkambelo wun''wana na wun''wana wu humelerile ku fikela sweswi. Riendzo leri landzelaka ri fanele {date}.'),
('Every check passed. Next visit due {date}.', 'ts', 'Nkambelo wun''wana na wun''wana wu humelerile. Riendzo leri landzelaka ri fanele {date}.'),
('Every closed case: reviewed after its report, or closed without one by the desk, with who and why.', 'ts', 'Nandzu wun''wana na wun''wana lowu pfariweke: wu kambisisiwile endzhaku ka xiviko xa wona, kumbe wu pfariwe handle ka xona hi desika, na loyi na leswaku hikokwalaho ka yini.'),
('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted with a blocking pop-up that must be acknowledged.', 'ts', 'Ntlawa wun''wana na wun''wana lowu nga entirhweni eka {desks} wu lemukisiwa hi popup leyi sivelaka leyi faneleke ku amukeriwa.'),
('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted.', 'ts', 'Ntlawa wun''wana na wun''wana lowu nga entirhweni eka {desks} wa lemukisiwa.'),
('Every crew out is on the Active Responders terminal', 'ts', 'Ntlawa wun''wana na wun''wana lowu humeke wu le ka Active Responders terminal'),
('Every crew still out, live. Open a row for the narrative and the timeline.', 'ts', 'Ntlawa wun''wana na wun''wana lowu ha riki ehandle, hi nkarhi wa sweswi. Pfula layini ku vona ntsheketo na layini ya nkarhi.'),
('Every department', 'ts', 'Tindzawulo hinkwato'),
('Every external service HikTech talks to — what it powers, whether its credentials are present, and whether it currently answers.', 'ts', 'Vukorhokeri byin''wana na byin''wana bya le handle lebyi HikTech yi vulavulaka na byona — leswi byi swi nyikaka matimba, loko vuxokoxoko bya byona byo nghena byi ri kona, na loko byi hlamula sweswi.'),
('Every feed shows a sample video, not the bodycam. Switch it off under Admin → Integrations → Hikvision once the platform is connected.', 'ts', 'Mihlangano hinkwayo yi kombisa vhidiyo ya xikombiso, ku nga ri khamera ya miri. Yi time ehansi ka Admin → Vuhlanganisi → Hikvision loko puratifomo yi hlanganisiwile.'),
('Every firearm on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book a firearm out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'ts', 'Xibamu xin''wana na xin''wana eka rhijisitara, laha xi hlayisiwaka kona na loyi a nga na xona sweswi. Tiofisiri ti humesa xibamu hi app eku sunguleni ka shifiti ti xi vuyisa shifiti yi nga si hela.'),
('Every form', 'ts', 'Fomo yin''wana na yin''wana'),
('Every hydrant is in service.', 'ts', 'Hydrant yin''wana na yin''wana ya tirha.'),
('Every knob has a safe built-in default and hard bounds; a value outside its bounds is clamped, and deleting an override falls back to the default. Every change is written to the audit trail with your name on it.', 'ts', 'Konopo yin''wana na yin''wana yi na ntolovelo lowu hlayisekeke na mindzilakano leyi tiyeke; nkoka lowu nga ehandle ka mindzilakano ya wona wa tsemiwa, naswona ku sula ku cinca swi tlhelela eka ntolovelo. Ku cinca kun''wana na kun''wana ku tsariwa eka mukondzo wa ku kambela na vito ra wena.'),
('Every leave or absence is captured under one of these codes. Office-only codes (AWOL, Suspended …) are never asked for by members.', 'ts', 'Khefu kumbe ku nga vi kona kun''wana na kun''wana ku nghenisiwa ehansi ka yin''we ya tikhodi leti. Tikhodi ta hofisi ntsena (AWOL, Yimisiwile …) a ti komberiwi hi swirho.'),
('Every logged call across your visible silos.', 'ts', 'Riqingho rin''wana na rin''wana leri tsariweke eka tindzawulo ta wena leti vonakaka.'),
('Every member: numbers, rank, station, section, contacts and sign-in.', 'ts', 'Xirho xin''wana na xin''wana: tinomboro, xiyimo, xitichi, xiyenge, vatihlanganisi na ku nghena.'),
('Every milestone, update, evidence upload and audited action — from the first call{value}', 'ts', 'Goza rin''wana na rin''wana ra nkoka, mpfuxeto, ku nghenisiwa ka vumbhoni na xiendlo lexi kamberiweke — ku sukela eka riqingho ro sungula{value}'),
('Every module on the platform — what your role and your organisation''s switches allow.', 'ts', 'Mojula wun''wana na wun''wana eka puratifomo — leswi ntirho wa wena na tikonopo ta nhlangano wa wena swi swi pfumelelaka.'),
('Every organisation on this deployment. Each tenant’s data, users, configuration and feature switches are isolated at the database — a row in one tenant does not exist for another, on any screen, in any export, in any search.', 'ts', 'Nhlangano wun''wana na wun''wana eka ku tirhisiwa loku. Data ya muhiri un''wana na un''wana, vatirhisi, vuhlela na tikonopo ta swilo swi hambanisiwile eka database — layini ya muhiri un''we a yi kona eka un''wana, eka xikirini xin''wana na xin''wana, eka ku rhumela ehandle kun''wana na kun''wana, eka ku lava kun''wana na kun''wana.'),
('Every place assessed on site, added up.', 'ts', 'Ndhawu yin''wana na yin''wana leyi kamberiweke endhawini, yi hlanganisiwile.'),
('Every police report. Search, filter, export, or open one to read it in full.', 'ts', 'Xiviko xin''wana na xin''wana xa maphorisa. Lava, hlunga, rhumela ehandle, kumbe u pfula xin''we ku xi hlaya hinkwaxo.'),
('Every punch, newest first.', 'ts', 'Ku nghena entirhweni kun''wana na kun''wana, lokuntshwa ku sungula.'),
('Every recorded action on a case: who logged it, routed it, responded, filed the report and closed it. Audit rows are permanent.', 'ts', 'Xiendlo xin''wana na xin''wana lexi tsariweke eka nandzu: loyi a wu tsaleke, loyi a wu kongomiseke, loyi a hlamuleke, loyi a ngheniseke xiviko na loyi a wu pfaleke. Milayini ya ku kambela i ya hilaha ku nga heriki.'),
('Every report officers file, colour-coded by form. Choose where to go.', 'ts', 'Xiviko xin''wana na xin''wana lexi tiofisiri ti xi nghenisaka, xi hambanisiwile hi mivala hi ku ya hi fomo. Hlawula laha u yaka kona.'),
('Every section, from observations to sign-off.', 'ts', 'Xiyenge xin''wana na xin''wana, ku sukela eka ku xiya ku fikela eka ku sayina.'),
('Every site, what it is used for, its risk and when it is due.', 'ts', 'Ndhawu yin''wana na yin''wana, leswi yi tirhisiwaka swona, khombo ra yona na loko yi fanele rini.'),
('Every stage', 'ts', 'Goza rin''wana na rin''wana'),
('Every vehicle is on the road.', 'ts', 'Movha wun''wana na wun''wana wu le gondzweni.'),
('Every vehicle, who is driving it, its last inspection and licence disc. Officers choose a vehicle in the app at the start of a shift; one that fails its inspection comes off the road until it is returned to service here.', 'ts', 'Movha wun''wana na wun''wana, loyi a wu chayelaka, vukambisisi bya wona byo hetelela na disiki ya layisense. Tiofisiri ti hlawula movha hi app eku sunguleni ka shifiti; lowu tsandzekeke eka vukambisisi wu humesiwa egondzweni kukondza wu vuyiseriwa entirhweni laha.'),
('Everyone', 'ts', 'Un''wana na un''wana'),
('Everyone due has started.', 'ts', 'Hinkwavo lava a va fanele ku sungula va sungurile.'),
('Everyone in each team gets their team''s shifts as drafts. Anyone on leave, booked for court or already on a shift is left out, with the reason below. Issue the drafts when you are happy.', 'ts', 'Un''wana na un''wana eka ntlawa wun''wana na wun''wana u kuma tishifiti ta ntlawa wa yena tanihi minkandziyiso. Un''wana na un''wana loyi a nga eku wiseni, loyi a bukeriweke khoto kumbe loyi a se a ri eka shifiti wa tshikiwa, na xivangelo laha hansi. Humesa minkandziyiso loko u enerisekile.'),
('Everyone in the window', 'ts', 'Un''wana na un''wana eka nkarhi lowu'),
('Everyone inside must leave.', 'ts', 'Un''wana na un''wana loyi a nga endzeni u fanele ku huma.'),
('Everyone is allocated.', 'ts', 'Un''wana na un''wana u aveleriwile.'),
('Everything an administrator needs to answer “is the platform working”, in one place. Each check says what it means, not just what it measured.', 'ts', 'Hinkwaswo leswi mulawuri a swi lavaka ku hlamula "xana puratifomo ya tirha", endhawini yin''we. Xikambelo xin''wana na xin''wana xi vula leswi xi vulaka swona, ku nga ri leswi xi swi pimeke ntsena.'),
('Everything delivered', 'ts', 'Hinkwaswo swi rhumeriwile'),
('Everything has been delivered.', 'ts', 'Hinkwaswo se swi rhumeriwile.'),
('Everything is filled in', 'ts', 'Hinkwaswo swi tatisiwile'),
('Everything is filled in.', 'ts', 'Hinkwaswo swi tatiwile.'),
('Everything on the register for one ID number or one vehicle: fines, payments and when they were made, and what is owed today.', 'ts', 'Hinkwaswo leswi nga eka rhijisitara swa nomboro yin''we ya vutitivisi kumbe movha wun''we: tindziwa, tihakelo na loko ti endliwile, na leswi kolotiwaka namuntlha.'),
('Everything that came in while you were busy, with what still needs your acknowledgement.', 'ts', 'Hinkwaswo leswi nga fika loko u ri ekhomekile, na leswi ha lavaka ku amukela ka wena.'),
('Everything they recorded stays: incidents, reports and their history.', 'ts', 'Hinkwaswo leswi va swi tsaleke swa sala: swiendlakalo, swiviko na matimu ya swona.'),
('Evidence', 'ts', 'Vumbhoni'),
('Evidence & Exports', 'ts', 'Vumbhoni na ku rhumela ehandle'),
