('Only a translator for this language approves. You can save drafts.', 'ts', 'I muhundzuluxi wa ririmi leri ntsena loyi a pfumelelaka. U nga hlayisa tidrafti.'),
('Only approved translations are shown on the screens. Everything else shows in English.', 'ts', 'Tindzimi leti hundzuluxiweke leti pfumeleriweke ntsena ti kombisiwa eka swikirini. Swin''wana hinkwaswo swi kombisiwa hi Xinghezi.'),
('Only fines I issued', 'ts', 'Magandlo lawa ndzi ma nyikeke ntsena'),
('Only if there is no emergency. Why?', 'ts', 'Ntsena loko ku nga ri na xihatla. Hikokwalaho ka yini?'),
('Only me', 'ts', 'Mina ntsena'),
('Only officers who went on duty in the app after today''s start of shift are listed. Distance is straight-line from their last GPS heartbeat; ETA assumes {speedKmh} km/h with a {roadFactor}× road factor (Admin → Operations Settings).', 'ts', 'Ku nxaxameriwa ntsena vaofisiri lava ngheneke entirhweni eka app endzhaku ka ku sungula ka shifiti ya namuntlha. Mpfhuka i layini yo olova ku suka eka siginali ya vona yo hetelela ya GPS; ETA yi teka {speedKmh} km/h na xiphemu xa gondzo xa {roadFactor}× (Admin → Swilulamiso swa Ntirho).'),
('Only one patient', 'ts', 'Muvabyi un''we ntsena'),
('Only someone senior to the member, in their department, can approve. Nobody approves their own.', 'ts', 'I munhu loyi a nga ehenhla ka xirho ntsena, eka ndzawulo ya xona, loyi a nga pfumelelaka. A ku na loyi a tipfumelelaka.'),
('Only the firefighter leading this incident files its fire report.', 'ts', 'I mutimi wa ndzilo loyi a rhangelaka xiendlakalo lexi ntsena loyi a rhumelaka xiviko xa xona xa ndzilo.'),
('Only the lead officer on this incident can file its report.', 'ts', 'I ofisiri loyi a rhangelaka xiendlakalo lexi ntsena loyi a nga rhumelaka xiviko xa xona.'),
