('The department administrator sets shift types, rotations and the late minutes. You can put people in teams.', 'ts', 'Mulawuri wa ndzawulo u veka mixaka ya tishifiti, ku rhendzeleka na timinete to hlwela. U nga nghenisa vanhu eka mintlawa.'),
('The duty office screens. The systems controller decides who may open each one, and whether they may change it.', 'ts', 'Swikirini swa hofisi ya ntirho. Mulawuri wa masisitimi u teka xiboho xa leswaku i mani loyi a nga pfulaka xin''wana ni xin''wana, ni loko a nga xi cinca.'),
