('The file is read on this computer. Nothing is saved until you confirm, and the file itself is never stored.', 'ts', 'Fayili yi hlayiwa eka khompyuta leyi. A ku na nchumu lowu hlayisiwaka ku fikela u tiyisisa, naswona fayili hi yoxe a yi hlayisiwi.'),
('The file is read on this computer. Nothing reaches HikTech until you confirm, and then only the rows you confirm. The file itself is never stored.', 'ts', 'Fayili yi hlayiwa eka khompyuta leyi. A ku na nchumu lowu fikaka eka HikTech ku fikela u tiyisisa, kutani ku fika ntsena tilayini leti u ti tiyisisaka. Fayili hi yoxe a yi hlayisiwi.'),
