('The firearm did not pass its inspection and has been marked for maintenance. Your inspection is on record. Select another firearm, or tick No firearm, to complete your start of shift.', 'ts', 'Xibamu a xi humelelanga eka nkambelo naswona xi funghiwile leswaku xi lunghisiwa. Nkambelo wa wena wu le ka rhekhodo. Hlawula xibamu xin''wana, kumbe u funghi A ku na xibamu, ku heta ku sungula ka shifiti ya wena.'),
