('The inspection was filed. One or more essential checks failed, so {unit} is off the road and your supervisor has been told. Choose another vehicle; this one comes back once fleet control returns it to service.', 'ts', 'Nkambelo wu rhumeriwile. Nkambelo wun''we kumbe ku tlula wa nkoka wu tsandzekile, hikwalaho {unit} a ya ha ri egondzweni naswona mulanguteri wa wena u byeriwile. Hlawula movha wun''wana; lowu wu vuya loko vulawuri bya mimovha byi wu tlherisela entirhweni.'),
