('The latest views of these bodycams, live or recorded, with the reason given. Every one is also in the audit log.', 'ts', 'Ku languta ka sweswinyana ka ti-bodycam leti, ka hi nkarhi wa xiviri kumbe loku rhekhodiweke, na xivangelo lexi nyikiweke. Kun''wana ni kun''wana ku le ka logo ya nkambelo.'),
('The lead filed the report.', 'ts', 'Murhangeri u rhumele xiviko.'),
('The ledger sets Paid and Partially Paid. Entries are never edited or deleted.', 'ts', 'Buku ya timali yi veka Yi hakeriwile na Yi Hakeriwile Xiphemu. Ku nghenisa a ku cinciwi kumbe ku suriwa.'),
('The list of absence types used for leave and on the duty sheet.', 'ts', 'Nxaxamelo wa mixaka ya ku pfumaleka leyi tirhisiwaka eka ku wisa ni le ka phepha ra ntirho.'),
('The list of absence types: AL, SL, AWOL and the rest.', 'ts', 'Nxaxamelo wa mixaka ya ku pfumaleka: AL, SL, AWOL na leswin''wana.'),
('The map could not load. Check your connection.', 'ts', 'Mepe a wu swikotanga ku layicha. Kambela vuhlanganisi bya wena.'),
('The money that moves against fines and charges — {length} entries, net R{fixed}.', 'ts', 'Mali lama fambaka ku lwisana na magandlo ni milandzu — ku nghenisa ka {length}, hinkwayo R{fixed}.'),
('The municipality''s crest: it also appears on report PDFs, report screens in the app and the menu. Use a PNG for the PDFs.', 'ts', 'Mfungho wa masipala: wu humelela nakambe eka ti-PDF ta swiviko, eka swikirini swa swiviko eka app ni le ka menyu. Tirhisa PNG eka ti-PDF.'),
('The notice could not be saved on this phone.', 'ts', 'Xitiviso a xi swikotanga ku hlayisiwa eka foni leyi.'),
('The number this member is found by everywhere in the system.', 'ts', 'Nomboro leyi xirho lexi xi kumiwaka ha yona hinkwako eka sisitimi.'),
('The only vehicle is taken. You can continue your shift without one.', 'ts', 'Movha ntsena lowu nga kona wu tekiwile. U nga ya emahlweni na shifiti ya wena handle ka wona.'),
('The operational areas that appear beside every officer on the duty board — NR, DR, B, CH…', 'ts', 'Tindhawu ta ntirho leti humelelaka etlhelo ka ofisiri un''wana ni un''wana eka bodo ya ntirho — NR, DR, B, CH…'),
('The organisation must keep at least {value}. Until it has them, the current SystemAdmin cannot be demoted or deactivated, and if they are unavailable nobody can manage accounts. A new SystemAdmin needs a second approval; with nobody else to give it, the SuperAdmin decides.', 'ts', 'Nhlangano wu fanele ku hlayisa kwalomu ka {value}. Ku fikela wu va na vona, SystemAdmin wa sweswi a nge rhelerisiwi kumbe ku timiwa, naswona loko a nga kumeki a ku na loyi a nga lawulaka tiakhawunti. SystemAdmin lowuntshwa u lava mpfumelelo wa vumbirhi; loko ku nga ri na un''wana loyi a nga wu nyikaka, SuperAdmin wa teka xiboho.'),
('The overtime code this section books overtime against.', 'ts', 'Khodi ya nkarhi wo engetela leyi xiyenge lexi xi bukelaka nkarhi wo engetela ha yona.'),
('The patient', 'ts', 'Muvabyi'),
('The photo on the incident is filed with this report.', 'ts', 'Xifaniso lexi nga eka xiendlakalo xi rhumeriwa na xiviko lexi.'),
('The photo was not saved. Try again.', 'ts', 'Xifaniso a xi hlayisiwanga. Ringeta nakambe.'),
('The pin is in the wrong place', 'ts', 'Phini yi le ndhawini leyi hoxeke'),
('The platform sent an insecure (http) stream address, which the browser may refuse. Ask Hikvision to stream over HTTPS.', 'ts', 'Xitulu xi rhumele adirese yo hangalasa leyi nga hlayisekangiki (http), leyi bulawuza yi nga yi alaka. Kombela Hikvision leswaku yi hangalasa hi HTTPS.'),
('The queue is clear.', 'ts', 'Layini yi basile.'),
('The radio always comes back to HikTech, after a restart too.', 'ts', 'Radiyo yi tshama yi vuyela eka HikTech, hambi endzhaku ka ku sungula nakambe.'),
('The rank this call sign needs, e.g. ST for the sergeant in charge.', 'ts', 'Xikhundlha lexi mfungho lowu wa ku vitana wu xi lavaka, xik. ST eka sajeni loyi a lawulaka.'),
('The recipient also gets a low-priority alert, phone included.', 'ts', 'Muamukeri na yena u kuma xitsundzuxo xa nkoka wa le hansi, ku katsa foni.'),
('The record you''re looking for doesn''t exist or you don''t have access to it.', 'ts', 'Rhekhodo leyi u yi lavaka a yi kona kumbe a wu na ku fikelela eka yona.'),
('The recording produced no audio.', 'ts', 'Ku rhekhoda a ku humesanga mpfumawulo.'),
('The register is not set up yet. Run migration 0101 in Supabase, then reload.', 'ts', 'Rhijisitara a yi si lulamisiwa. Tirhisa migration 0101 eka Supabase, kutani u layicha nakambe.'),
('The register refused this notice: {reason}. Fix it by issuing a corrected notice; this one stays in the sync tray until you discard it.', 'ts', 'Rhijisitara yi arile xitiviso lexi: {reason}. Xi lulamise hi ku humesa xitiviso lexi lulamisiweke; lexi xi tshama eka thireyi yo rhumela ku fikela u xi cukumeta.'),
('The report cannot be filed yet:', 'ts', 'Xiviko a xi si swi kota ku rhumeriwa:'),
('The report is filed. Its forms show here once it has reached the server.', 'ts', 'Xiviko xi rhumeriwile. Tifomo ta xona ti humelela laha loko xi fikile eka sevha.'),
('The report on {incident_number} becomes a permanent record — it cannot be edited or deleted afterwards.', 'ts', 'Xiviko xa {incident_number} xi va rhekhodo ya hilaha ku nga heriki — a xi nge cinciwi kumbe ku suriwa endzhaku.'),
('The reports', 'ts', 'Swiviko'),
('The request to send with it', 'ts', 'Xikombelo xo rhumela na xona'),
('The rules are installed and correct, but no scheduler is ticking them, so no escalation will fire on its own. Either enable', 'ts', 'Milawu yi nghenisiwile naswona yi lulamile, kambe a ku na mupulani loyi a yi tirhisaka, hikwalaho a ku na ku yisa ehenhla loku nga ta humelela hi koxe. Kumbe u pfula'),
('The same response metrics at every level — organisation, department, area and member. Drill in; the definitions never change, only the calls they cover.', 'ts', 'Swipimelo leswi fanaka swa nhlamulo eka swiyimo hinkwaswo — nhlangano, ndzawulo, ndhawu na xirho. Nghena ndzeni; tinhlamuselo a ti cinci, i tiqingho ntsena leti ti ti katsaka.'),
('The same screens and powers as now.', 'ts', 'Swikirini na matimba leswi fanaka na swa sweswi.'),
('The same window cut three ways — by member, by department, by incident type.', 'ts', 'Nkarhi lowu fanaka wu avanyisiwile hi tindlela tinharhu — hi xirho, hi ndzawulo, hi muxaka wa xiendlakalo.'),
('The scene', 'ts', 'Ndhawu'),
('The secret is kept safe and never shown again.', 'ts', 'Xihundla xi hlayisiwa xi sirhelelekile naswona a xi nge he kombisiwa.'),
('The server refused it. SMS or call the control room now.', 'ts', 'Sevha yi swi arile. Rhumela SMS kumbe u ringela kamara ya vulawuri sweswi.'),
('The server took too long to answer. Check your connection and try again.', 'ts', 'Sevha yi tekile nkarhi wo leha ngopfu ku hlamula. Kambela vuhlanganisi bya wena kutani u ringeta nakambe.'),
('The shift types, rotations and teams the planner repeats.', 'ts', 'Mixaka ya tishifiti, ku rhendzeleka na mintlawa leyi mupulani a yi phindhaka.'),
('The site is compliant.', 'ts', 'Saya yi yingisa milawu.'),
('The staff register is empty. Import HR’s staff list first.', 'ts', 'Rhijisitara ya vatirhi a yi na nchumu. Nghenisa nxaxamelo wa vatirhi wa HR ku sungula.'),
('The station the call sign works from.', 'ts', 'Xitichi lexi mfungho wa ku vitana wu tirhaka eka xona.'),
('The talk button talks on your team’s group; the SOS button raises an SOS. Most radios work without setting up. If a button does nothing, teach it here.', 'ts', 'Buteni yo vulavula yi vulavula eka ntlawa wa wena; buteni ya SOS yi tlakusa SOS. Tiradiyo to tala ti tirha handle ko lulamisiwa. Loko buteni yi nga endli nchumu, yi dyondzise laha.'),
('The team a rotation rosters (A, B, C, D or Red, Blue, Green).', 'ts', 'Ntlawa lowu ku rhendzeleka ku wu nghenisaka eka nxaxamelo (A, B, C, D kumbe Xo tshwuka, Wasi, Rihlaza).'),
('The two PINs are not the same. Enter your new PIN again.', 'ts', 'Ti-PIN timbirhi a ti fani. Nghenisa PIN ya wena leyintshwa nakambe.'),
('The units duty is given to, and the stations they work from.', 'ts', 'Tiyuniti leti nyikiwaka ntirho, na swititichi leswi ti tirhaka eka swona.'),
('The vehicle, item by item: OK, Fault or NIL.', 'ts', 'Movha, nchumu hi nchumu: SWI LULAMILE, Xihoxo kumbe A KU NA.'),
('The yearly entitlement shown on leave balances. Empty for none.', 'ts', 'Mfanelo ya lembe leyi kombisiwaka eka tibalansi ta ku wisa. Yi nga ri na nchumu loko yi nga ri kona.'),
('The {unitWord} goes for maintenance and your supervisor is told.', 'ts', '{unitWord} yi ya eku lunghisiweni naswona mulanguteri wa wena wa byeriwa.'),
('Theft', 'ts', 'Vukhamba'),
('Theft of motor vehicle', 'ts', 'Vukhamba bya movha'),
('Their age?', 'ts', 'Malembe ya vona?'),
('Their condition', 'ts', 'Xiyimo xa vona'),
('Their invitation goes here.', 'ts', 'Xirhambo xa vona xi ya laha.'),
('Their vehicle and registration', 'ts', 'Movha wa vona na ku tsarisa'),
('Theme', 'ts', 'Xitayele'),
('Then add its call signs on Call Signs.', 'ts', 'Kutani u engetela mimfungho ya xona ya ku vitana eka Mimfungho ya ku Vitana.'),
('These are safe for media and community distribution.', 'ts', 'Leswi swi hlayisekile eka vahaxi va mahungu na ku hangalasiwa eka vaaki.'),
('These email addresses and cellphone numbers come from HR’s staff list.', 'ts', 'Tiadirese leti ta imeyili na tinomboro ta tiselfoni ti huma eka nxaxamelo wa vatirhi wa HR.'),
('They accept, then your supervisor approves. Until then your shift stays yours.', 'ts', 'Va amukela, kutani mulanguteri wa wena a pfumelela. Ku fikela hi nkarhi wolowo shifiti ya wena yi tshama yi ri ya wena.'),
('They are handed back when you end your shift.', 'ts', 'Swi tlheriseriwa loko u heta shifiti ya wena.'),
('They come off duty and off rosters straight away.', 'ts', 'Va huma entirhweni na le ka minxaxamelo hi ku hatlisa.'),
('They go back on rosters, and on duty only after their next start of shift.', 'ts', 'Va tlhelela eka minxaxamelo, ni le ntirhweni ntsena endzhaku ka ku sungula ka shifiti ya vona leyi landzelaka.'),
('This account has been deactivated. If you think this is a mistake, speak to your station commander or system administrator.', 'ts', 'Akhawunti leyi yi timiwile. Loko u ehleketa leswaku i xihoxo, vulavula na mulawuri wa xitichi xa wena kumbe mulawuri wa sisitimi.'),
('This account holds a powerful role, so a second SystemAdmin must approve. Nothing changes until they do.', 'ts', 'Akhawunti leyi yi na xiave xa matimba, hikwalaho SystemAdmin wa vumbirhi u fanele ku pfumelela. A ku na leswi cincaka ku fikela va pfumelela.'),
('This bodycam will not be issued', 'ts', 'Bodycam leyi a yi nge humesiwi'),
('This build has no push service configured, so alerts arrive only while the app is open. Report it to your system administrator before carrying this handset on shift.', 'ts', 'Vuhundzuluxi lebyi a byi na vukorhokeri bya switiviso lebyi lulamisiweke, hikwalaho switsundzuxo swi fika ntsena loko app yi pfulekile. Vika leswi eka mulawuri wa sisitimi u nga si rhwala foni leyi eka shifiti.'),
('This build has no web address configured, so accounts cannot be activated in the app. Use the link on the HikTech website, or ask an administrator to set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.', 'ts', 'Vuhundzuluxi lebyi a byi na adirese ya webu leyi lulamisiweke, hikwalaho tiakhawunti a ti nge pfuriwi eka app. Tirhisa xihlanganisi eka webusayiti ya HikTech, kumbe u kombela mulawuri leswaku a veka EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.'),
('This build has no web address configured, so features that run on the server are unavailable. An administrator needs to set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.', 'ts', 'Vuhundzuluxi lebyi a byi na adirese ya webu leyi lulamisiweke, hikwalaho swiphemu leswi tirhaka eka sevha a swi kumeki. Mulawuri u fanele ku veka EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.'),
('This build has no web address configured.', 'ts', 'Vuhundzuluxi lebyi a byi na adirese ya webu leyi lulamisiweke.'),
('This call has no map position. Mark On Scene when you get there.', 'ts', 'Riqingho leri a ri na ndhawu eka mepe. Funghi U le ndhawini loko u fika kona.'),
('This cannot be undone. Press again to go ahead.', 'ts', 'Leswi a swi nge tlheriseriwi endzhaku. Tshikelela nakambe ku ya emahlweni.'),
('This checklist will file as NOT PASSED until every safety item above is ticked. The record cannot claim otherwise.', 'ts', 'Nxaxamelo lowu wo kambela wu ta rhumeriwa tanihi A WU HUMELELANGA ku fikela swilo hinkwaswo swa vuhlayiseki laha henhla swi funghiwa. Rhekhodo a yi nge vuli swin''wana.'),
('This code can’t be used', 'ts', 'Khodi leyi a yi nge tirhisiwi'),
('This code is shown', 'ts', 'Khodi leyi ya kombisiwa'),
('This cycle', 'ts', 'Ndzhendzeleko lowu'),
('This device belongs to another department. Use one of your own department''s devices, or sign in with your password.', 'ts', 'Xitirho lexi i xa ndzawulo yin''wana. Tirhisa xin''wana xa switirho swa ndzawulo ya wena, kumbe u nghena hi phasiwedi ya wena.'),
('This device is no longer registered for PIN sign-in. Sign in with your password, and ask your supervisor to register it again.', 'ts', 'Xitirho lexi a xa ha tsarisiwanga ku nghena hi PIN. Nghena hi phasiwedi ya wena, kutani u kombela mulanguteri wa wena leswaku a xi tsarisa nakambe.'),
('This device is not registered for PIN sign-in. Your supervisor registers shared radios and phones.', 'ts', 'Xitirho lexi a xi tsarisiwanga ku nghena hi PIN. Mulanguteri wa wena u tsarisa tiradiyo na tifoni to avelana.'),
('This device is not set up for PIN sign-in yet. A supervisor or administrator sets it up once: sign in with a password, open Profile, then Sign-in PIN, then Register this device.', 'ts', 'Xitirho lexi a xi si lulamiseriwa ku nghena hi PIN. Mulanguteri kumbe mulawuri u xi lulamisa kan''we: nghena hi phasiwedi, pfula Profayili, kutani PIN yo Nghena, kutani Tsarisa xitirho lexi.'),
('This device is registered for PIN sign-in: {device}', 'ts', 'Xitirho lexi xi tsarisiwile ku nghena hi PIN: {device}'),
('This device no longer signs anyone in with a PIN.', 'ts', 'Xitirho lexi a xa ha nghenisi munhu hi PIN.'),
('This feed stops in {secondsToAnswer} s to save the bodycam’s mobile data.', 'ts', 'Ku hangalasa loku ku yima hi tisekoni ta {secondsToAnswer} ku hlayisa data ya selfoni ya bodycam.'),
('This firearm will not be issued', 'ts', 'Xibamu lexi a xi nge humesiwi'),
('This import changes nothing about them. They may have left: review them on the Personnel page afterwards.', 'ts', 'Ku nghenisa loku a ku cinci nchumu hi vona. Va nga va va tshikile: va kambele eka tluka ra Vatirhi endzhaku.'),
('This is a {severity} call. The {desks} dispatch desk can start now with what you have.', 'ts', 'Leri i riqingho ra {severity}. Tafula ro rhumela ra {desks} ri nga sungula sweswi hi leswi u nga na swona.'),
('This is a {severity} call. The {desks} dispatch desks can start now with what you have.', 'ts', 'Leri i riqingho ra {severity}. Matafula yo rhumela ya {desks} ma nga sungula sweswi hi leswi u nga na swona.'),
('This is your SOS — dispatch is sending help to you.', 'ts', 'Leyi i SOS ya wena — varhumeri va rhumela mpfuno eka wena.'),
('This list covers {join}. People in those departments it leaves out are shown for review; nobody is removed.', 'ts', 'Nxaxamelo lowu wu katsa {join}. Vanhu va le ka tindzawulo teto leti wu va siyaka va kombisiwa leswaku va kamberiwa; a ku na loyi a susiwaka.'),
('This member has no account yet, so they cannot be given screens.', 'ts', 'Xirho lexi a xi si va na akhawunti, hikwalaho a xi nge nyikiwi swikirini.'),
