('This month: 1 shift', 'ts', 'N''hweti leyi: shifiti yin''we'),
('This month: {n} shifts', 'ts', 'N''hweti leyi: tishifiti ta {n}'),
('This needs the latest app. Install it, then come back here.', 'ts', 'Leswi swi lava app ya sweswinyana. Yi nghenise, kutani u vuyela laha.'),
('This page hit an error', 'ts', 'Tluka leri ri hlangane na xihoxo'),
('This page shows calls sent to you yourself, as a field officer sees them.', 'ts', 'Tluka leri ri kombisa tiqingho leti rhumeriweke eka wena hi wexe, hilaha ofisiri wa le ntimweni a ti vonaka hakona.'),
('This phone could not be registered for dispatch notifications. Alerts still arrive while the app is open — report this so the handset can be checked.', 'ts', 'Foni leyi a yi swikotanga ku tsariseriwa switiviso swa ku rhumela. Switsundzuxo swa ha fika loko app yi pfulekile — vika leswi leswaku foni yi kamberiwa.'),
('This phone will not ring for a dispatch. Turn notifications on for HikTech in the device settings. Alerts still arrive instantly while the app is open.', 'ts', 'Foni leyi a yi nge rhitili loko ku rhumeriwa. Pfula switiviso swa HikTech eka swilulamiso swa xitirho. Switsundzuxo swa ha fika hi ku hatlisa loko app yi pfulekile.'),
('This radio is off.', 'ts', 'Radiyo leyi yi timiwile.'),
