('Every bodycam on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book one out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'ss', 'Yonkhe ikhamera yemtimba lesekurejista, lapho igcinwa khona nekutsi ngubani lonayo nyalo. Tikhulu tikhipha yinye nge-app ekucaleni kweshifti bese tiyibuyisa ngaphambi kwekutsi shifti iphele.'),
('Every change needs a reason and the {kind} typed back. Changes to SystemAdmin, Admin or SystemController also need a second SystemAdmin.', 'ss', 'Lonkhe lushintjo ludzinga sizatfu na-{kind} lobhalwe futsi. Lushintjo ku-SystemAdmin, Admin nome SystemController ludzinga futsi i-SystemAdmin yesibili.'),
