('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted with a blocking pop-up that must be acknowledged.', 'ss', 'Onkhe emacembu lasemsebentini ku-{desks} ayacwayiswa ngesecwayiso lesivimbako lokufanele semukelwe.'),
('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted.', 'ss', 'Onkhe emacembu lasemsebentini ku-{desks} ayacwayiswa.'),
('Every crew out is on the Active Responders terminal', 'ss', 'Onkhe emacembu laphumile ase-Active Responders terminal'),
('Every crew still out, live. Open a row for the narrative and the timeline.', 'ss', 'Onkhe emacembu lasaphumile, bukhoma. Vula umugca kute ubone kulandzisa nemugca wesikhatsi.'),
('Every department', 'ss', 'Onkhe ematiko'),
('Every external service HikTech talks to — what it powers, whether its credentials are present, and whether it currently answers.', 'ss', 'Lonkhe lusito langaphandle i-HikTech lekhuluma nalo — loko lukunika emandla, nangabe imininingwane yalo yekungena ikhona, nangabe luyaphendvula nyalo.'),
('Every feed shows a sample video, not the bodycam. Switch it off under Admin → Integrations → Hikvision once the platform is connected.', 'ss', 'Yonkhe imisakato ikhombisa ividiyo yesibonelo, hhayi ikhamera yemtimba. Kuvale ngaphansi kwe-Admin → Kuchumana → Hikvision nangabe iphulathifomu seyixhunyiwe.'),
('Every firearm on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book a firearm out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'ss', 'Sonkhe sibhamu lesisekurejista, lapho sigcinwa khona nekutsi ngubani lonaso nyalo. Tikhulu tikhipha sibhamu nge-app ekucaleni kweshifti bese tisibuyisa ngaphambi kwekutsi shifti iphele.'),
('Every form', 'ss', 'Lonkhe lifomu'),
('Every hydrant is in service.', 'ss', 'Yonkhe i-hydrant iyasebenta.'),
('Every knob has a safe built-in default and hard bounds; a value outside its bounds is clamped, and deleting an override falls back to the default. Every change is written to the audit trail with your name on it.', 'ss', 'Yonkhe inkinobho inekutentekela lokuphephile nemikhawulo lecinile; linani lelingaphandle kwemikhawulo yalo liyancunywa, futsi kusula lokushintjiwe kubuyela ekutentekeleni. Lonkhe lushintjo lubhalwa emkhondvweni wekuhlolwa neligama lakho.'),
('Every leave or absence is captured under one of these codes. Office-only codes (AWOL, Suspended …) are never asked for by members.', 'ss', 'Lonkhe likhefu nobe kungabikhona kufakwa ngaphansi kwalomunye walamakhodi. Emakhodi elihhovisi kuphela (AWOL, Lamisiwe …) akaze aceliwe ngemalunga.'),
('Every logged call across your visible silos.', 'ss', 'Tonkhe tingcingo letibhalisiwe ematikweni akho lobonakalako.'),
('Every member: numbers, rank, station, section, contacts and sign-in.', 'ss', 'Lilunga ngalinye: tinombolo, lizinga, siteshi, sigaba, labachumana nabo nekungena.'),
('Every milestone, update, evidence upload and audited action — from the first call{value}', 'ss', 'Sigaba ngasinye lesibalulekile, kuvuselela, kulayishwa kwebufakazi nesento lesihloliwe — kusukela elucingweni lwekucala{value}'),
('Every module on the platform — what your role and your organisation''s switches allow.', 'ss', 'Yonkhe imojuli kuphulathifomu — loko indzima yakho netinkinobho tenhlangano yakho lokuvumelako.'),
('Every organisation on this deployment. Each tenant’s data, users, configuration and feature switches are isolated at the database — a row in one tenant does not exist for another, on any screen, in any export, in any search.', 'ss', 'Yonkhe inhlangano kulokufakwa. Idatha yemcashi ngamunye, basebentisi, kuhlelwa netinkinobho tetici kwehlukaniswe kudathabheyisi — umugca wemcashi munye awukho kulomunye, kunome ngusiphi sikrini, kunome ngukuphi kutfunyelwa ngaphandle, kunome ngukuphi kusesha.'),
('Every place assessed on site, added up.', 'ss', 'Yonkhe indzawo lehloliwe endzaweni, ihlanganisiwe.'),
('Every police report. Search, filter, export, or open one to read it in full.', 'ss', 'Wonkhe umbiko wemaphoyisa. Sesha, hlunga, tfumela ngaphandle, nome uvule munye kute uwufundze wonkhe.'),
('Every punch, newest first.', 'ss', 'Konkhe kungena emsebentini, lokusha kucala.'),
('Every recorded action on a case: who logged it, routed it, responded, filed the report and closed it. Audit rows are permanent.', 'ss', 'Tonkhe tento letibhalwe elicaleni: ngubani lolibhalile, lolicondzisile, lophendvulile, lofake umbiko nalolivalile. Imigca yekuhlolwa ihlala phakadze.'),
('Every report officers file, colour-coded by form. Choose where to go.', 'ss', 'Wonkhe umbiko tikhulu letiwufakako, wehlukaniswe ngemibala ngekwelifomu. Khetsa lapho ufuna kuya khona.'),
('Every section, from observations to sign-off.', 'ss', 'Tonkhe tigaba, kusukela ekunakeni kuya ekusayineni.'),
