('I have read this shift', 'ss', 'Ngifundzile lelishifu'),
('I know how your department works and I can read the live board your role can see. Ask me anything, or tell me what to do. I prepare it, and nothing changes until you confirm.', 'ss', 'Ngiyati kutsi litiko lakho lisebenta njani futsi ngingafundza libhodi lelibukhoma lelibonwa sikhundla sakho. Ngibute nobe yini, nome ungitjele kutsi ngentani. Ngiyakulungisa, futsi kute lokushintjako uze uciniseke.'),
('I know your shift, your calls, your leave and your kit. Ask me anything about your work, in your own words. I explain and show you where to go; you do the work.', 'ss', 'Ngiyalati lishifu lakho, tincingo takho, likhefu lakho netimphahla takho temsebenti. Ngibute nobe yini ngemsebenti wakho, ngemavi akho. Ngiyachaza futsi ngikukhombise lapho kufanele uye khona; wena wenta umsebenti.'),
