('The day’s sheet to print for parade: sign on, sign off and overtime.', 'ss', 'Liphepha lelilanga lekuphrintwa lekuhlola: kungena, kuphuma nesikhatsi lesengetiwe.'),
('The department administrator sets shift types, rotations and the late minutes. You can put people in teams.', 'ss', 'Umphatsi welitiko usetha tinhlobo temashifu, kushintjana nemizuzu yekuphuta. Ungafaka bantfu emacenjini.'),
('The duty office screens. The systems controller decides who may open each one, and whether they may change it.', 'ss', 'Tikrini telihhovisi lemsebenti. Umphatsi wemasistimu ancuma kutsi ngubani longavula ngasinye, nekutsi angasishintja yini.'),
