('The file is read on this computer. Nothing is saved until you confirm, and the file itself is never stored.', 'ss', 'Lifayela lifundvwa kulelikhompyutha. Kute lokugcinwako kuze ucinisekise, futsi lifayela ngekwalo alikaze ligcinwe.'),
('The file is read on this computer. Nothing reaches HikTech until you confirm, and then only the rows you confirm. The file itself is never stored.', 'ss', 'Lifayela lifundvwa kulelikhompyutha. Kute lokufika ku-HikTech kuze ucinisekise, bese kufika kuphela imigca loyicinisekisako. Lifayela ngekwalo alikaze ligcinwe.'),
