('The inspection was filed. One or more essential checks failed, so {unit} is off the road and your supervisor has been told. Choose another vehicle; this one comes back once fleet control returns it to service.', 'ss', 'Kuhlola kufakiwe. Kuhlola lokukodvwa nome ngetulu lokubalulekile kwehlulekile, ngako {unit} ayisekho emgwacweni futsi umphatsi wakho utjeliwe. Khetsa lenye imoto; lena iyabuya nangabe labaphatse timoto bayibuyisela emsebentini.'),
