('The money that moves against fines and charges — {length} entries, net R{fixed}.', 'ss', 'Imali lehamba ngekumelene netinhlawulo nemacala — lokufakiwe lokungu-{length}, sambalo lesiphelele ngu-R{fixed}.'),
('The municipality''s crest: it also appears on report PDFs, report screens in the app and the menu. Use a PNG for the PDFs.', 'ss', 'Luphawu lwamasipala: luphindze luvele kuma-PDF embiko, etikrinini tembiko ku-app nakumenyu. Sebentisa i-PNG kuma-PDF.'),
('The notice could not be saved on this phone.', 'ss', 'Saziso asikhonanga kugcinwa kulolucingo.'),
('The number this member is found by everywhere in the system.', 'ss', 'Inombolo lelilunga letfolakala ngayo yonkhe indzawo esistimini.'),
('The only vehicle is taken. You can continue your shift without one.', 'ss', 'Imoto yinye kuphela itsetfwe. Ungachubeka nelishifu lakho ngaphandle kwayo.'),
('The operational areas that appear beside every officer on the duty board — NR, DR, B, CH…', 'ss', 'Tindzawo tekusebenta letivela eceleni kwesikhulu ngasinye elibhodini lemsebenti — NR, DR, B, CH…'),
('The organisation must keep at least {value}. Until it has them, the current SystemAdmin cannot be demoted or deactivated, and if they are unavailable nobody can manage accounts. A new SystemAdmin needs a second approval; with nobody else to give it, the SuperAdmin decides.', 'ss', 'Inhlangano kufanele igcine nome bancane {value}. Kuze kube nayo, i-SystemAdmin yanyalo angeke yehliswe nome ivalwe, futsi nangabe ingatfolakali kute longaphatsa ema-akhawunti. I-SystemAdmin lensha idzinga imvume yesibili; nangabe kute lomunye longayinika, i-SuperAdmin iyancuma.'),
('The overtime code this section books overtime against.', 'ss', 'Ikhodi yesikhatsi lesengetiwe lesigaba lesibhuka ngayo sikhatsi lesengetiwe.'),
