('The platform sent an insecure (http) stream address, which the browser may refuse. Ask Hikvision to stream over HTTPS.', 'ss', 'Luhlelo lutfumele likheli lekusakata lelingakavikeleki (http), siphecululi lesingalenqaba. Cela i-Hikvision kutsi isakate nge-HTTPS.'),
('The queue is clear.', 'ss', 'Lulayini lusulekile.'),
('The radio always comes back to HikTech, after a restart too.', 'ss', 'Lirediyo lihlala libuyela ku-HikTech, nangemuva kwekucala futsi.'),
('The rank this call sign needs, e.g. ST for the sergeant in charge.', 'ss', 'Sikhundla lesidzingwa ngulolu luphawu lwekubita, sib. ST wasayitsheni lophetse.'),
('The recipient also gets a low-priority alert, phone included.', 'ss', 'Lowemukelako naye utfola secwayiso lesingakabaluleki kakhulu, kufaka elucingweni.'),
