('The register is not set up yet. Run migration 0101 in Supabase, then reload.', 'ss', 'Lirejista alikasetjwa kute kube nyalo. Sebentisa i-migration 0101 ku-Supabase, bese ulayisha futsi.'),
('The register refused this notice: {reason}. Fix it by issuing a corrected notice; this one stays in the sync tray until you discard it.', 'ss', 'Lirejista lencabe lesatiso: {reason}. Kulungise ngekukhipha saziso lesilungisiwe; lesi sihlala elitreyini lekutfumela kuze usilahle.'),
('The report cannot be filed yet:', 'ss', 'Umbiko awukakhoni kufakwa kute kube nyalo:'),
('The report is filed. Its forms show here once it has reached the server.', 'ss', 'Umbiko ufakiwe. Emafomu awo avela lapha nase ufike eseva.'),
('The report on {incident_number} becomes a permanent record — it cannot be edited or deleted afterwards.', 'ss', 'Umbiko ku-{incident_number} uba yirekhodi lelihlala njalo — angeke uhlelwe nome usulwe ngemuva kwaloko.'),
