('The request to send with it', 'ss', 'Sicelo sekutfumela nako'),
('The rules are installed and correct, but no scheduler is ticking them, so no escalation will fire on its own. Either enable', 'ss', 'Imitsetfo ifakiwe futsi ilungile, kodvwa kute sihleli lesiyichubako, ngako kute kudluliselwa etulu lokutawenteka ngekwako. Nome uvule'),
('The same response metrics at every level — organisation, department, area and member. Drill in; the definitions never change, only the calls they cover.', 'ss', 'Tilinganiso letifanako tekuphendvula kuwo onkhe emazinga — inhlangano, litiko, indzawo nelilunga. Ngena ekhatsi; tincazelo atishintji, kuphela tincingo letitimbonyako.'),
('The same screens and powers as now.', 'ss', 'Tikrini nemandla lafanako nanyalo.'),
('The same window cut three ways — by member, by department, by incident type.', 'ss', 'Sikhatsi lesifanako sihlukaniswe ngetindlela letintsatfu — ngelilunga, ngelitiko, ngeluhlobo lwesehlakalo.'),
('The scene', 'ss', 'Indzawo yesehlakalo'),
('The secret is kept safe and never shown again.', 'ss', 'Imfihlo igcinwa iphephile futsi ayiphindze ikhonjiswe.'),
('The server refused it. SMS or call the control room now.', 'ss', 'Iseva iyencabile. Tfumela i-SMS nome ushayele likamelo lekulawula nyalo.'),
('The server took too long to answer. Check your connection and try again.', 'ss', 'Iseva itsetse sikhatsi lesidze kakhulu kuphendvula. Hlola kuxhumana kwakho bese uzama futsi.'),
('The shift types, rotations and teams the planner repeats.', 'ss', 'Tinhlobo temashifu, kushintjana nemacembu umhleli latiphindzaphindzako.'),
('The site is compliant.', 'ss', 'Sita sihambisana nemitsetfo.'),
('The staff register is empty. Import HR’s staff list first.', 'ss', 'Lirejista letisebenti alinalutfo. Ngenisa luhlu lwetisebenti lwe-HR kucala.'),
('The station the call sign works from.', 'ss', 'Siteshi luphawu lwekubita lolusebenta kuso.'),
('The talk button talks on your team’s group; the SOS button raises an SOS. Most radios work without setting up. If a button does nothing, teach it here.', 'ss', 'Inkinobho yekukhuluma ikhuluma elicenjini lakho; inkinobho ye-SOS iphakamisa i-SOS. Emarediyo lamanyenti asebenta ngaphandle kwekusetjwa. Nangabe inkinobho ingenti lutfo, yifundzise lapha.'),
('The team a rotation rosters (A, B, C, D or Red, Blue, Green).', 'ss', 'Licembu kushintjana lokulifaka eluhlwini (A, B, C, D nome Lokubomvu, Lokuluhlata lwesibhakabhaka, Luhlata).'),
('The two PINs are not the same. Enter your new PIN again.', 'ss', 'Ema-PIN lamabili akafanani. Faka i-PIN yakho lensha futsi.'),
('The units duty is given to, and the stations they work from.', 'ss', 'Emayunithi lanikwa umsebenti, netiteshi lasebenta kuto.'),
('The vehicle, item by item: OK, Fault or NIL.', 'ss', 'Imoto, intfo ngayinye: KULUNGILE, Liphutsa nome KUTE.'),
('The yearly entitlement shown on leave balances. Empty for none.', 'ss', 'Lilungelo lemnyaka lelikhonjiswa kumabhalansi elikhefu. Kungenalutfo nangabe likhona.'),
