('These are safe for media and community distribution.', 'ss', 'Loku kuphephile kubetindzaba nekwabelwa emphakatsini.'),
('These email addresses and cellphone numbers come from HR’s staff list.', 'ss', 'Lamakheli e-imeyili netinombolo temaselula avela eluhlwini lwetisebenti lwe-HR.'),
('They accept, then your supervisor approves. Until then your shift stays yours.', 'ss', 'Bayemukela, bese umphatsi wakho avuma. Kuze kube ngulapho lishifu lakho lihlala lilelakho.'),
('They are handed back when you end your shift.', 'ss', 'Tiyabuyiselwa nawucedza lishifu lakho.'),
