('They go back on rosters, and on duty only after their next start of shift.', 'ss', 'Babuyela eluhlwini, nasemsebentini kuphela ngemuva kwekucala kwelishifu labo lelilandzelako.'),
('This account has been deactivated. If you think this is a mistake, speak to your station commander or system administrator.', 'ss', 'Le-akhawunti ivaliwe. Nangabe ucabanga kutsi liphutsa, khuluma nemphatsi wesiteshi sakho nome umphatsi wesistimu.'),
('This account holds a powerful role, so a second SystemAdmin must approve. Nothing changes until they do.', 'ss', 'Le-akhawunti inendzima lenemandla, ngako i-SystemAdmin yesibili kufanele ivume. Kute lokushintjako kuze bavume.'),
('This bodycam will not be issued', 'ss', 'Le-bodycam angeke ikhishwe'),
('This build has no push service configured, so alerts arrive only while the app is open. Report it to your system administrator before carrying this handset on shift.', 'ss', 'Lolu luhlelo alunayo insita yetatiso lesetjiwe, ngako tecwayiso tifika kuphela nangabe i-app ivuliwe. Bika loku kumphatsi wesistimu ngaphambi kwekuphatsa lolucingo elishifini.'),
('This build has no web address configured, so accounts cannot be activated in the app. Use the link on the HikTech website, or ask an administrator to set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.', 'ss', 'Lolu luhlelo alinalo likheli lewebhu lelisetjiwe, ngako ema-akhawunti angeke avulwe ku-app. Sebentisa sixhumanisi kuwebhusayithi ye-HikTech, nome ucele umphatsi kutsi asethe i-EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.'),
('This build has no web address configured, so features that run on the server are unavailable. An administrator needs to set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.', 'ss', 'Lolu luhlelo alinalo likheli lewebhu lelisetjiwe, ngako tintfo letisebenta eseva atitfolakali. Umphatsi kufanele asethe i-EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.'),
('This build has no web address configured.', 'ss', 'Lolu luhlelo alinalo likheli lewebhu lelisetjiwe.'),
