('This device is no longer registered for PIN sign-in. Sign in with your password, and ask your supervisor to register it again.', 'ss', 'Lelithulusi alisabhaliswanga kungena nge-PIN. Ngena ngephasiwedi yakho, bese ucela umphatsi wakho kutsi alibhalise futsi.'),
