('Each call sign is a row: pick the member for it.', 've', 'Dzina ḽiṅwe na ḽiṅwe ḽa u vhidzana ndi mutalo: nangani murado waḽo.'),
('Each call sign is one duty slot: where it patrols, its hours, its break and the rank it needs. Duty Allocation books staff onto these.', 've', 'Dzina ḽiṅwe na ḽiṅwe ḽa u vhidzana ndi tshikhala tshithihi tsha mushumo: hune ḽa fhaṱa, awara dzaḽo, mbuno yaḽo na vhuimo vhune ḽa vhu ṱoḓa. Duty Allocation i ṅwalisa vhashumi kha zwenezwo.'),
