('Enabling a feature never grants a role anything the route matrix and row-level security would not — the two systems compose. Disabling one hides it everywhere and makes its server routes refuse, for this tenant only.', 've', 'U vula tshithu a zwi ṋei mushumo tshithu tshine matrix ya nḓila na tsireledzo ya vhuimo ha mutalo zwi nga si tshi tendele — sisiṱeme mbili dzi shuma khathihi. U dzima tshithihi zwi tshi dzumba huṅwe na huṅwe nahone zwi ita uri nḓila dzatsho dza seva dzi hane, kha uyu muhiri fhedzi.'),
