('Evacuation area', 've', 'Fhethu ha u bva'),
('Every bodycam on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book one out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 've', 'Khamera iṅwe na iṅwe ya muvhili kha redzhisitara, hune ya vhulungwa hone na uri ndi nnyi ane a vha nayo zwino. Vhaofisiri vha bvisa nthihi nga app mathomoni a tshifithi vha i vhuisa phanḓa ha musi tshifithi tshi tshi fhela.'),
('Every change needs a reason and the {kind} typed back. Changes to SystemAdmin, Admin or SystemController also need a second SystemAdmin.', 've', 'Tshanduko iṅwe na iṅwe i ṱoḓa tshiitisi na {kind} tsho ṅwalwaho hafhu. Tshanduko kha SystemAdmin, Admin kana SystemController dzi ṱoḓa hafhu SystemAdmin wa vhuvhili.'),
('Every change, from the audit trail.', 've', 'Tshanduko iṅwe na iṅwe, u bva kha mukondo wa ṱhoḓisiso.'),
('Every check passed so far. Next visit due {date}.', 've', 'Tsedzuluso dzoṱhe dzo pasa u swika zwino. U dalela hu tevhelaho ndi nga {date}.'),
('Every check passed. Next visit due {date}.', 've', 'Tsedzuluso dzoṱhe dzo pasa. U dalela hu tevhelaho ndi nga {date}.'),
('Every closed case: reviewed after its report, or closed without one by the desk, with who and why.', 've', 'Mulandu muṅwe na muṅwe wo valwaho: wo ṱolwa nga murahu ha muvhigo wawo, kana wo valwa hu si na wone nga desike, na uri ndi nnyi na uri ndi ngani.'),
('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted with a blocking pop-up that must be acknowledged.', 've', 'Tshigwada tshiṅwe na tshiṅwe tshi re mushumoni kha {desks} tshi sevhiwa nga popup i thivhelaho ine ya tea u ṱanganedzwa.'),
('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted.', 've', 'Tshigwada tshiṅwe na tshiṅwe tshi re mushumoni kha {desks} tshi a sevhiwa.'),
('Every crew out is on the Active Responders terminal', 've', 'Tshigwada tshiṅwe na tshiṅwe tsho bvaho tshi kha Active Responders terminal'),
('Every crew still out, live. Open a row for the narrative and the timeline.', 've', 'Tshigwada tshiṅwe na tshiṅwe tshi kha ḓi vha nnḓa, zwino. Vulani mutalo u vhona ṱhalutshedzo na mutalo wa tshifhinga.'),
('Every department', 've', 'Mihasho yoṱhe'),
('Every external service HikTech talks to — what it powers, whether its credentials are present, and whether it currently answers.', 've', 'Tshumelo iṅwe na iṅwe ya nnḓa ine HikTech ya amba nayo — zwine ya zwi ṋea maanḓa, arali zwidodombedzwa zwayo zwa u dzhena zwi hone, na arali i tshi fhindula zwino.'),
('Every feed shows a sample video, not the bodycam. Switch it off under Admin → Integrations → Hikvision once the platform is connected.', 've', 'Nyanḓadzo iṅwe na iṅwe i sumbedza vidio ya tsumbo, hu si khamera ya muvhili. I dzimeni nga fhasi ha Admin → Vhukwamani → Hikvision musi phulathifomo yo ṱumanywa.'),
('Every firearm on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book a firearm out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 've', 'Tshigidi tshiṅwe na tshiṅwe kha redzhisitara, hune tsha vhulungwa hone na uri ndi nnyi ane a vha natsho zwino. Vhaofisiri vha bvisa tshigidi nga app mathomoni a tshifithi vha tshi vhuisa phanḓa ha musi tshifithi tshi tshi fhela.'),
('Every form', 've', 'Fomo iṅwe na iṅwe'),
('Every hydrant is in service.', 've', 'Phaipi iṅwe na iṅwe ya maḓi a mulilo i khou shuma.'),
('Every knob has a safe built-in default and hard bounds; a value outside its bounds is clamped, and deleting an override falls back to the default. Every change is written to the audit trail with your name on it.', 've', 'Khunyeledzo iṅwe na iṅwe i na zwi ḓiitaho zwo tsireledzeaho na mikano yo khwaṱhaho; ndeme i re nnḓa ha mikano yayo i a tshimbiwa, nahone u phumula tshanduko zwi humela kha zwi ḓiitaho. Tshanduko iṅwe na iṅwe i ṅwalwa kha mukondo wa ṱhoḓisiso na dzina ḽaṋu.'),
('Every leave or absence is captured under one of these codes. Office-only codes (AWOL, Suspended …) are never asked for by members.', 've', 'U awela kana u sa vha hone huṅwe na huṅwe hu ṅwalwa nga fhasi ha imwe ya khoudu idzi. Khoudu dza ofisi fhedzi (AWOL, Suspended …) a dzi humbelwi nga miraḓo.'),
('Every logged call across your visible silos.', 've', 'Founu iṅwe na iṅwe yo ṅwaliswaho kha mihasho yaṋu i vhonalaho.'),
('Every member: numbers, rank, station, section, contacts and sign-in.', 've', 'Murado muṅwe na muṅwe: nomboro, vhuimo, tshiṱitshi, khethekanyo, vhukwamani na u dzhena.'),
('Every milestone, update, evidence upload and audited action — from the first call{value}', 've', 'Ṱhanganyiso iṅwe na iṅwe ya ndeme, mvusuludzo, u dzheniswa ha vhuṱanzi na nyito yo ṱoliwaho — u bva kha founu ya u thoma{value}'),
('Every module on the platform — what your role and your organisation''s switches allow.', 've', 'Modulu muṅwe na muṅwe kha phulathifomo — zwine mushumo waṋu na zwikhunyeledzo zwa dzangano ḽaṋu zwa zwi tendela.'),
('Every organisation on this deployment. Each tenant’s data, users, configuration and feature switches are isolated at the database — a row in one tenant does not exist for another, on any screen, in any export, in any search.', 've', 'Dzangano ḽiṅwe na ḽiṅwe kha u shumiswa uhu. Data ya muhiri muṅwe na muṅwe, vhashumisi, ndugiselo na zwikhunyeledzo zwa zwithu zwo khethekanywa kha database — mutalo wa muhiri muthihi a u ho kha muṅwe, kha sikirini ifhio na ifhio, kha u rumela nnḓa hufhio na hufhio, kha ṱhoḓo ifhio na ifhio.'),
('Every place assessed on site, added up.', 've', 'Fhethu hoṱhe ho ṱoliwaho fhethu ha tshiitea, ho kuvhanganywa.'),
('Every police report. Search, filter, export, or open one to read it in full.', 've', 'Muvhigo muṅwe na muṅwe wa mapholisa. Ṱoḓani, khethani, rumelani nnḓa, kana ni vule muthihi u u vhala woṱhe.'),
('Every punch, newest first.', 've', 'U dzhena mushumoni huṅwe na huṅwe, hu swa u thoma.'),
('Every recorded action on a case: who logged it, routed it, responded, filed the report and closed it. Audit rows are permanent.', 've', 'Nyito iṅwe na iṅwe yo ṅwalwaho kha mulandu: ane a u ṅwala, ane a u livhisa, ane a fhindula, ane a rumela muvhigo na ane a u vala. Mitalo ya ṱhoḓisiso ndi ya tshoṱhe.'),
('Every report officers file, colour-coded by form. Choose where to go.', 've', 'Muvhigo muṅwe na muṅwe une vhaofisiri vha u rumela, wo khethekanywa nga mivhala u ya nga fomo. Nangani hune na khou ya hone.'),
('Every section, from observations to sign-off.', 've', 'Khethekanyo iṅwe na iṅwe, u bva kha u ṱhogomela u swika kha u saina.'),
('Every site, what it is used for, its risk and when it is due.', 've', 'Fhethu hoṱhe, zwine ha shumiselwa zwone, khombo yaho na musi tshifhinga tshaho tshi tshi swika.'),
('Every stage', 've', 'Ṱhanganyiso iṅwe na iṅwe'),
('Every vehicle is on the road.', 've', 'Goloi iṅwe na iṅwe i badani.'),
('Every vehicle, who is driving it, its last inspection and licence disc. Officers choose a vehicle in the app at the start of a shift; one that fails its inspection comes off the road until it is returned to service here.', 've', 'Goloi iṅwe na iṅwe, ane a i reila, ndingo yayo ya u fhedza na disiki ya laisentsi. Vhaofisiri vha nanga goloi nga app mathomoni a tshifithi; ine ya kundelwa ndingo i bviswa badani u swikela i tshi vhuiselwa mushumoni fhano.'),
('Everyone', 've', 'Muṅwe na muṅwe'),
('Everyone due has started.', 've', 'Vhoṱhe vhe vha tea u thoma vho thoma.'),
('Everyone in each team gets their team''s shifts as drafts. Anyone on leave, booked for court or already on a shift is left out, with the reason below. Issue the drafts when you are happy.', 've', 'Muṅwe na muṅwe kha tshigwada tshiṅwe na tshiṅwe u wana zwifithi zwa tshigwada tshawe sa zwiolwa. Muṅwe na muṅwe ane a vha u awelani, o bugelwaho khothe kana o no vha kha tshifithi u a litshwa, na tshiitisi nga fhasi. Bvisani zwiolwa musi no fushea.'),
('Everyone in the window', 've', 'Muṅwe na muṅwe kha tshifhinga itshi'),
('Everyone inside must leave.', 've', 'Muṅwe na muṅwe a re ngomu u tea u bva.'),
('Everyone is allocated.', 've', 'Muṅwe na muṅwe o kovhelwa.'),
('Everything an administrator needs to answer “is the platform working”, in one place. Each check says what it means, not just what it measured.', 've', 'Zwoṱhe zwine mulanguli a zwi ṱoḓa u fhindula "naa phulathifomo i a shuma", fhethu huthihi. Ndingo iṅwe na iṅwe i amba zwine ya amba, hu si zwine ya zwi kala fhedzi.'),
('Everything delivered', 've', 'Zwoṱhe zwo rumelwa'),
('Everything has been delivered.', 've', 'Zwoṱhe zwo no rumelwa.'),
('Everything is filled in', 've', 'Zwoṱhe zwo ḓadzwa'),
('Everything is filled in.', 've', 'Zwoṱhe zwo ḓadzwa.'),
('Everything on the register for one ID number or one vehicle: fines, payments and when they were made, and what is owed today.', 've', 'Zwoṱhe zwi re kha redzhisitara zwa nomboro nthihi ya ḓivhazwakhe kana goloi nthihi: ndatiso, mbadelo na uri dzo itwa lini, na zwine zwa kolodiwa ṋamusi.'),
('Everything that came in while you were busy, with what still needs your acknowledgement.', 've', 'Zwoṱhe zwe zwa swika musi no farakana, na zwine zwa kha ḓi ṱoḓa u ṱanganedzwa nga inwi.'),
('Everything they recorded stays: incidents, reports and their history.', 've', 'Zwoṱhe zwe vha zwi ṅwala zwi a dzula: zwiitea, mivhigo na ḓivhazwakale yazwo.'),
