('Filing report', 've', 'Hu khou rumelwa muvhigo'),
('Filing resolves the incident. The report is permanent and visible to command and case managers.', 've', 'U rumela zwi tandulula tshiitea. Muvhigo ndi wa tshoṱhe nahone u vhonwa nga vhalanguli na vhalanguli vha milandu.'),
