('Official After-Action Reports. Filing one resolves the incident.', 've', 'Mivhigo ya Tshiofisi ya nga Murahu ha Nyito. U rumela muthihi zwi tandulula tshiitea.'),
('Official insignia belong to the municipality and its services, so the platform ships none — upload each department''s real crest here and it appears everywhere immediately. Until then a monogram badge renders in that department''s colours, so nothing ever looks unfinished. PNG or SVG with a transparent background works best; square crops read cleanest at small sizes.', 've', 'Zwiga zwa tshiofisi ndi zwa masipala na tshumelo dzawo, ngauralo pulatifomo a i zwi ḓisi — longelani tshiga tsha vhukuma tsha muhasho muṅwe na muṅwe fhano nahone tshi bvela huṅwe na huṅwe nga u ṱavhanya. U swika ndi hone bedzhi ya maḽeḓere a u thoma i tshi sumbedzwa nga mivhala ya muhasho wonoyo, ngauralo a hu na tshithu tshi vhonalaho tshi songo fhedzwa. PNG kana SVG i re na murahu u vhonalaho i shuma zwavhuḓi; zwifanyiso zwa sikwea zwi vhalea zwavhuḓi musi zwi zwiṱuku.'),
