('Only approved translations are shown on the screens. Everything else shows in English.', 've', 'Ṱhalutshedzo dzo tendelwaho fhedzi dzi sumbedzwa kha zwikirini. Zwiṅwe zwoṱhe zwi sumbedzwa nga Luisimane.'),
('Only fines I issued', 've', 'Ndifho dzo ṋewaho nga nṋe fhedzi'),
('Only if there is no emergency. Why?', 've', 'Fhedzi arali hu si na tshiwo. Ndi ngani?'),
('Only me', 've', 'Nṋe fhedzi'),
('Only officers who went on duty in the app after today''s start of shift are listed. Distance is straight-line from their last GPS heartbeat; ETA assumes {speedKmh} km/h with a {roadFactor}× road factor (Admin → Operations Settings).', 've', 'Hu ṅwalwa fhedzi vhaofisiri vho dzhenaho mushumoni kha app nga murahu ha u thoma ha tshifithi tsha ṋamusi. Tshikhala ndi mutalo wo livhaho u bva kha siginala yavho ya u fhedza ya GPS; ETA i dzhia {speedKmh} km/h na tshiṱaluli tsha bada tsha {roadFactor}× (Admin → Mbekanyo dza Mushumo).'),
('Only one patient', 've', 'Mulwadze muthihi fhedzi'),
('Only someone senior to the member, in their department, can approve. Nobody approves their own.', 've', 'Ndi muthu wa nṱha ha muraḓo fhedzi, kha muhasho wawo, ane a nga tendela. A hu na ane a ḓitendela.'),
('Only the firefighter leading this incident files its fire report.', 've', 'Ndi mudzimamulilo ane a ranga tshiitea itshi fhedzi ane a rumela muvhigo watsho wa mulilo.'),
('Only the lead officer on this incident can file its report.', 've', 'Ndi muofisiri ane a ranga kha tshiitea itshi fhedzi ane a nga rumela muvhigo watsho.'),
