('The end date must not be before the start date.', 've', 'Ḓuvha ḽa u fhedza a ḽi tei u vha phanḓa ha ḓuvha ḽa u thoma.'),
('The engine has not run yet.', 've', 'Enzhini a i athu shuma.'),
('The file is read on this computer. Nothing is saved until you confirm, and the file itself is never stored.', 've', 'Faela i vhaliwa kha khomphyutha iyi. A hu na tshi vhulungwaho u swika ni tshi khwaṱhisedza, nahone faela nga yoṱhe a i vhulungwi.'),
('The file is read on this computer. Nothing reaches HikTech until you confirm, and then only the rows you confirm. The file itself is never stored.', 've', 'Faela i vhaliwa kha khomphyutha iyi. A hu na tshi swikaho kha HikTech u swika ni tshi khwaṱhisedza, nahone hu swika fhedzi mitalo ine na i khwaṱhisedza. Faela nga yoṱhe a i vhulungwi.'),
('The fine shows on that incident’s record.', 've', 'Ndifho i bvela kha rekhodo ya tshiitea itsho.'),
('The firearm', 've', 'Tshigidi'),
('The firearm checklist is not enabled for your organisation.', 've', 'Mutevhe wa u ṱola tshigidi a wo ngo vulelwa dzangano ḽaṋu.'),
('The firearm did not pass its inspection and has been marked for maintenance. Your inspection is on record. Select another firearm, or tick No firearm, to complete your start of shift.', 've', 'Tshigidi a tsho ngo bvelela kha tsedzuluso nahone tsho swayiwa uri tshi lugiswe. Tsedzuluso yaṋu i kha rekhodo. Nangani tshiṅwe tshigidi, kana ni swaye A hu na tshigidi, u fhedza mathomo a tshifithi tshaṋu.'),
('The firearm serial number is required.', 've', 'Nomboro ya serial ya tshigidi i a ṱoḓea.'),
('The force number printed on the duty sheet.', 've', 'Nomboro ya tshigwada yo gandiswaho kha bammbiri ḽa mushumo.'),
('The heading the sheet prints under. The list is kept in Configuration.', 've', 'Ṱhoho ine bammbiri ḽa gandiswa nga fhasi hayo. Mutevhe u vhulungwa kha Mbekanyo.'),
('The incident record is closed.', 've', 'Rekhodo ya tshiitea yo valwa.'),
('The infringer refused to sign', 've', 'Mutshinyi wa mulayo o hana u saina'),
('The inspection was filed. One or more essential checks failed, so the vehicle is off the road and your supervisor has been told. Choose another vehicle; this one comes back once fleet control returns it to service.', 've', 'Tsedzuluso yo rumelwa. Ṱhoḓisiso nthihi kana u fhira ya ndeme yo kundelwa, ngauralo goloi a i tsheemo badani nahone mulanguli waṋu o vhudzwa. Nangani iṅwe goloi; iyi i a vhuya musi vhalanguli vha dzigoloi vha tshi i vhuisela mushumoni.'),
('The inspection was filed. One or more essential checks failed, so {unit} is off the road and your supervisor has been told. Choose another vehicle; this one comes back once fleet control returns it to service.', 've', 'Tsedzuluso yo rumelwa. Ṱhoḓisiso nthihi kana u fhira ya ndeme yo kundelwa, ngauralo {unit} a i tsheemo badani nahone mulanguli waṋu o vhudzwa. Nangani iṅwe goloi; iyi i a vhuya musi vhalanguli vha dzigoloi vha tshi i vhuisela mushumoni.'),
('The last reading was {km} km. Check the odometer.', 've', 'U vhala ha u fhedza ho vha hu {km} km. Ṱolani odomitha.'),
('The latest reports filed.', 've', 'Mivhigo ya zwino-zwino yo rumelwaho.'),
('The latest views of these bodycams, live or recorded, with the reason given. Every one is also in the audit log.', 've', 'U lavheleswa ha zwino-zwino ha dzi-bodycam idzi, ha tshifhinga tsha vhukuma kana ho rekhodiwaho, na tshiitisi tsho ṋewaho. Huṅwe na huṅwe hu hone na kha logo ya u ṱola.'),
('The lead filed the report.', 've', 'Murangaphanḓa o rumela muvhigo.'),
('The ledger sets Paid and Partially Paid. Entries are never edited or deleted.', 've', 'Ledzha i vhea Yo badelwa na Yo Badelwa Tshipiḓa. Zwo dzheniswaho a zwi shandukiswi kana u phumulwa.'),
('The list of absence types used for leave and on the duty sheet.', 've', 'Mutevhe wa tshaka dza u sa vha hone dzi shumiswaho kha u awela na kha bammbiri ḽa mushumo.'),
('The list of absence types: AL, SL, AWOL and the rest.', 've', 'Mutevhe wa tshaka dza u sa vha hone: AL, SL, AWOL na dziṅwe.'),
('The map could not load. Check your connection.', 've', 'Mmapa a wo ngo kona u longa. Ṱolani vhudavhidzani haṋu.'),
('The money that moves against fines and charges — {length} entries, net R{fixed}.', 've', 'Tshelede ine ya tshimbila u lwa na ndifho na milandu — u dzhenisa ha {length}, yoṱhe R{fixed}.'),
('The municipality''s crest: it also appears on report PDFs, report screens in the app and the menu. Use a PNG for the PDFs.', 've', 'Tshiga tsha masipala: tshi bvela na kha dzi-PDF dza mivhigo, kha zwikirini zwa mivhigo kha app na kha menyu. Shumisani PNG kha dzi-PDF.'),
('The notice could not be saved on this phone.', 've', 'Ndivhadzo a yo ngo kona u vhulungwa kha founu iyi.'),
('The number this member is found by everywhere in the system.', 've', 'Nomboro ine muraḓo uyu wa wanala ngayo huṅwe na huṅwe kha sisiṱeme.'),
('The only vehicle is taken. You can continue your shift without one.', 've', 'Goloi nthihi fhedzi yo dzhiiwa. Ni nga bvela phanḓa na tshifithi tshaṋu hu si na yone.'),
('The operational areas that appear beside every officer on the duty board — NR, DR, B, CH…', 've', 'Fhethu ha mushumo hune ha bvela tsini na muofisiri muṅwe na muṅwe kha bodo ya mushumo — NR, DR, B, CH…'),
('The organisation must keep at least {value}. Until it has them, the current SystemAdmin cannot be demoted or deactivated, and if they are unavailable nobody can manage accounts. A new SystemAdmin needs a second approval; with nobody else to give it, the SuperAdmin decides.', 've', 'Dzangano ḽi tea u vhulunga zwiṱuku {value}. U swika ḽi tshi vha navho, SystemAdmin wa zwino a nga si tsitswe kana a dzimiwe, nahone arali a sa wanali a hu na ane a nga langa akhaunthu. SystemAdmin muswa u ṱoḓa thendelo ya vhuvhili; arali hu si na muṅwe ane a nga i ṋea, SuperAdmin u a tsha.'),
('The overtime code this section books overtime against.', 've', 'Khoudu ya tshifhinga tsho engedzwaho ine khethekanyo iyi ya bukha ngayo tshifhinga tsho engedzwaho.'),
('The patient', 've', 'Mulwadze'),
('The photo on the incident is filed with this report.', 've', 'Tshifanyiso tshi re kha tshiitea tshi rumelwa na muvhigo uyu.'),
('The photo was not saved. Try again.', 've', 'Tshifanyiso a tsho ngo vhulungwa. Lingedzani hafhu.'),
('The pin is in the wrong place', 've', 'Phini i fhethu hu si hone'),
('The platform sent an insecure (http) stream address, which the browser may refuse. Ask Hikvision to stream over HTTPS.', 've', 'Pulatifomo yo rumela ḓiresi ya u phasalala i songo tsireledzeaho (http), ine buraweza ya nga i hana. Humbelani Hikvision uri i phasalale nga HTTPS.'),
('The queue is clear.', 've', 'Mutalo wo kuna.'),
('The radio always comes back to HikTech, after a restart too.', 've', 'Radio i dzula i tshi vhuyelela kha HikTech, naho nga murahu ha u thoma hafhu.'),
('The rank this call sign needs, e.g. ST for the sergeant in charge.', 've', 'Vhuimo vhune tshiga itshi tsha u vhidza tsha vhu ṱoḓa, tsumbo, ST kha sadzhene ane a langa.'),
('The recipient also gets a low-priority alert, phone included.', 've', 'Muṱanganedzi na ene u wana tsevhedzo ya ndeme ya fhasi, hu tshi katelwa founu.'),
('The record you''re looking for doesn''t exist or you don''t have access to it.', 've', 'Rekhodo ine na i ṱoḓa a i ho kana a ni na u swikela khayo.'),
('The recording produced no audio.', 've', 'U rekhoda a ho ngo bveledza mubvumo.'),
('The register is not set up yet. Run migration 0101 in Supabase, then reload.', 've', 'Redzhistara a i athu dzudzanywa. Shumisani migration 0101 kha Supabase, ni longe hafhu.'),
('The register refused this notice: {reason}. Fix it by issuing a corrected notice; this one stays in the sync tray until you discard it.', 've', 'Redzhistara yo hana ndivhadzo iyi: {reason}. I lugiseni nga u bvisa ndivhadzo yo khakhululwaho; iyi i dzula kha thirei ya u rumela u swika ni tshi i laṱa.'),
('The report cannot be filed yet:', 've', 'Muvhigo a u athu kona u rumelwa:'),
('The report is filed. Its forms show here once it has reached the server.', 've', 'Muvhigo wo rumelwa. Fomo dzawo dzi bvela fhano musi wo no swika kha seva.'),
('The report on {incident_number} becomes a permanent record — it cannot be edited or deleted afterwards.', 've', 'Muvhigo kha {incident_number} u vha rekhodo ya tshoṱhe — a u nga shandukiswi kana u phumulwa nga murahu.'),
('The reports', 've', 'Mivhigo'),
('The request to send with it', 've', 'Khumbelo ya u rumela nayo'),
('The rules are installed and correct, but no scheduler is ticking them, so no escalation will fire on its own. Either enable', 've', 'Milayo yo dzheniswa nahone yo luga, fhedzi a hu na mudzudzanyi ane a i shumisa, ngauralo a hu na u isa nṱha hune ha ḓo itea nga hoṱhe. Kana ni vule'),
('The same response metrics at every level — organisation, department, area and member. Drill in; the definitions never change, only the calls they cover.', 've', 'Zwilinganyo zwi fanaho zwa phindulo kha zwiimo zwoṱhe — dzangano, muhasho, fhethu na muraḓo. Dzhenani ngomu; ṱhalutshedzo a dzi shanduki, ndi founu fhedzi dzine dza dzi katela.'),
('The same screens and powers as now.', 've', 'Zwikirini na maanḓa zwi fanaho na zwa zwino.'),
('The same window cut three ways — by member, by department, by incident type.', 've', 'Tshifhinga tshi fanaho tsho khethekanywa nga nḓila tharu — nga muraḓo, nga muhasho, nga lushaka lwa tshiitea.'),
('The scene', 've', 'Fhethu'),
('The secret is kept safe and never shown again.', 've', 'Tshiphiri tshi vhulungwa tsho tsireledzea nahone a tshi tsha sumbedzwa hafhu.'),
('The server refused it. SMS or call the control room now.', 've', 'Seva yo zwi hana. Rumelani SMS kana ni founele rumu ya ndango zwino.'),
('The server took too long to answer. Check your connection and try again.', 've', 'Seva yo dzhia tshifhinga tshilapfu vhukuma u fhindula. Ṱolani vhudavhidzani haṋu ni lingedze hafhu.'),
('The shift types, rotations and teams the planner repeats.', 've', 'Tshaka dza zwifithi, u ṱanḓavhuwa na zwigwada zwine mudzudzanyi a zwi dovhola.'),
('The site is compliant.', 've', 'Fhethu hu tevhela milayo.'),
('The staff register is empty. Import HR’s staff list first.', 've', 'Redzhistara ya vhashumi a i na tshithu. Dzhenisani mutevhe wa vhashumi wa HR u thoma.'),
('The station the call sign works from.', 've', 'Tshiṱitshi tshine tshiga tsha u vhidza tsha shuma khatsho.'),
('The talk button talks on your team’s group; the SOS button raises an SOS. Most radios work without setting up. If a button does nothing, teach it here.', 've', 'Gunubu ya u amba i amba kha tshigwada tshaṋu; gunubu ya SOS i ṱahisa SOS. Radio nnzhi dzi shuma hu si na u dzudzanywa. Arali gunubu i sa iti tshithu, i funzeni fhano.'),
('The team a rotation rosters (A, B, C, D or Red, Blue, Green).', 've', 'Tshigwada tshine u ṱanḓavhuwa ha tshi dzhenisa kha mutevhe (A, B, C, D kana Tswuku, Lutombo, Dalasi).'),
('The two PINs are not the same. Enter your new PIN again.', 've', 'Dzi-PIN mbili a dzi fani. Dzhenisani PIN yaṋu ntswa hafhu.'),
('The units duty is given to, and the stations they work from.', 've', 'Yunithi dzine dza ṋewa mushumo, na zwiṱitshi zwine dza shuma khazwo.'),
('The vehicle, item by item: OK, Fault or NIL.', 've', 'Goloi, tshithu nga tshithu: ZWO LUGA, Vhukhakhi kana A HU NA.'),
('The yearly entitlement shown on leave balances. Empty for none.', 've', 'Pfanelo ya ṅwaha i sumbedzwaho kha bannzi dza u awela. I si na tshithu arali i siho.'),
('The {unitWord} goes for maintenance and your supervisor is told.', 've', '{unitWord} i ya u lugiswa nahone mulanguli waṋu u a vhudzwa.'),
('Theft', 've', 'Vhutswa'),
('Theft of motor vehicle', 've', 'Vhutswa ha goloi'),
('Their age?', 've', 'Miṅwaha yavho?'),
('Their condition', 've', 'Nyimele yavho'),
('Their invitation goes here.', 've', 'U rambiwa havho hu ya fhano.'),
('Their vehicle and registration', 've', 'Goloi yavho na u ṅwaliswa'),
('Theme', 've', 'Tshitaela'),
('Then add its call signs on Call Signs.', 've', 'Ni engedze zwiga zwayo zwa u vhidza kha Zwiga zwa u Vhidza.'),
('These are safe for media and community distribution.', 've', 'Izwi zwo tsireledzea kha midia na u phaḓaladzwa kha tshitshavha.'),
('These email addresses and cellphone numbers come from HR’s staff list.', 've', 'Ḓiresi idzi dza imeili na nomboro dza sele dzi bva kha mutevhe wa vhashumi wa HR.'),
('They accept, then your supervisor approves. Until then your shift stays yours.', 've', 'Vha a ṱanganedza, nga murahu mulanguli waṋu a tendela. U swika ndi hone tshifithi tshaṋu tshi dzula tshi tshaṋu.'),
('They are handed back when you end your shift.', 've', 'Zwi a vhuiswa musi ni tshi fhedza tshifithi tshaṋu.'),
('They come off duty and off rosters straight away.', 've', 'Vha bva mushumoni na kha mitevhe nga u ṱavhanya.'),
('They go back on rosters, and on duty only after their next start of shift.', 've', 'Vha vhuyelela kha mitevhe, na mushumoni fhedzi nga murahu ha mathomo a tshifithi tshavho tshi tevhelaho.'),
('This account has been deactivated. If you think this is a mistake, speak to your station commander or system administrator.', 've', 'Akhaunthu iyi yo dzimiwa. Arali ni tshi humbula uri ndi vhukhakhi, ambani na mulanguli wa tshiṱitshi tshaṋu kana mulanguli wa sisiṱeme.'),
('This account holds a powerful role, so a second SystemAdmin must approve. Nothing changes until they do.', 've', 'Akhaunthu iyi i na mushumo wa maanḓa, ngauralo SystemAdmin wa vhuvhili u tea u tendela. A hu na tshi shandukaho u swika vha tshi tendela.'),
('This bodycam will not be issued', 've', 'Bodycam iyi a i nga bviswi'),
('This build has no push service configured, so alerts arrive only while the app is open. Report it to your system administrator before carrying this handset on shift.', 've', 'Nḓila iyi a i na tshumelo ya ndivhadzo yo dzudzanywaho, ngauralo tsevhedzo dzi swika fhedzi musi app yo vulea. Vhigani izwi kha mulanguli wa sisiṱeme ni sa athu fara founu iyi tshifithini.'),
('This build has no web address configured, so accounts cannot be activated in the app. Use the link on the HikTech website, or ask an administrator to set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.', 've', 'Nḓila iyi a i na ḓiresi ya webe yo dzudzanywaho, ngauralo akhaunthu a dzi nga vulwi kha app. Shumisani vhukwamani kha webusaithi ya HikTech, kana ni humbele mulanguli uri a vhee EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.'),
('This build has no web address configured, so features that run on the server are unavailable. An administrator needs to set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.', 've', 'Nḓila iyi a i na ḓiresi ya webe yo dzudzanywaho, ngauralo zwipiḓa zwi shumaho kha seva a zwi wanali. Mulanguli u tea u vhea EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.'),
('This build has no web address configured.', 've', 'Nḓila iyi a i na ḓiresi ya webe yo dzudzanywaho.'),
('This call has no map position. Mark On Scene when you get there.', 've', 'Founu iyi a i na fhethu kha mmapa. Swayani Fhethu musi ni tshi swika hone.'),
('This cannot be undone. Press again to go ahead.', 've', 'Izwi a zwi nga vhuiselwi murahu. Kwatani hafhu u bvela phanḓa.'),
('This checklist will file as NOT PASSED until every safety item above is ticked. The record cannot claim otherwise.', 've', 'Mutevhe uyu wa u ṱola u ḓo rumelwa sa A WO NGO BVELELA u swika zwithu zwoṱhe zwa tsireledzo afho nṱha zwi tshi swayiwa. Rekhodo a i nga ambi zwiṅwe.'),
('This code can’t be used', 've', 'Khoudu iyi a i nga shumiswi'),
('This code is shown', 've', 'Khoudu iyi i a sumbedzwa'),
('This cycle', 've', 'Mutevhetsindo uyu'),
('This device belongs to another department. Use one of your own department''s devices, or sign in with your password.', 've', 'Tshishumiswa itshi ndi tsha muṅwe muhasho. Shumisani tshiṅwe tsha zwishumiswa zwa muhasho waṋu, kana ni dzhene nga phasiwede yaṋu.'),
('This device is no longer registered for PIN sign-in. Sign in with your password, and ask your supervisor to register it again.', 've', 'Tshishumiswa itshi a tshi tsha ṅwaliswa u dzhena nga PIN. Dzhenani nga phasiwede yaṋu, ni humbele mulanguli waṋu uri a tshi ṅwalise hafhu.'),
('This device is not registered for PIN sign-in. Your supervisor registers shared radios and phones.', 've', 'Tshishumiswa itshi a tsho ngo ṅwaliswa u dzhena nga PIN. Mulanguli waṋu u ṅwalisa radio na founu dza u kovhekana.'),
('This device is not set up for PIN sign-in yet. A supervisor or administrator sets it up once: sign in with a password, open Profile, then Sign-in PIN, then Register this device.', 've', 'Tshishumiswa itshi a tshi athu dzudzanyelwa u dzhena nga PIN. Mulanguli kana mulangi u tshi dzudzanya luthihi: dzhenani nga phasiwede, vulani Profaili, nga murahu PIN ya u Dzhena, nga murahu Ṅwalisani tshishumiswa itshi.'),
('This device is registered for PIN sign-in: {device}', 've', 'Tshishumiswa itshi tsho ṅwaliswa u dzhena nga PIN: {device}'),
('This device no longer signs anyone in with a PIN.', 've', 'Tshishumiswa itshi a tshi tsha dzhenisa muthu nga PIN.'),
('This feed stops in {secondsToAnswer} s to save the bodycam’s mobile data.', 've', 'U phasalala uhu hu a ima nga sekondo dza {secondsToAnswer} u vhulunga data ya sele ya bodycam.'),
('This firearm will not be issued', 've', 'Tshigidi itshi a tshi nga bviswi'),
('This import changes nothing about them. They may have left: review them on the Personnel page afterwards.', 've', 'U dzhenisa uhu a hu shandukisi tshithu nga havho. Vha nga vha vho bva: vha ṱoleni kha siaṱari ḽa Vhashumi nga murahu.'),
('This is a {severity} call. The {desks} dispatch desk can start now with what you have.', 've', 'Iyi ndi founu ya {severity}. Dese ya u rumela ya {desks} i nga thoma zwino nga zwe na vha nazwo.'),
('This is a {severity} call. The {desks} dispatch desks can start now with what you have.', 've', 'Iyi ndi founu ya {severity}. Dzidese dza u rumela dza {desks} dzi nga thoma zwino nga zwe na vha nazwo.'),
('This is your SOS — dispatch is sending help to you.', 've', 'Iyi ndi SOS yaṋu — vharumeli vha khou rumela thuso kha inwi.'),
('This list covers {join}. People in those departments it leaves out are shown for review; nobody is removed.', 've', 'Mutevhe uyu u katela {join}. Vhathu vha kha mihasho iyo ine wa vha litsha vha sumbedzwa uri vha ṱoliwe; a hu na ane a bviswa.'),
('This member has no account yet, so they cannot be given screens.', 've', 'Muraḓo uyu a u athu vha na akhaunthu, ngauralo a u nga ṋewi zwikirini.'),
('This month', 've', 'Ṅwedzi uyu'),
('This month: 1 shift', 've', 'Ṅwedzi uyu: tshifithi tshithihi'),
('This month: {n} shifts', 've', 'Ṅwedzi uyu: zwifithi zwa {n}'),
('This needs the latest app. Install it, then come back here.', 've', 'Izwi zwi ṱoḓa app ya zwino-zwino. I dzhenise, ni vhuyelele fhano.'),
('This page hit an error', 've', 'Siaṱari iḽi ḽo ṱangana na vhukhakhi'),
('This page shows calls sent to you yourself, as a field officer sees them.', 've', 'Siaṱari iḽi ḽi sumbedza founu dzo rumelwaho kha inwi muṋe, sa zwine muofisiri wa tsimuni a dzi vhona zwone.'),
('This phone could not be registered for dispatch notifications. Alerts still arrive while the app is open — report this so the handset can be checked.', 've', 'Founu iyi a yo ngo kona u ṅwaliselwa ndivhadzo dza u rumela. Tsevhedzo dzi kha ḓi swika musi app yo vulea — vhigani izwi uri founu i ṱoliwe.'),
('This phone will not ring for a dispatch. Turn notifications on for HikTech in the device settings. Alerts still arrive instantly while the app is open.', 've', 'Founu iyi a i nga lili musi hu tshi rumelwa. Vulani ndivhadzo dza HikTech kha mbekanyo dza tshishumiswa. Tsevhedzo dzi kha ḓi swika nga u ṱavhanya musi app yo vulea.'),
('This radio is off.', 've', 'Radio iyi yo dzimwa.'),
('This request is about your account, so another SystemAdmin decides it.', 've', 'Khumbelo iyi i nga ha akhaunthu yaṋu, ngauralo muṅwe SystemAdmin u a i tsha.'),
('This role cannot be made with a password: choose email, SMS or a printed code', 've', 'Mushumo uyu a u nga itwi nga phasiwede: nangani imeili, SMS kana khoudu yo gandiswaho'),
('This section has no call signs yet.', 've', 'Khethekanyo iyi a i athu vha na zwiga zwa u vhidza.'),
('This week', 've', 'Vhege iyi'),
('This {file} already holds {MAX_PHOTOS} photos — the maximum.', 've', '{file} iyi yo no vha na zwifanyiso zwa {MAX_PHOTOS} — tshivhalo tsha nṱha.'),
('Throughput for a control-room role''s members — distinct from field-officer scoring.', 've', 'Mushumo wo itwaho nga miraḓo ya mushumo wa rumu ya ndango — wo fhambana na maraga a vhaofisiri vha tsimuni.'),
('Thu', 've', 'Ṋa.'),
('Thursday', 've', 'Ḽavhuṋa'),
('Thursday, first letterT', 've', 'Ḽ'),
('Tick at least one call sign and one member', 've', 'Swayani zwiṱuku tshiga tshithihi tsha u vhidza na muraḓo muthihi'),
('Tick call signs and staff above, then Allocate selected.', 've', 'Swayani zwiga zwa u vhidza na vhashumi afho nṱha, nga murahu Avhelani zwo nangiwaho.'),
('Tick the box: you checked the address and will give the password yourself', 've', 'Swayani bogisi: no ṱola ḓiresi nahone ni ḓo ṋea phasiwede nga inwi muṋe'),
('Tick the box: you checked the {thing} with the person', 've', 'Swayani bogisi: no ṱola {thing} na muthu'),
('Ticket #', 've', 'Thikhithi #'),
('Ticket #{value} ({shortCode})', 've', 'Thikhithi #{value} ({shortCode})'),
('Time', 've', 'Tshifhinga'),
('Time & Attendance', 've', 'Tshifhinga na u vha Hone'),
('Time begin', 've', 'Tshifhinga tsha u thoma'),
('Time end', 've', 'Tshifhinga tsha u fhela'),
('Time logged', 've', 'Tshifhinga tsho ṅwalwaho'),
('Time of arrest', 've', 'Tshifhinga tsha u fariwa'),
('Time of call', 've', 'Tshifhinga tsha founu'),
('Time of incident', 've', 'Tshifhinga tsha tshiitea'),
('Time of offence', 've', 'Tshifhinga tsha mulandu'),
('Time of tow', 've', 'Tshifhinga tsha u kokodzwa'),
('Time on Scene', 've', 'Tshifhinga Fhethu'),
