('Every bodycam on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book one out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'nr', 'Yoke ikhamera yomzimba esesirejistarini, lapho ibulungwa khona nokuthi ngubani onayo nje. Iinkhulu zikhupha yinye nge-app ekuthomeni kweshifu bese ziyibuyisa ngaphambi kobana ishifu iphele.'),
('Every change needs a reason and the {kind} typed back. Changes to SystemAdmin, Admin or SystemController also need a second SystemAdmin.', 'nr', 'Yoke itjhugululo itlhoga isizathu ne-{kind} etlolwe godu. Iintjhugululo ku-SystemAdmin, Admin namkha SystemController zitlhoga godu i-SystemAdmin yesibili.'),
('Every change, from the audit trail.', 'nr', 'Yoke itjhugululo, kusukela emkhondweni wokucwaningwa.'),
