('Every closed case: reviewed after its report, or closed without one by the desk, with who and why.', 'nr', 'Woke umlandu ovaliweko: obuyekezwe ngemva kombiko wawo, namkha ovalwe ngaphandle kwawo lideski, nokuthi ngubani begodu kubayini.'),
('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted with a blocking pop-up that must be acknowledged.', 'nr', 'Woke amaqembu asemsebenzini ku-{desks} ayaziswa ngesiyeleliso esivimbako okufanele samukelwe.'),
('Every crew on duty in {desks} is alerted.', 'nr', 'Woke amaqembu asemsebenzini ku-{desks} ayaziswa.'),
('Every crew out is on the Active Responders terminal', 'nr', 'Woke amaqembu aphumileko ase-Active Responders terminal'),
('Every crew still out, live. Open a row for the narrative and the timeline.', 'nr', 'Woke amaqembu asaphumile, khonokho. Vula umugqa bona ubone ukulandisa nomugqa wesikhathi.'),
('Every department', 'nr', 'Yoke iminyango'),
('Every external service HikTech talks to — what it powers, whether its credentials are present, and whether it currently answers.', 'nr', 'Woke umsebenzi wangaphandle i-HikTech ekhuluma nawo — lokho ewunikela amandla, nange imininingwana yawo yokungena ikhona, nange uyaphendula nje.'),
('Every feed shows a sample video, not the bodycam. Switch it off under Admin → Integrations → Hikvision once the platform is connected.', 'nr', 'Yoke imisakazo itjengisa ividiyo yesibonelo, ingasi ikhamera yomzimba. Kuvale ngaphasi kwe-Admin → Ukuhlanganiswa → Hikvision nayiphulathifomu sele ihlanganisiwe.'),
('Every firearm on the register, where it is kept and who has it now. Officers book a firearm out in the app at the start of their shift and hand it back before the shift can end.', 'nr', 'Soke isibhamu esesirejistarini, lapho sibulungwa khona nokuthi ngubani onaso nje. Iinkhulu zikhupha isibhamu nge-app ekuthomeni kweshifu bese zisibuyisa ngaphambi kobana ishifu iphele.'),
('Every form', 'nr', 'Woke amafomu'),
('Every hydrant is in service.', 'nr', 'Yoke imithombo yamanzi womlilo iyasebenza.'),
('Every knob has a safe built-in default and hard bounds; a value outside its bounds is clamped, and deleting an override falls back to the default. Every change is written to the audit trail with your name on it.', 'nr', 'Yoke ikinobho inokuzenzakalelako okuphephileko nemikhawulo eqinileko; inani elingaphandle kwemikhawulo yalo liyaqunywa, begodu ukususa okutjhugululweko kubuyela ekuzenzakaleleni. Yoke itjhugululo itlolwa emkhondweni wokucwaningwa nebizo lakho.'),
('Every leave or absence is captured under one of these codes. Office-only codes (AWOL, Suspended …) are never asked for by members.', 'nr', 'Amalanga wokuphumula namkha ukungabikho koke kutlolwa ngaphasi kweyinye yeenkhowudi lezi. Iinkhowudi zehhovisi kwaphela (AWOL, Suspended …) azibawwa malunga.'),
('Every logged call across your visible silos.', 'nr', 'Zoke iifowuni ezitlolisiweko eminyangweni yakho ebonakalako.'),
('Every member: numbers, rank, station, section, contacts and sign-in.', 'nr', 'Ilunga ngalinye: iinomboro, isikhundla, isitetjhi, isigaba, ukuthintana nokungena.'),
('Every milestone, update, evidence upload and audited action — from the first call{value}', 'nr', 'Woke umgomo oqakathekileko, ukubuyeleza, ukulayitjhwa kobufakazi nesenzo esicwaningiweko — kusukela efowunini yokuthoma{value}'),
('Every module on the platform — what your role and your organisation''s switches allow.', 'nr', 'Yoke imojuli kuphulathifomu — lokho indima yakho neenkinobho zehlangano yakho ezikuvumelako.'),
('Every organisation on this deployment. Each tenant’s data, users, configuration and feature switches are isolated at the database — a row in one tenant does not exist for another, on any screen, in any export, in any search.', 'nr', 'Yoke ihlangano kukufakwa lokhu. Idatha yomqatjhi ngamunye, abasebenzisi, ukuhlela neenkinobho zeensici kwehlukaniswe kudathabheyisi — umugqa womqatjhi munye awukho komunye, kunanyana ngisiphi isikrini, kunanyana ngikuphi ukuthunyelwa ngaphandle, kunanyana ngikuphi ukufuna.'),
('Every place assessed on site, added up.', 'nr', 'Yoke iindawo ezihlolwe endaweni, zihlanganisiwe.'),
('Every police report. Search, filter, export, or open one to read it in full.', 'nr', 'Woke umbiko wamapholisa. Funa, hlunga, thumela ngaphandle, namkha uvule munye bona uwufunde woke.'),
('Every punch, newest first.', 'nr', 'Koke ukungena emsebenzini, okutja kokuthoma.'),
('Every recorded action on a case: who logged it, routed it, responded, filed the report and closed it. Audit rows are permanent.', 'nr', 'Zoke iinzenzo ezitloliweko emlandwini: ngubani owutlolileko, owunqophisileko, ophendulileko, ofake umbiko nowuvalileko. Imigqa yokucwaningwa ihlala unomphela.'),
('Every report officers file, colour-coded by form. Choose where to go.', 'nr', 'Woke umbiko iinkhulu eziwufakako, wehlukaniswe ngemibala ngokwefomu. Khetha lapho uya khona.'),
('Every section, from observations to sign-off.', 'nr', 'Zoke iingcenye, kusukela ekuqaphelisiseni ukuya ekusayineni.'),
('Every site, what it is used for, its risk and when it is due.', 'nr', 'Iinsiza zoke, ezisetjenziselwa kona, ingozi yazo nokuthi zifanele nini.'),
('Every stage', 'nr', 'Zoke iingaba'),
('Every vehicle is on the road.', 'nr', 'Zoke iinkoloyi zisendleleni.'),
('Every vehicle, who is driving it, its last inspection and licence disc. Officers choose a vehicle in the app at the start of a shift; one that fails its inspection comes off the road until it is returned to service here.', 'nr', 'Yoke ikoloyi, ngubani oyitjhayelako, ukuhlolwa kwayo kokugcina nediski yelayisensi. Iinkhulu zikhetha ikoloyi nge-app ekuthomeni kweshifu; ehlulekako ekuhlolweni iyakhutjhwa endleleni bekube ibuyiselwa emsebenzini lapha.'),
('Everyone', 'nr', 'Woke umuntu'),
('Everyone due has started.', 'nr', 'Boke ebekufanele bathome sebathomile.'),
('Everyone in each team gets their team''s shifts as drafts. Anyone on leave, booked for court or already on a shift is left out, with the reason below. Issue the drafts when you are happy.', 'nr', 'Woke umuntu eqenjini ngalinye uthola amashifu weqembu lakhe njengeenyathelo zokuthoma. Nanyana ngubani osemalangeni wokuphumula, obhukhelwe ikhotho namkha osele asemsebenzini uyatjhiywa, nesizathu ngezasi. Khupha iinyathelo zokuthoma nawanelisekile.'),
('Everyone in the window', 'nr', 'Woke umuntu esikhathini lesi'),
