('Official insignia belong to the municipality and its services, so the platform ships none — upload each department''s real crest here and it appears everywhere immediately. Until then a monogram badge renders in that department''s colours, so nothing ever looks unfinished. PNG or SVG with a transparent background works best; square crops read cleanest at small sizes.', 'nr', 'Iimphawu ezisemthethweni zezikamasipala neenkonzo zawo, ngalokho ipulatifomu ayizifaki — layitjha uphawu lwamambala lomnyango ngamunye lapha begodu luvela yoke indawo msinyana. Bekube kulapho ibheji yeenhlamvu zokuthoma itjengiswa ngemibala yomnyango loyo, ngalokho akukho okubukeka kungakaqedwa. I-PNG namkha i-SVG enendawo engemva ecwebileko isebenza kuhle; iimfanekiso ezisikwere zifundeka kuhle nangabe zincani.'),
