('The K9 deployment: the incident, members and dogs, victims, suspects and medical treatment.', 'nr', 'Ukuthunyelwa kwe-K9: isehlakalo, amalunga neenja, iinlukuluku, abasolwa nokwelatjhwa.'),
('The account can be reactivated later, with a reason.', 'nr', 'I-akhawunti ingavulwa godu kamva, ngesizathu.'),
('The account could not be loaded.', 'nr', 'I-akhawunti ayikghonanga ukulayitjhwa.'),
('The account is active as soon as you create it. You will know {value} password, and they do not confirm their badge number or accept the POPIA notice. Use an invitation where you can.', 'nr', 'I-akhawunti iyasebenza msinyana nawuyakha. Uzoyazi iphasiwedi ka-{value}, begodu abaqinisekisi inomboro yabo yebheji namkha bamukele isaziso se-POPIA. Sebenzisa isimemo lapho kungenzeka.'),
('The account this member signs in with. Accounts are made by invitation.', 'nr', 'I-akhawunti ilunga leli elingena ngayo. Ama-akhawunti enziwa ngesimemo.'),
('The ambulance will go off the road', 'nr', 'I-ambulensi izokuphuma endleleni'),
('The amount was entered by the officer: the charge book had none for this offence.', 'nr', 'Inani lafakwa sikhulu: incwadi yamacala beyingenalo emlandwini lo.'),
('The app hit an unexpected error', 'nr', 'I-app ihlangabezane nephoso engakalindeleki'),
('The app opens by itself when this radio starts, and connects.', 'nr', 'I-app iyazivula nerediyo le ithoma, begodu iyahlanganisa.'),
('The armoury checklist — issue, return or inspect, safety items first.', 'nr', 'Irhelo lokuhlola lendlu yeenkhali — ukukhupha, ukubuyisa namkha ukuhlola, iinto zokuphepha kokuthoma.'),
('The assessment is filed by Disaster Management officers on site.', 'nr', 'Ukuhlolwa kufakwa iinkhulu Zokulawula Iinhlekelele ezisendaweni.'),
('The bodycam failed its check ', 'nr', 'I-bodycam yehlulekile ekuhlolweni'),
('The call', 'nr', 'Ifowuni'),
('The call centre calls this number when you are needed.', 'nr', 'Isikhungo seemfowuni sifowunela inomboro le nawutlhogeka.'),
('The call centre will no longer call you out.', 'nr', 'Isikhungo seemfowuni angekhe sisakubiza.'),
('The call is logged; attach the file again from the incident page.', 'nr', 'Ifowuni itloliwe; namathisela ifayili godu ekhasini lesehlakalo.'),
('The caller', 'nr', 'Umfowuni'),
('The caller’s answer', 'nr', 'Ipendulo yomfowuni'),
('The calls you worked', 'nr', 'Iimfowuni osebenze kizo'),
('The camera did not open. Try again.', 'nr', 'Ikhamera ayivulekanga. Linga godu.'),
('The camera is closed.', 'nr', 'Ikhamera ivaliwe.'),
('The camera is not set up yet. Ask the system administrator.', 'nr', 'Ikhamera ayikalungiselelwa. Buza umlawuli wesistimu.'),
('The camera registry (for the live map layer) is empty. It fills from the i-traffic API once SANRAL issues a key (', 'nr', 'Irejista yamakhamera (yesendlalelo sebalazwe elibukhoma) ayinalitho. Izala ukusuka ku-API ye-i-traffic nange i-SANRAL ikhupha isikhiya ('),
('The camera’s code on the Hikvision platform (cameraIndexCode). Live video needs it.', 'nr', 'Ikhowudi yekhamera epulatifomini ye-Hikvision (cameraIndexCode). Ividiyo ebukhoma iyayitlhoga.'),
('The case file is closed.', 'nr', 'Ifayili yomlandu ivaliwe.'),
('The charge book has no amount for this offence yet. The record notes that you entered it.', 'nr', 'Incwadi yamacala ayikabi nalo inani emlandwini lo. Irekhodi liphawula bona nguwe owalifakako.'),
('The check did not work.', 'nr', 'Ukuhlola akusebenzanga.'),
('The clock register — append-only, corrections are new punches.', 'nr', 'Irejista yewatjhi — ukwengeza kwaphela, ukulungisa kukufaka okutjha.'),
('The command dashboard''s launcher honours these rules too.', 'nr', 'Isithomisi sedetjhibhodi yabaphathi naso siyayihlonipha imithetho le.'),
('The control room is viewing your bodycam', 'nr', 'Ikamuri lokulawula liqala i-bodycam yakho'),
('The court date passed without payment: a warrant may be issued.', 'nr', 'Ilanga lekhotho lidlulile kungakabhadelwa: iwaranti ingakhutjhwa.'),
('The cycle every team works, a day at a time: shift codes ({value}) and a dash for a day off. Each team starts its cycle on a different day.', 'nr', 'Umjikelezo iqembu ngalinye elisebenza ngawo, ilanga ngelanga: amakhowudi weshifu ({value}) nedetjhi yelanga lokuphumula. Iqembu ngalinye lithoma umjikelezo walo ngelanga elihlukileko.'),
('The daily duty sheet for parade. Choose the section, the date and the operation, then print. Times members signed on or off in the app fill in.', 'nr', 'Iphepha lomsebenzi lelanga ngelanga leparadi. Khetha isigaba, ilanga nomsebenzi, bese ugadangisa. Iinkhathi amalunga angena namkha aphuma ngazo ku-app ziyazaliswa.'),
('The dashboard, leave, search and their own profile only.', 'nr', 'Idetjhibhodi, amalanga wokuphumula, ukusesha neprofayili yabo kwaphela.'),
('The data SIM in the bodycam', 'nr', 'I-SIM yedatha ku-bodycam'),
('The day the first team is on day one of the cycle.', 'nr', 'Ilanga iqembu lokuthoma elisekumalanga wokuthoma womjikelezo ngalo.'),
('The day’s sheet to print for parade: sign on, sign off and overtime.', 'nr', 'Iphepha lelanga lokugadangiswa leparadi: ukungena, ukuphuma nesikhathi esengeziweko.'),
('The department administrator sets shift types, rotations and the late minutes. You can put people in teams.', 'nr', 'Umlawuli womnyango ubeka iinhlobo zamashifu, ukutjhentjhana nemizuzu yokuphuza. Ungafaka abantu emaqenjini.'),
('The duty office screens. The systems controller decides who may open each one, and whether they may change it.', 'nr', 'Iinkrini zehovisi lomsebenzi. Umlawuli wamasistimu uqunta bona ngubani ongavula ngasinye, nokuthi angasitjhugulula na.'),
('The eThekwini Fire By-law checks, then what follows.', 'nr', 'Ukuhlola koMthetho Kamasipala Womlilo we-eThekwini, bese kulandela okulandelako.'),
('The electronic vehicle inspection report has been finalised.', 'nr', 'Umbiko we-elekthronikhi wokuhlolwa kwekoloyi uqediwe.'),
('The end date must not be before the start date.', 'nr', 'Ilanga lokuphela akufanele libe ngaphambi kwelanga lokuthoma.'),
('The engine has not run yet.', 'nr', 'Ijini ayikasebenzi.'),
('The file is read on this computer. Nothing is saved until you confirm, and the file itself is never stored.', 'nr', 'Ifayili ifundwa ekhomputheni le. Akukho okugcinwako bekube uqinisekisa, begodu ifayili ngokwayo ayikhe igcinwe.'),
('The file is read on this computer. Nothing reaches HikTech until you confirm, and then only the rows you confirm. The file itself is never stored.', 'nr', 'Ifayili ifundwa ekhomputheni le. Akukho okufika ku-HikTech bekube uqinisekisa, bese kufika kwaphela imigqa oyiqinisekisako. Ifayili ngokwayo ayikhe igcinwe.'),
('The fine shows on that incident’s record.', 'nr', 'Inhlawulo ivela erekhodini lesehlakalo leso.'),
('The firearm', 'nr', 'Isibhamu'),
('The firearm checklist is not enabled for your organisation.', 'nr', 'Irhelo lokuhlola isibhamu alivulelwanga ihlangano yakho.'),
('The firearm did not pass its inspection and has been marked for maintenance. Your inspection is on record. Select another firearm, or tick No firearm, to complete your start of shift.', 'nr', 'Isibhamu asiphumelelanga ekuhlolweni begodu simakwe bona silungiswe. Ukuhlola kwakho kuserekhodini. Khetha esinye isibhamu, namkha umake u-Akukho isibhamu, bona uqede ukuthoma kweshifu yakho.'),
('The firearm serial number is required.', 'nr', 'Inomboro ye-serial yesibhamu iyatlhogeka.'),
('The force number printed on the duty sheet.', 'nr', 'Inomboro yebutho egadangiswe ephepheni lomsebenzi.'),
('The heading the sheet prints under. The list is kept in Configuration.', 'nr', 'Isihloko iphepha eligadangiswa ngaphasi kwaso. Irhelo ligcinwa kuKulungiselela.'),
('The incident record is closed.', 'nr', 'Irekhodi lesehlakalo livaliwe.'),
('The infringer refused to sign', 'nr', 'Owaphule umthetho walile ukutlikitla'),
('The inspection was filed. One or more essential checks failed, so the vehicle is off the road and your supervisor has been told. Choose another vehicle; this one comes back once fleet control returns it to service.', 'nr', 'Ukuhlola kufakiwe. Ukuhlola okukodwa namkha ngaphezulu okuqakathekileko kwehlulekile, ngalokho ikoloyi ayisekho endleleni begodu umphathi wakho utjeliwe. Khetha enye ikoloyi; le iyabuya nange abaphathi beenkoloyi bayibuyisela emsebenzini.'),
('The inspection was filed. One or more essential checks failed, so {unit} is off the road and your supervisor has been told. Choose another vehicle; this one comes back once fleet control returns it to service.', 'nr', 'Ukuhlola kufakiwe. Ukuhlola okukodwa namkha ngaphezulu okuqakathekileko kwehlulekile, ngalokho i-{unit} ayisekho endleleni begodu umphathi wakho utjeliwe. Khetha enye ikoloyi; le iyabuya nange abaphathi beenkoloyi bayibuyisela emsebenzini.'),
('The last reading was {km} km. Check the odometer.', 'nr', 'Ukufunda kokugcina bekungu-{km} km. Hlola i-odometer.'),
('The latest reports filed.', 'nr', 'Imibiko yakamuva efakiweko.'),
('The latest views of these bodycams, live or recorded, with the reason given. Every one is also in the audit log.', 'nr', 'Ukuqalwa kwakamuva kwama-bodycam la, okubukhoma namkha okurekhodiweko, nesizathu esanikelwa. Ngakunye kukhona nakulogo yokuhlola.'),
('The lead filed the report.', 'nr', 'Orholako wafaka umbiko.'),
('The ledger sets Paid and Partially Paid. Entries are never edited or deleted.', 'nr', 'Ileja ibeka Kubhadelwe noKubhadelwe Ingcenye. Okufakiweko akukhe kutjhugululwe namkha kususwe.'),
('The list of absence types used for leave and on the duty sheet.', 'nr', 'Irhelo leenhlobo zokungabikho ezisetjenziselwa amalanga wokuphumula nephepheni lomsebenzi.'),
('The list of absence types: AL, SL, AWOL and the rest.', 'nr', 'Irhelo leenhlobo zokungabikho: AL, SL, AWOL nezinye.'),
('The map could not load. Check your connection.', 'nr', 'Ibalazwe alikghonanga ukulayitjha. Hlola ukuhlanganisa kwakho.'),
('The money that moves against fines and charges — {length} entries, net R{fixed}.', 'nr', 'Imali ekhambako ngokumelene neenhlawulo nemilandu — okufakiweko okungu-{length}, isamba esipheleleko ngu-R{fixed}.'),
('The municipality''s crest: it also appears on report PDFs, report screens in the app and the menu. Use a PNG for the PDFs.', 'nr', 'Uphawu lukamasipala: luvela godu kuma-PDF wombiko, eenkrinini zombiko ku-app nakumenyu. Sebenzisa i-PNG kuma-PDF.'),
('The notice could not be saved on this phone.', 'nr', 'Isaziso asikghonanga ukugcinwa efowunini le.'),
('The number this member is found by everywhere in the system.', 'nr', 'Inomboro ilunga leli elifumaneka ngayo yoke indawo esistimini.'),
('The only vehicle is taken. You can continue your shift without one.', 'nr', 'Ikoloyi yinye kwaphela ithethwe. Ungaragela phambili neshifu yakho ngaphandle kwayo.'),
('The operational areas that appear beside every officer on the duty board — NR, DR, B, CH…', 'nr', 'Iindawo zokusebenza ezivela eceleni kwesikhulu ngasinye ebhodini lomsebenzi — NR, DR, B, CH…'),
('The organisation must keep at least {value}. Until it has them, the current SystemAdmin cannot be demoted or deactivated, and if they are unavailable nobody can manage accounts. A new SystemAdmin needs a second approval; with nobody else to give it, the SuperAdmin decides.', 'nr', 'Ihlangano kufanele igcine okungenani ama-{value}. Bekube inawo, i-SystemAdmin yanje angekhe yehliswe namkha ivalwe, begodu nange ingafumaneki akukho ongaphatha ama-akhawunti. I-SystemAdmin etjha itlhoga imvume yesibili; nangabe akukho omunye ongayinikela, i-SuperAdmin iyaqunta.'),
('The overtime code this section books overtime against.', 'nr', 'Ikhowudi yesikhathi esengeziweko isigaba lesi esibhuka ngayo isikhathi esengeziweko.'),
('The patient', 'nr', 'Isigulani'),
('The photo on the incident is filed with this report.', 'nr', 'Isithombe esisesehlakalweni sifakwa nombiko lo.'),
('The photo was not saved. Try again.', 'nr', 'Isithombe asigcinwanga. Linga godu.'),
('The pin is in the wrong place', 'nr', 'Iphini isendaweni engakalungi'),
('The platform sent an insecure (http) stream address, which the browser may refuse. Ask Hikvision to stream over HTTPS.', 'nr', 'Ipulatifomu ithumele ikheli lokurhatjha elingavikelekiko (http), isiphequluli esingaliala. Bawa i-Hikvision bona irhatjhe nge-HTTPS.'),
('The queue is clear.', 'nr', 'Umugqa uhlwengekile.'),
('The radio always comes back to HikTech, after a restart too.', 'nr', 'Irediyo ihlala ibuyela ku-HikTech, nangemva kokuthoma godu.'),
('The rank this call sign needs, e.g. ST for the sergeant in charge.', 'nr', 'Isikhundla esitlhogwa luphawu lokubiza lolu, isib. ST kasayitjhana ophetheko.'),
('The recipient also gets a low-priority alert, phone included.', 'nr', 'Owamukelako naye ufumana isiyeleliso esingakaqakatheki khulu, kufaka efowunini.'),
('The record you''re looking for doesn''t exist or you don''t have access to it.', 'nr', 'Irekhodi olifunako alikho namkha awunakho ukufikelela kilo.'),
('The recording produced no audio.', 'nr', 'Ukurekhoda akuzange kukhiqize umsindo.'),
('The register is not set up yet. Run migration 0101 in Supabase, then reload.', 'nr', 'Irejista ayikalungiselelwa. Sebenzisa i-migration 0101 ku-Supabase, bese ulayitjha godu.'),
('The register refused this notice: {reason}. Fix it by issuing a corrected notice; this one stays in the sync tray until you discard it.', 'nr', 'Irejista yalile isaziso lesi: {reason}. Kulungise ngokukhupha isaziso esilungisiweko; lesi sihlala etreyini yokuthumela bekube usilahle.'),
('The report cannot be filed yet:', 'nr', 'Umbiko awukakghoni ukufakwa:'),
('The report is filed. Its forms show here once it has reached the server.', 'nr', 'Umbiko ufakiwe. Amafomu wawo avela lapha nasele ufike eseva.'),
('The report on {incident_number} becomes a permanent record — it cannot be edited or deleted afterwards.', 'nr', 'Umbiko ku-{incident_number} uba yirekhodi elihlala njalo — angekhe utjhugululwe namkha ususwe ngemva kwalokho.'),
('The reports', 'nr', 'Imibiko'),
('The request to send with it', 'nr', 'Isibawo sokuthumela nakho'),
('The rules are installed and correct, but no scheduler is ticking them, so no escalation will fire on its own. Either enable', 'nr', 'Imithetho ifakiwe begodu ilungile, kodwana akukho isihleli esiyiragako, ngalokho akukho ukudluliselwa phezulu okuzokwenzeka ngokwako. Namkha uvule'),
('The same response metrics at every level — organisation, department, area and member. Drill in; the definitions never change, only the calls they cover.', 'nr', 'Iinlinganiso ezifanako zokuphendula kiwo woke amazinga — ihlangano, umnyango, indawo nelilunga. Ngena ngaphakathi; iinhlathululo azitjhuguluki, kwaphela iimfowuni ezizimbozako.'),
('The same screens and powers as now.', 'nr', 'Iinkrini namandla afanako nanje.'),
('The same window cut three ways — by member, by department, by incident type.', 'nr', 'Isikhathi esifanako sihlukaniswe ngeendlela ezintathu — ngelilunga, ngomnyango, ngohlobo lwesehlakalo.'),
('The scene', 'nr', 'Indawo yesehlakalo'),
('The secret is kept safe and never shown again.', 'nr', 'Imfihlo igcinwa iphephile begodu ayisatjengiswa godu.'),
('The server refused it. SMS or call the control room now.', 'nr', 'Iseva ikwalile. Thumela i-SMS namkha ufowunele ikamuri lokulawula nje.'),
('The server took too long to answer. Check your connection and try again.', 'nr', 'Iseva ithethe isikhathi eside khulu ukuphendula. Hlola ukuhlanganisa kwakho bese ulinga godu.'),
('The shift types, rotations and teams the planner repeats.', 'nr', 'Iinhlobo zamashifu, ukutjhentjhana namaqembu umhleli awabuyelelako.'),
('The site is compliant.', 'nr', 'Isiza sihambisana nemithetho.'),
('The staff register is empty. Import HR’s staff list first.', 'nr', 'Irejista yabasebenzi ayinalitho. Ngenisa irhelo labasebenzi le-HR kokuthoma.'),
('The station the call sign works from.', 'nr', 'Isitetjhi uphawu lokubiza olusebenza kiso.'),
('The talk button talks on your team’s group; the SOS button raises an SOS. Most radios work without setting up. If a button does nothing, teach it here.', 'nr', 'Ikunupu yokukhuluma ikhuluma eqenjini lakho; ikunupu ye-SOS iphakamisa i-SOS. Amarediyo amanengi asebenza ngaphandle kokulungiselelwa. Nange ikunupu ingenzi litho, yifundise lapha.'),
('The team a rotation rosters (A, B, C, D or Red, Blue, Green).', 'nr', 'Iqembu ukutjhentjhana okulifaka erhelweni (A, B, C, D namkha Okubomvu, Okuzwakazi, Okutjhinga).'),
('The two PINs are not the same. Enter your new PIN again.', 'nr', 'Ama-PIN amabili akafani. Faka i-PIN yakho etjha godu.'),
('The units duty is given to, and the stations they work from.', 'nr', 'Amayunithi anikelwa umsebenzi, neentetjhi asebenza kizo.'),
('The vehicle, item by item: OK, Fault or NIL.', 'nr', 'Ikoloyi, into ngayinye: KULUNGILE, Iphoso namkha AKUKHO.'),
('The yearly entitlement shown on leave balances. Empty for none.', 'nr', 'Ilungelo lomnyaka elitjengiswa kumabhalansi wamalanga wokuphumula. Akunalitho nangabe lingekho.'),
('The {unitWord} goes for maintenance and your supervisor is told.', 'nr', 'I-{unitWord} iya ekulungisweni begodu umphathi wakho uyatjelwa.'),
('Theft', 'nr', 'Ukweba'),
('Theft of motor vehicle', 'nr', 'Ukwetjhiwa kwekoloyi'),
('Their age?', 'nr', 'Iminyaka yabo?'),
('Their condition', 'nr', 'Isimo sabo'),
('Their invitation goes here.', 'nr', 'Isimemo sabo siya lapha.'),
('Their vehicle and registration', 'nr', 'Ikoloyi yabo nokutloliswa'),
('Theme', 'nr', 'Isitayela'),
('Then add its call signs on Call Signs.', 'nr', 'Bese wengeza iimphawu zalo zokubiza ku-Iimphawu Zokubiza.'),
('These are safe for media and community distribution.', 'nr', 'Lokhu kuphephile eendabeni nokwabelana emphakathini.'),
('These email addresses and cellphone numbers come from HR’s staff list.', 'nr', 'Amakheli la we-imeyili neenomboro zamaseli avela erhelweni labasebenzi le-HR.'),
('They accept, then your supervisor approves. Until then your shift stays yours.', 'nr', 'Bayamukela, bese umphathi wakho avuma. Bekube kulapho ishifu yakho ihlala iyakho.'),
('They are handed back when you end your shift.', 'nr', 'Ziyabuyiselwa nawuqeda ishifu yakho.'),
('They come off duty and off rosters straight away.', 'nr', 'Baphuma emsebenzini nemarhelweni msinyana.'),
('They go back on rosters, and on duty only after their next start of shift.', 'nr', 'Babuyela emarhelweni, nasemsebenzini kwaphela ngemva kokuthoma kweshifu yabo elandelako.'),
('This account has been deactivated. If you think this is a mistake, speak to your station commander or system administrator.', 'nr', 'I-akhawunti le ivaliwe. Nange ucabanga bona yiphoso, khuluma nomphathi wesitetjhi sakho namkha umlawuli wesistimu.'),
('This account holds a powerful role, so a second SystemAdmin must approve. Nothing changes until they do.', 'nr', 'I-akhawunti le inendima enamandla, ngalokho i-SystemAdmin yesibili kufanele ivume. Akukho okutjhugulukako bekube bayavuma.'),
('This bodycam will not be issued', 'nr', 'I-bodycam le angekhe ikhutjhwe'),
('This build has no push service configured, so alerts arrive only while the app is open. Report it to your system administrator before carrying this handset on shift.', 'nr', 'Uhlelo lolu alinayo isevisi yeensaziso ebekiweko, ngalokho iinyeleliso zifika kwaphela nange i-app ivuliwe. Bika lokhu kumlawuli wesistimu ngaphambi kokuphatha ifowuni le eshifini.'),
('This build has no web address configured, so accounts cannot be activated in the app. Use the link on the HikTech website, or ask an administrator to set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.', 'nr', 'Uhlelo lolu alinalo ikheli lewebhu elibekiweko, ngalokho ama-akhawunti angekhe avulwe ku-app. Sebenzisa isihlanganisi kuwebhusayithi ye-HikTech, namkha ubawe umlawuli bona abeke i-EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.'),
('This build has no web address configured, so features that run on the server are unavailable. An administrator needs to set EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.', 'nr', 'Uhlelo lolu alinalo ikheli lewebhu elibekiweko, ngalokho iinzinto ezisebenza eseva azifumaneki. Umlawuli kufanele abeke i-EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL.'),
('This build has no web address configured.', 'nr', 'Uhlelo lolu alinalo ikheli lewebhu elibekiweko.'),
('This call has no map position. Mark On Scene when you get there.', 'nr', 'Ifowuni le ayinayo indawo ebalazweni. Maka u-Usendaweni nawufika lapho.'),
('This cannot be undone. Press again to go ahead.', 'nr', 'Lokhu angekhe kubuyiselwe emva. Gandelela godu bona uragele phambili.'),
('This checklist will file as NOT PASSED until every safety item above is ticked. The record cannot claim otherwise.', 'nr', 'Irhelo lokuhlola leli lizokufakwa njengo-AKUPHUMELELANGA bekube zoke iinto zokuphepha ezingehla zimakiwe. Irekhodi angekhe lithi okhunye.'),
('This code can’t be used', 'nr', 'Ikhowudi le angekhe isetjenziswe'),
