('📌 = pinned reporting line · Border colour = tier (Command · Supervision · Operations · Field)', 'nr', '📌 = umugqa wokubika oqiniswe · Umbala womkhawulo = izinga (Ukulawula · Ukuqondisa · Imisebenzi · Isimu)'),
('📍 Request citizen GPS via SMS', 'nr', '📍 Bawa i-GPS yesakhamuzi nge-SMS'),
